acquittance
ACQUITTANCE, s. निस्तारः, आनृण्यं, निष्कृतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

