ACQUITTED, p. p. शुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, मुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

acrid
ACRID, ACRIMONIOUS, a. कटुः -टुः or -ट्वी -टु, उग्रः -ग्रा -ग्रं, अरुन्तुदः<BR>-दा -दं, प्रखरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

acrimony
ACRIMONY, s. कटुता, उग्रत्वं, प्राखर्य्यं.<BR>— (Of temper) स्वभावकटुता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=005-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

