administered
ADMINISTERED, p. p. (As justice) प्रवर्त्तितः -ता -तं, प्रणीतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=007-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

administration
