advance
To ADVANCE, v. a. आनी (c. 1. -नयति -नेतुं), प्रणी, अग्रे नी, पुरस्कृ;<BR>‘to advance an army,’ बलं पुरस्कर्त्तुं.<BR>— (To aggrandize) वृध्<BR>in caus. (वर्धयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To accelerate) त्वर् in caus. (त्वरयति<BR>-यितुं).<BR>— (To pay beforehand) प्राग् विहितकालात् मूल्यं दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=008-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

advance
