advanced
ADVANCED, p. p. (Brought forward) आनीतः -ता -तं, वर्धितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (In knowledge) कृतागमः -मा -मं.<BR>— (In life) गतायूः -यूः -युः (स्<BR>or ष्), प्रवयाः -याः -यः (स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=008-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

advancement
ADVANCEMENT, s. प्रगमनं.<BR>— (Promotion) वर्द्धनं, समुन्नतिः f., उन्नतिः f.,<BR>उच्चपदप्राप्तिः f.<BR>— (In knowledge) विद्यागमः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=008-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

advantage
