agglomerated
AGGLOMERATED, p. p. सञ्चितः -ता -तं, उपचितः -ता -तं, राशीकृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agglutinate
To AGGLUTINATE, v. n. संश्लिष् in caus. (-श्लेषयति -यितुं), संयुज् (c. 7.<BR>-युनक्ति -योक्तुं, c. 10. -योजयति -यितुं), संहन् (c. 2. -हन्ति -हन्तुं),<BR>संलग्नं -ग्नां -ग्नं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggrandise
To AGGRANDISE, v. a. वृध् in caus. (वर्धयति -यितुं), संवृध्, एध् in<BR>caus. (एधयति -यितुं), आप्यै (caus. -प्याययति -यितुं), स्फाय् in caus.<BR>स्फावयति -यितुं), प्रचुरीकृ, स्फीतीकृ, तन् (c. 8. तनोति तनितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggrandisement
AGGRANDISEMENT, s. वृद्धिः f., वर्द्धनं, विवृद्धिः f., उन्नतिः f., समुन्नतिः f.<BR>उपचयः, स्फातिः f., अभ्युदयः; ‘for one's own aggrandisement,’<BR>आत्मविवृद्धये dat. c. or आत्मोदयाय् dat. c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggravate
To AGGRAVATE, v. a. (To increase) वृघ् in caus. (वर्घयति -यितुं),<BR>अधिकं -कां -कं कृ, अतिरिक्तं -क्तां -क्तं कृ, गरय् (nom. गरयति).<BR>—<BR>(To irritate, provoke) प्रकुप् in caus. (-कोपयति -यितुं), प्रपीड्<BR>(c. 10. -पीडयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggravated
AGGRAVATED, p. p. (Increased) वर्धितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Provoked)<BR>प्रकोपितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggravation
