aggregated
AGGREGATED, p. p. सञ्चितः -ता -तं, उपचितः -ता -तं, राशीकृतः -ता -तं,<BR>समवायी -यिनी -यि (न).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggregation
AGGREGATION, s. (The act of aggregating) समाहारः -हरणं,<BR>राशीकरणं, सञ्चयनं, सङ्ग्रहणं.<BR>— (A sum, collection) समूहः,<BR>सन्निपातः, सङ्ग्रहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggress
