aggression
AGGRESSION, s. आक्रमः -मणं, अतिक्रमः, लङ्घनं.<BR>— (The first act of<BR>injury) हिंसारम्भः, अपकारारम्भः, प्रथमापकारः, आक्रमारम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggressor
AGGRESSOR, s. आक्रामकः, अतिक्रामकः, द्रोही m. (न्), प्रथमापकारकरः,<BR>प्रथमां हिंसां करोति यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aggrievance
