agility
AGILITY, s. लघुता, द्रुतत्वं, चञ्चलत्वं, लघुशरीरता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agillochum
AGILLOCHUM, s. (Aloe-wood) अगुरुः m., -रु n., अगुरुकाष्ठं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

