AGONY, s. तीव्रवेदना, अतिव्यथा, व्यथा, अन्तस्तापः, विबाधा, दुःखदुःखं, यन्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agrarian
AGRARIAN, a. क्षेत्रविषयकः -का -कं, क्षेत्रिकः -की -कं, भूमिविषयकः -का -क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agree
To AGREE, v. n. (Be in concord) सम्मन् (c. 4. -मन्यते -मन्तुं), सम्मतः<BR>-ता -तं भू.<BR>— (Assent to) स्वीकृ, अङ्गीकृ, अनुमन् (c. 4. -मन्यते<BR>-मन्तुं), अभिमन्; अनुज्ञा (c. 9. -जानाति -ज्ञातुं), अनुवद् (c. 1. -वदति<BR>-वदितुं), ग्रह् (c. 9. गृह्लाति ग्रहीतुं), उपगम् (c. 1. -गच्छति -गन्तुं).<BR>—<BR>(Settle by stipulation) सन्धा (c. 3. -धत्ते -धातुं), संविदा निप्यन्नं<BR>-न्नां -न्नं कृ.<BR>— (Be of the same mind) एकचित्तीभू, एकमतः -ता -तं भू.<BR>— (Be consistent or suitable) युज् in pass. (युज्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agree
To AGREE, v. a. सन्धा (c. 3. -दधाति -धत्ते -धातुं), सम्मतं -तां -तं or<BR>संविदितं -तां -तं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agreeable
AGREEABLE, a. (Pleasant) रम्यः -म्या -म्यं, काम्यः -म्या -म्यं, सुभगः;<BR>-गा -गं, अभिमतः -ता -तं, मनोज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं, सन्तोषकः -का -कं,<BR>तुष्टिकरः -री -रं.<BR>— (Suitable, comfortable) अनुरूपः -पा -पं।<BR>उपयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, योग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, सदृशः -शी -शं, तुल्यः -ल्या -ल्यं.<BR>— (To be agreeable, please) रुच् (c. 1. रोचते, रोचितुं)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agreeableness
AGREEABLENESS, s. (Consistency with) योग्यता, उपयुक्तता, अनुरूपता,<BR>सादृश्यं.<BR>— (The quality of pleasing) रम्यत्वं, काम्यत्वं, अभिमतता.<BR>— (Resemblance) तुल्यता, सदृशता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agreeably
AGREEABLY, adv. सुखं, अभिमतं, सुभगं, यथाभिमतं, यथासुखं.<BR>— (Ae<BR>cording to) अनुरूपं, अनुसारतस् ind., योगतस ind.<BR>— (Agreeably<BR>to one's nature) सत्त्वानुरूपं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=011-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agreed
AGREED, p. p. संविदितः -ता -तं, सम्मतः -ता -तं, उपगतः -ता -तं,<BR>अभ्युपेतः -ता -तं, अभ्युपगतः -ता -तं, स्वीकृतः -ता -तं, अनुज्ञातः -ता -तं;<BR>‘he has agreed to a separation,’ भेदम् उपगतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agreement
AGREEMENT, s. (Compact) संविद् f., प्रतिज्ञानं, नियमः, संस्कारः,<BR>अङ्गीकारः, उपगमः, समयः, अभ्युपगमः, सङ्केतः, संवादः, व्यवम्था.<BR>—<BR>(Making an agreement) समयकारः.<BR>— (Breaking an agree-<BR>ment) समयभेदः.<BR>— (Concord) सम्मतिः f., एकचित्तता, अनुवादः,<BR>ऐक्यं.<BR>— (Resemblance) सदृशता, अनुरूपता, सादृश्यं, तुल्यत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agriculture
AGRICULTURE, s. कृषिः f., कर्षणं, हलभृतिः f., वैश्यक्रिया, वैश्यवृत्तिः f.<BR>(The science) कृषिविद्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

agriculturist
AGRICULTURIST, s. कर्षकः, क्षेत्राजीवः, कृषकः, क्षेत्रिकः, क्षेत्री m. (न्),<BR>कृषिविद्याज्ञः.<BR>— (A man of the third class) वैश्यः, विट् (श्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aground
AGROUND, adv. उत्तीरस् ind., तटस्थः -स्था -स्थं, सैकतस्थः -स्था -स्थं,<BR>पुलिनस्थः -स्था -स्थं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ague
AGUE, s. कम्पज्वरः.<BR>— (A tertian ague) तृतीयकः, तृतीयकज्वरः.<BR>—<BR>(A quartan) चातुर्यकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ague-fit
AGUE-FIT, s. कम्पज्वराक्रमः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aguish
AGUISH, a. कम्पज्वरशीलः -ला -लं, कम्पज्वरस्वभावः -वा -वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ah
AH, interj. आ, आस्, हन्त, हा, अहो, अहह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ahead
AHEAD, adv. अग्रे, अग्रतस् ind., पुरस् ind., पुरतस् ind.<BR>— (Head-<BR>long) अधोमुखं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ajar
AJAR, adv. अर्द्धविवृतः -ता -तं, अर्द्धोद्घट्टितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aid
AID, s. साहाय्यं, उपकारः, उपकृतं, साहित्यं, शरणं, उपग्रहः.<BR>— (An<BR>assistant) सहायः, उपकारकः, उत्तरसाधकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aid
To AID, v. a. उपकृ (c. 8. -करोति -कर्त्तुं), उपचर् (c. 1. -चरति -चरितुं),<BR>उपग्रह् (c. 9. -गृह्लाति -ग्रहीतं), साहाय्यं कृ, अभिरक्ष् (c. 1. -रक्षति<BR>-रक्षितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aided
AIDED, p. p. उपकृतः -ता -तं, कृतोपकारः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aide-de-camp
AIDE-DE-CAMP, s. परिधिस्थः, सेनापतिसहायः सेनापत्याज्ञावहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aider
AIDER, s. सहायः, साहाय्यकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), उपकारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aidless
AIDLESS, a. साहाय्यरहितः -ता -तं, उपकारहीनः -ना -नं, असहायः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ail
To AIL, v. a. (To give pain) पीड् (c. 10. पीडयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To be<BR>ailing) ईषद्रोगेण, or क्षुद्ररोगेण, पीड् in pass. (पीड्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ail
AIL or AILMENT, s. ईषद्रोगः, ईषद्व्याधिः m., क्षुद्ररोगः, क्षुद्रव्याधिः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ailing
AILING, a. रोगी -गिणी -गि (न्), क्षुद्ररोगपीडितः -ता -तं, व्याधितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aim
To AIM, v. a. and n. (As at a mark) अभिसन्धा (c. 3. -दधाति -धातुं),<BR>उद्दिश् (c. 6. -दिशति -देष्टुं) with acc.; as, ‘aiming at him,’<BR>तमुद्दिश्य; लक्षीकृ.<BR>— (Endeavour after) आप् in des. (ईप्सति<BR>ईप्सितुं), अभ्याप्; सेव् (c. 1. सेवते सेवितुं), उपसेव् निषेव्; समाचर्<BR>(c. 1. -चरति -चरितुं); काङ्क्ष् (c. 1. काङ्क्षति काङ्क्षितुं), आकाङ्क्ष्,<BR>अनुकाङ्क्ष्.<BR>— (To direct the weapon) अभिसन्धा लक्ष्यं प्रति<BR>अस्त्रं क्षिप् (c. 6. क्षिपति, क्षेप्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aim
AIM, s. (The point to which a missive weapon is thrown)<BR>लक्षं, लक्ष्यं, वाणलक्ष्यं, शरव्यं.<BR>— (The direction of the weapon)<BR>सन्धानं.<BR>— (A purpose, design) अभिप्रायः, चिकीर्पितं, आशयः,<BR>काङ्क्षा, वाञ्छा.<BR>— (Conjecture) अनुमानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aimless
AIMLESS, a. असन्धानः -ना -नं, सन्धानरहितः -ता -तं, अलक्ष्यः -क्ष्या -क्ष्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air
AIR, s. आकाशः, वायुः m., नभः n. (स्), विहायः n. (स्), समीरणः,<BR>समिरः.<BR>— (Air in motion) वायुः, वातः, समीरणः.<BR>— (In music)<BR>तालः, मूर्च्छना, निशारुकं.<BR>— (Appearance) रूपं, आकारः, आकृतिः f.<BR>— (Gesture, mien) गतिः f., वदनं, रीतिः f.<BR>— (Manner) विधिः m.,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">Page012-b+ 51</a>]<BR>प्रकारः रूपं.<BR>— (Scent, vapour) वासः, वाष्पः, गन्धः; ‘aloft in air,<BR>विहायसा ind.; ‘to build castles in the air,’ गगनकुसुमानि कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air
To AIR, v. a. (To expose to the air) वायुव्याप्यं -प्यां -प्यं कृ.<BR>—<BR>(To dry) शुष् in caus. (शोषयति -यितुं), शुष्कीकृ, निर्जलं -लां -लं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-balloon
AIR-BALLOON, s. आकाशयानं, व्योमयानं, आकाशवर्त्मना गमनार्थं विमानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-bladder
AIR-BLADDER, s. (Any cuticle filled with air) वायुकोषः, अनिल-<BR>पूरिता नाडिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-born
AIR-BORN, a. वायुजः -जा -जं, आकाशजः -जा -जं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

