AIR-GUN, s. शरादिप्रासनार्थं वायुपूरितं यन्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

