AIR-HOLE, s. वातायनं, गवाक्षः, जालं, वायुच्छिद्रं, वायुपथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

airing
AIRING, s. वायुसेवनं, विहारः, वायुहेतोः परिक्रमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

