AIR-PUMP, s. वायुप्रक्षेपको नालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-shaft
AIR-SHAFT, s. आकरे वायुगमनार्थं पथः or छिद्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

airy
AIRY, a. (Composed of air) वायुमयः -यी -यं, आकाशीयः -या -यं,<BR>वैहायसः -सी -सं.<BR>— (Open to the air) वायुव्याप्यः -प्या -प्यं.<BR>—<BR>(Wanting reality, vain, empty) शून्यः -न्या -न्यं, लघुः -घुः -घ्वी<BR>-घु, अवास्तवः -वी -वं, असारः -रा -रं, चञ्चलः -ला -लं, वायुसमः -मा -मं<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

