AISLE, s. (A path in a church) पूजाशालाभ्यन्तरे पथः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

akin
AKIN, a. (Allied by blood, used of persons) स्वगोत्रजः -जा -जं,<BR>स्वजातीँयः -या -यं.<BR>— (Used of things) सम्बन्धी -न्धिनी -न्धि (न्),<BR>सम्पर्कीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

