ALABASTER, s. श्वेतप्रस्तरविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alack
ALACK, interj. (Alas!) कष्टं, आस्, हा, हन्त, अहह, हाहा, हाहो.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=012-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

