APPOSITELY, adv. स्थाने, यथार्हतस् ind., यथार्थं, सङ्गतप्रकारेण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

appraise
To APPRAISE, v. a. (Set a price on) अर्धं संख्या in caus. (-ख्याप-<BR>यति -यितुं), भूल्यं निरूप् (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं) or व्यबसो, (c. 4.<BR>-स्यति -सातुं), मूल्यनिर्णयं कृ, मूल्यं निश्चितं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

