appraising
APPRAISING, s. अर्घसंख्यापनं, मूल्यनिरूपणं, मूल्यविज्ञापनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

appreciate
To APPRECIATE, v. a. मूल्यं or अर्धं or गुणागुणं or भद्राभद्रतां or सारासारं<BR>विज्ञा (c. 9. -जानाति -नीते -ज्ञातुं), or निरूप (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं), or<BR>निश्चितं कृ or विविच् (c. 7. -विनक्ति -वेक्तुं); ‘one who knows how<BR>to appreciate,’ गुणज्ञः, गुणागुणज्ञः, गुणग्राही m. (न्), मर्म्मज्ञः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

appreciation
APPRECIATION, s. मूल्यविज्ञानं, गुणागुणज्ञानं, भद्राभद्रनिरूपणं, दोषादोष-<BR>बोधः, विज्ञानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprehend
To APPREHEND, v. a. (Lay hold on) ग्रह् (c. 9. गृह्लाति -ह्लीते ग्रहीतुं),<BR>परिग्रह्, सङ्ग्रह्; परामृश् (c. 6. -मृशति -मर्ष्टुं), धृ (c. 1. धरनि धर्त्तुं).<BR>—<BR>(Seize in order for trial) आसिध् (c. 1. -सेधति -सेद्धुं); ग्रह्, धृ,<BR>आक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रामति -क्रमति -क्रमितुं).<BR>— (By the mind) उपलभ् (c. 1.<BR>-लभते -लब्धुं), ऊह् (c. 1. ऊहते ऊहितुं); अनुया (c. 2. -माति -मातुं),<BR>अवगम् (c. 1. -गच्छति -गन्तुं), अवबुध् (c. 4. -बुध्यते -बोद्धुं).<BR>— (To fear)<BR>शङ्क् (c. 1. शङ्कते शङ्कितुं) आशङ्क्; भी (c. 3. बिभेति भेतुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprehended
APPREHENDED, p. p. (Understood) उपलब्धः -ब्धा -ब्धं, अवगतः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Arrested) आसिद्धः -द्धा -द्धं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprehensible
APPREHENSIBLE, ग्राह्यः -ह्या -ह्यं, धीगम्यः -म्या -म्यं, उपलभ्यः भ्या -भ्यं,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprehension
APPREHENSION, s. (Fear) भयं, शङ्का, आशङ्का, सन्देहः.<BR>— (Opinion)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-b" target="_blank">Page022-b+ 51</a>]<BR>मतिः f., बुद्धिः f., बोधः.<BR>— (Seizure) ग्रहणं, आक्रमणं, धरणं.<BR>— (Ar-<BR>rest) आसेधः.<BR>— (Conception) उपलब्धिः f., मेधा, अनुभवः, अनुमानं,<BR>अवगमः, अनुबोधः, उपलम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprehensive
APPREHENSIVE, a. शङ्कितः -ता -तं, शङ्की -ङ्किनी -ङ्कि (न्), शङ्कान्वितः<BR>-ता -तं, कृतभयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprentice
APPRENTICE, s. शिल्पविद्याशिष्यः, शिष्यः, निरूपितकालपर्य्यन्तं शिल्पवि-<BR>द्याशिक्षार्थे नियमपत्रेण स्थापितः or धृतः सेवकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apprentice
