APPULSE, s. आघातः, आघातनं, प्रतिहननं, प्रतिघातः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

appurtenance
