APRIL, s. चैत्रः, चैत्रिकः, मधुः, वैशाखः, माधवः, राधः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

