apropros
APROPROS, adv. स्थाने, यथायोग्यं, यथावसरं, यथावकाशं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apsis
APSIS, s. (In astronomy) मन्दोच्छः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

apt
APT, a. (Fit) उपयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, योग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, युक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, आप्तः प्ता -प्तं.<BR>— (Having a tendency to) expressed by शीलः in compo-<BR>sition; as, ‘disposed to piety,’ धर्म्मशीलः -ला -लं, or by<BR>the affix आलु; as, ‘apt to sleep,’ शयालुः -लुः -लु, or by the<BR>desiderative adjective; as, ‘apt to do,’ चिकीर्षुः -र्षुः -र्षु; ‘apt<BR>to fall,’ पिपतिषुः -षुः -षु.<BR>— (Skilful) कुशलः -ला -लं, दक्षः -क्षा<BR>-क्षं, पटुः -टुः -ट्वी -टु, अभिज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं.<BR>— (Ready, quick) त्वरितः -ता<BR>-तं, उद्युक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aptitude
APTITUDE, s. (Fitness) योग्यता, पात्रता or -त्वं, उपयोगिता, आप्तिः f.<BR>— (Tendency) शीलत्वं, -ता, अभिप्रायः, आशयः.<BR>— (Disposition)<BR>शीलः, स्वभावः, भावः, रीतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aptly
APTLY, adv. यथायोग्यं, योगतस् ind., स्थाने.<BR>— (Skilfully) दाक्ष्येण,<BR>चातुर्य्येण, सपाटवं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aptness
APTNESS, s. (Fitness) योग्यता.<BR>— (Skill) कुशलता, पाटवं, विदग्धता,<BR>चातुर्य्यं.<BR>— (Ability) शक्तिः f., सामर्थ्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aquatic
AQUATIC, a. (Inhabiting the water) जलेचरः -रा -रं, जलजः -जा -जं,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">Page023-b+ 51</a>]<BR>वारिजः -जा -जं, वारिचरः -रा -रं, अम्बुचरः -रा -रं, अम्बुजः -जा -जं,<BR>आम्भसिकः -की -कं, जलोद्भवः -वा -वं, जलभूः -भूः -भु.<BR>— (Growin-<BR>in the water) अम्भोरुहः, जलरुहः.<BR>— (Watery) औदकः -की -कं,<BR>आप्पः -प्पा -प्पं; ‘an aquatic animal,’ जलजन्तुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aqueduct
AQUEDUCT, s. जलमार्गः, जलपथः, जलनिर्गमः, जलप्रणाली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aqueous
AQUEOUS, a. अम्मयः -यी -यं, सजलः -ला -लं, जलसः -सा -सं, अनूपः -पा -पं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

