AQUEOUSNESS, s. सजलता, औदकत्वं, अनूपता,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aquiline
AQUILINE, a. (Resembling an eagle) उत्क्रोशरूपः -पा -पं, गृध्राकारः<BR>-रा -रं.<BR>— (Hooked) वक्रः -क्रा -क्रं, कुञ्चितः -ता -तं, वृजिनः -ना -नं;<BR>‘having an aquiline nose,’ प्रलम्बघोणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arabia
ARABIA, s. यवनः, यवनदेशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arabian
