arable
ARABLE, a. कृषियोग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, कर्षणीयः -या -यं, फालकृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

