arbitrable
ARBITRABLE, a. निर्णेयः -या -यं, विचारणीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

