arbitration
ARBITRATION, s. (Determination) निर्णयः, विचारः, -रणं, निश्चयः,<BR>परिच्छेदः.<BR>— (Mediation) माध्यस्थ्यं<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

