arc
ARC, s. (Segment of a circle) खण्डमण्डलं, वृत्तखण्डं, गोलखण्डं.<BR>—<BR>(Arched gateway) तोरणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arcade
ARCADE, s. (Garden-walk) वृक्षैर् आछादित उद्यानपथः.<BR>— (A street<BR>arched over) इष्टकानिर्म्मिततोरणाकारपटला वीथिः, or धनुराकारेण<BR>पटलेन आवृता वीथिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arch
ARCH, s. (Part of a circle) खण्डमण्डलं, वृत्तखण्डं, गोलखण्डं.<BR>—<BR>(Arched gateway) तोरणः -णं.<BR>— (The arched roof of a house)<BR>खोडकशीर्षं.<BR>— (Vault of heaven) खगोलः, नभीमण्डलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arch
ARCH, a. (Sly, waggish) क्रीडाशीलः -ला -लं, रसिकः -का -कं,<BR>लोलापाङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं, विदग्धः -ग्धा -ग्धं.<BR>— (Chief) प्रधानः -ना -नं,<BR>मुख्यः -ख्या -ख्यं, उत्तमः -मा -मं, श्रेष्ठः -ष्ठा -ष्ठं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=023-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

arch
