argue
To ARGUE, v. a. (To prove by argument) प्रमाण्, (nom. प्रमा-<BR>णयति -यितुं), प्रमाणीकृ, प्रमाणेन or तर्केण or विचारेण सिद्धीकृ; सूच्<BR>(c. 10. सूचयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To charge with, as a crime) दोपारोपं<BR>कृ, अपवद् (c. 1. -वदति -वदितुं), अधिक्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

