ARUNDINEOUS, a. वेत्रकः -की -कं, वेत्रकीयः -या -यं, नडकीयः -या -यं,<BR>वेतस्वान् -स्वती -स्वत् (त्), वेत्रवान् -वती -वत् (त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

as
AS, conj. (In the same manner with something else) यथा.<BR>—<BR>(Like) इव; वत् affixed; ‘to act as a fool,’ मूर्खवत् कृ.<BR>— (In<BR>the manner that) यथा, यद्वत्, यत्प्रकारेण, रूपेण; ‘they did as<BR>he commanded,’ तस्य यथानिदेशं चक्रुः.<BR>— (According as) अनु-<BR>रूपेण, अनुसारेण.<BR>— (So as) यथा तथा.<BR>— (While, at the same<BR>time) यावत्, यत्समये, यत्काले.<BR>— (Because that) यतस्.<BR>— (As<BR>many as, as much as) यावान् -वती -वत् (त्), यावत्संख्यकः -का<BR>-कं or यत्संख्यकः, यति ind.<BR>— (As long as, as far as) यावत्,<BR>आ prefixed with the abl. c.; as, ‘as far as the ocean,’<BR>आसमुद्रात्; ‘as long as the vow lasted,’ आसमापनाद् व्रतस्य.<BR>— Sometimes पर्य्यन्तं or अन्त are affixed with the sense, ‘as<BR>far as;’ as, ‘the land as far as the ocean,’ सागरपर्य्यन्तं<BR>पृथिवी, or सागरान्ता पृथिवी.<BR>— (As soon as) यदा; मात्रात् affixed;<BR>‘as soon as he had spoken,’ कथनमात्रात्.<BR>— (As well as)<BR>यथा.<BR>— (As yet) अद्य यावत्, अद्यपर्य्यन्तं, अद्यापि, एतत् कालं यावत्.<BR>— (As how) यथा.<BR>— (Equally with) तुल्यरूपेण, समं.<BR>— (As if,<BR>as though) इव, प्रायस्.<BR>— (As to, with reference to) प्रति,<BR>प्रतीक्ष्य, उद्दिश्य.<BR>— (As high as) दघ्नं, मात्रं; as, ‘water as high<BR>as the knees,’ जानुदघ्नं जलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascend
To ASCEND, v. n. (Rise up) उदि (c. 1. -अयति -एतुं), अभ्युदि, समुदि,<BR>आक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रमते -क्रमितुं), ऊर्द्ध्वं गम् (c. 1. गच्छति, गन्तुं), उपरि<BR>गम्, उच्चैर् व्रज् (c. 1. व्रजति, व्रजितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascend
To ASCEND, v. a. (Mount upon) आरुह् (c. 1. -रोहति -रोढुं), अधिरुह्,<BR>अभिरुह्, अध्यारुह्, उपरुह्, प्रारुह्, समारुह्; अधिक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रामति,<BR>c. 4. क्राम्यति -क्रमितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascendable
ASCENDABLE, a. आरोहणीयः -या -यं, अधिरोहणीयः -या -यं, आक्रमणीयः<BR>-या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascendant
ASCENDANT, a. (Rising upwards) ऊर्द्ध्वगः -गा -गं, अधिरोही -हिणी<BR>-हि (न्).<BR>— (Superior) उत्तमः -मा -मं, प्रबलः -ला -लं, प्रधानः -ना<BR>-नं, प्रभविष्णुः -ष्णुः -ष्णु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascendant
ASCENDANT, s. (Height, Elevation) ऊर्द्ध्वत्वं, उच्चता, उच्छायः, उत्तुङ्गता<BR>— (Superiority, influence) प्रधानता, प्रभुत्वं.<BR>— (In astronomy)<BR>लग्नं, नाक्षत्रिकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascendancy
ASCENDANCY, s. (Influence, power) प्राधान्यं, प्रभुत्वं, प्राबल्यं, प्राभवं,<BR>प्रभूतता, गौरवं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascended
ASCENDED, p. p. आरूढः -ढा -ढं, अधिरूढः -ढा -ढं, ऊर्द्ध्वगतः -ता -तं,<BR>उपरिगतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascension
ASCENSION, s. आरोहणं, ऊर्द्ध्वगतिः f., ऊर्द्ध्वगमनं.<BR>— (To heaven) स्वर्गारोहणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascension-day
ASCENSION-DAY, s. खीष्टस्य स्वर्गारोहणदिवसः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascent
ASCENT, s. आरोहणं, ऊर्द्ध्वगतिः f., उद्गमः, समुद्गमः, समुत्क्रमः, उदयः,<BR>समुदयः, उत्पातः, उद्वर्त्तनं, समुत्थानं.<BR>— (The way by which one<BR>rises) आरोहणपथः, सोपानं, अधिरोहणी; ‘difficult of ascent,’<BR>दुरारोहः -हा -हं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascertain
To ASCERTAIN, v. a. (Find out) ज्ञा (c. 9. जानाति -नीते, ज्ञातुं), विज्ञा;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">Page027-a+ 51</a>]<BR>ज्ञा in desid. (जिज्ञासते -सितुं), निरूप् (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं), विद्<BR>(c. 2. वेत्ति, वेदितुं).<BR>— (Determine) निश्चि (c. 5. -चिनोति -चेतुं),<BR>निर्णी (c. 1. -णयति -ते -णेतुं), व्यवसो (c. 4. -स्यति -सातुं), स्थिरीकृ;<BR>‘that is ascertained,’ निर्णीयते तत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascertainable
ASCERTAINABLE, a. निरूपणीयः -या -यं, निर्धारणीयः -या -यं, निर्णेयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascertained
ASCERTAINED, p. p. निरूपितः -ता -तं, निश्चितः -ता -तं, निर्णीतः -ता -तं,<BR>निर्धारितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascertainment
ASCERTAINMENT, s. निश्चयः, निर्णयः, अवगमः, निर्धारणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascetic
ASCETIC, s. वानप्रस्थः, तपस्वी m. (न्), योगी m. (न्), तापसः, यतिः m.,<BR>यती m. (न्), वैरागी m. (न्), वैरङ्गिकः, मुनिः, सत्न्यासी m., पारिकाङ्क्षी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asceticism
ASCETICISM, s. वैराग्यं, सन्न्यासः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascititious
ASCITITIOUS, a. अप्रकृतः -ता -तं, असमवायी -यिनी -यि (न्), आरोपितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asclepias
ASCLEPIAS, s. (Moon-plant) सोमः.<BR>— (A drinker of its juice)<BR>सोमपः, सोमपाः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascribable
ASCRIBABLE, a. आरोपणीयः -या -यं, अभिसम्बन्धनीयः -या -यं, दातव्यः -व्या -व्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascribe
To ASCRIBE, (an action, cause, quality, &c., to anybody) कर्म्म<BR>कारणं गुणं वा इत्यादि कस्मिंश्चित् or कस्मैचिद् आरुह् in caus.<BR>(-रोपयति -यितुं), or अध्यारुह्, or अभिसम्बन्ध् (c. 9. -बन्धाति -बन्द्धुं),<BR>or सम्बन्ध्, or दा (c. 3. ददाति -दातुं).<BR>— (To ascribe a fault)<BR>दोषारोपणं, or दोषप्रसङ्गं, or दोषकल्यनं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ascription
ASCRIPTION, s. आरोपः -पणं, अध्यारोपः, अभिसम्बन्धनं, सम्बन्धनं, प्रसङ्गः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ash
ASH, s. वन्यपादपविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ashamed
ASHAMED, a. ह्नीणः -णा -णं, ह्नीतः -ता -तं, लज्जितः -ता -तं, व्रीडितः<BR>-ता -तं, लज्जमानः -ना -नं, लज्जावान् -वती वत् (त्), त्रपितः -ता -तं,<BR>त्रपमाणः -णा -णं, त्रपान्वितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (To be ashamed) लज्ज् (c. 6.<BR>लज्जते, लज्जितुं), विलज्ज्, संलज्ज्; व्रीड् (c. 4. व्रीड्यति, व्रीडितुं);<BR>त्रप् (c. 1. त्रपते, त्रपितुं), अपत्रप्, व्यपत्रप्; ह्नी (c. 3. जिह्नेति, ह्नेतुं),<BR>with abl. or gen. of the thing of which one is ashamed.<BR>To be ashamed of any thing, may be expressed by<BR>किञ्चिद् लज्जास्पदं ज्ञा.<BR>— (To make ashamed) ह्री in caus. ह्रेप-<BR>यति -यितु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ash-coloured
ASH-COLOURED, a. भरमवर्णः -र्णा -र्णं, पांशुवर्णः -र्णा -र्णं, पाण्डुः -ण्डुः -ण्डु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ashen
ASHEN, a. पूर्व्वोक्तपादपनिर्म्मितः -ता -तं or -मयः -मयी -मयं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ashes
ASHES, s. भस्म n. (न्), भसितं, भूतिः f., पांशुः m., अर्व्वटं; ‘to reduce<BR>to ashes,’ भस्मसात् कृ; ‘reducing to ashes,’ भस्मीकरणं; ‘re-<BR>duced to ashes,’ भस्मसात्कृतः -ता -तं, भस्मीभूतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ash-wednesday
ASH-WEDNESDAY, s. चत्वारिंशद्दिनपर्य्यन्तं महोपवासस्य प्रथमदिवसः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ashore
ASHORE, adv. उत्तीरस् ind., तीरे, तटे, वेलायां, तटस्थः -स्था -स्थं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ashy
ASHY, a. भास्मनः -नी -नं, पांशुवर्णः -र्णा -र्णं.<BR>— (Turned into ashes)<BR>भस्मीकृतः -ता -तं, भस्मलिप्तः -प्ता -प्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aside
ASIDE, adv. (On one side) एकपार्श्वे.<BR>— (To another side) अन्य-<BR>पार्श्वे.<BR>— (By the side) पार्श्वतस् ind.<BR>— (In private, in conceal-<BR>ment) निभृते, एकान्ते.<BR>— (In stage language) स्वगतं, आत्मगतं,<BR>अपवार्य्य, विजने, जनान्तिकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asinine
ASININE, a. गर्द्दभीयः -या -यं, खरसम्बन्धकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ask
To ASK, v. a. (To beg, request) याच् (c. 1. याचति -ते, याचितुं),<BR>अभियाच्, प्रयाच्, सम्प्रयाच्, संयाच्, अर्थ् (c. 10. अर्थयते -यितुं), अभ्यर्थ्,<BR>प्रार्थ्, सम्प्रार्थ्; भिक्ष् (c. 1. भिक्षते, भिक्षितुं).<BR>— (To ask a ques-<BR>tion, inquire) प्रच्छ् (c. 6. पृच्छति प्रष्टुं), अनुप्रच्छ्, समनुप्रच्छ्, परिप्रच्छ्;<BR>ज्ञा in des. (जिज्ञासते, जिज्ञासितुं), अनुयुज् (c. 7. -युनक्ति -युंक्ते -योक्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asked
ASKED, p. p. अर्थितः -ता -तं, प्रार्थितः -ता -तं, अभ्यर्थितः -ता -तं, याचितः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">Page027-b+ 51</a>]<BR>-ता -तं, प्रयाचितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Questioned) पृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, अनुयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

askance
ASKANCE, ASKAUNCE, ASKAUNTE, adv. साचि ind., तिरस् ind., तिर्य्यक्<BR>ind., तिरश्चीनः -ना -नं.<BR>— (Looking askance) साचिविलोकी -किनी<BR>-कि (न्), लोलापाङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं, अपाङ्गदर्शी -र्शिनी -र्शि (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asker
ASKER, s. (Petitioner) प्रार्थकः, याचकः, अर्थी m. (न्).<BR>— (Inquirer)<BR>प्रष्टा m. (ष्टृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

askew
ASKEW, adv. तिरस्, साचि, तिर्य्यक्, तिरश्चीनः -ना -नं, साचीकृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asking
ASKING, s. याच्ञा, याचना, अर्थना, प्रार्थनं -ना, अभ्यर्थना, अभिशस्तिः f.<BR>— (Questioning) प्रच्छना, जिज्ञासा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aslant
ASLANT, adv. आवर्ज्य ind., तिर्य्यक् ind., वक्रं, जिह्मं, अनृजु, कुटिलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asleep
ASLEEP, a. सुप्तः -प्ता -प्तं, निद्राणः -णा -णं, शयितः -ता -तं, प्रसुप्तः -प्ता -प्तं,<BR>निद्रितः -ता -तं, शयानः -ना -नं, निद्रालसः -सा -सं.<BR>— (Fast asleep)<BR>सुषुप्तः -प्ता -प्तं.<BR>— (To fall asleep) स्वप् (c. 2. स्वपिति, स्वपितुं), प्रस्वप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aslope
