asoca
AŚOCA, s. (Flower) अशोकः, वञ्जुलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asp
ASP, ASPIC, s. अतिविषालुः क्षुद्रसर्पप्रभेदः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=027-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asparagus
