assailable
ASSAILABLE, आक्रमणीयः -या -यं, अभियोज्यः -ज्या -ज्यं, आसादनीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assailant
