assailed
ASSAILED, p. p. आक्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, अभियुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, उपद्रुतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assassin
ASSASSIN, s. घातकः, हन्ता m. (न्तृ), नृघातकः, बधकः, बधोद्यतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

