assembled
ASSEMBLED, p. p. मिलितः -ता -तं, समेतः -ता -तं, समागतः -ता -तं, समु-<BR>पागतः -ता -तं, संहतः -ता -तं, समूढः -ढा -ढं, समवेतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assembling
ASSEMBLING, s. मिलनं, सङ्गमः, समागमः, समागतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assembly
ASSEMBLY, s. सभा, सदः n. (स्), समज्या, समाजः, परिपद् f., समागमः,<BR>संसद् f., गोष्ठी f., समूहः, मेलकः, मेलः, सन्निवेशः; ‘an assembly<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">Page028-b+ 51</a>]<BR>of lords or nobles,’ शिष्टसभा.<BR>— (A collection) समाहारः, समुच्चयः,<BR>सन्निपातः, समुदयः, समवायः, संहारः, समूहः.<BR>— (A party) पंक्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assembly-room
ASSEMBLY-ROOM, s. समागमस्थानं, सभाशाला, इन्द्रकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assent
ASSENT, s. सम्मतिः f., अनुमतिः f., सम्मतं, अनुज्ञा, प्रतिग्रहः, परिग्रहः,<BR>स्वीकारः, अङ्गीकारः, प्रतिश्रवः, समनुज्ञानं, अनुवादः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assent
To ASSENT, v. n. अनुज्ञा (c. 9. -जानाति -ज्ञातुं), अनुमन् (c. 4. -मन्यति<BR>-ते -मन्तुं), सम्मन्, प्रतिग्रह् (c. 9. -गृह्लाति -गृह्लीते -ग्रहीतुं), स्वीकृ,<BR>अङ्गीकृ, उरीकृ, सम्प्रतीष् (c. 6. -इच्छति -एष्टुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assentation
ASSENTATION, s. स्वीकरणं, चाटुकारः, अनुरोधः, अनुवृत्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assented
ASSENTED, p. p. अनुमतः -ता -तं, सम्मतः -ता -तं, अनुज्ञातः -ता -तं,<BR>प्रतिश्रुतः -ता -तं, समनुज्ञातः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assenter
ASSENTER, s. अनुमन्ता m. (न्तृ), अनुवादकः, अनुज्ञाता m. (तृ), स्वीकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assert
To ASSERT, v. a. (To maintain) दार्ढ्येन वद् (c. 1. वद्ति, वदितुं).<BR>—<BR>(To affirm) वद्, तथेति ब्रू (c. 2. ब्रवीति, ब्रूते, वक्तुं)<BR>— (To claim)<BR>ममेति वद्, स्वीकृ, स्वस्वत्वं ज्ञा in caus. (ज्ञापयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assertion
ASSERTION, s. (The act of asserting) वचनं, उक्तिः f.<BR>— (The po-<BR>sition advanced) वचनं, वाक्यं, उक्तवाक्यं.<BR>— (The first part of<BR>an argument) प्रतिज्ञा, पूर्व्वपक्षः, पक्षः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assess
To ASSESS, v. a. राजस्वं or करं or शुल्कं दा in caus. (दापयति -यितुं),<BR>or ग्रह् (c. 9. गृह्लाति, ग्रहीतुं), or अवहृ in caus. (-हारयति -यितुं),<BR>or स्था in caus. (स्थापयति -यितुं), or निरूप् (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assessment
ASSESSMENT, s. करग्रहणं, शुल्कग्रहणं, राजस्वग्रहणं.<BR>— (The sum levied)<BR>करः, शुल्कः, शुल्कं, राजस्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assessor
ASSESSOR, s. (One who sits by) सभ्यः, सभासद् m., उपासिता m. (तृ),<BR>उपासीनः.<BR>— (Tax-gatherer) करग्रहः, शुल्कग्राही m. (न्), राज-<BR>स्वनिरूपकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assets
ASSETS, s. मृतजनस्य ऋणशोधनार्थं अवशिष्टधनं.<BR>— (Goods) अर्थः, विभवः,<BR>सम्पत्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=028-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assever
