ASSIGNMENT, s. (Of goods) निबन्धनं, समर्पणं.<BR>— (Appointment)<BR>नियोजनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

