assimilation
ASSIMILATION, s. (The act of) समीकरणं, तुल्यीकरणं.<BR>— (The state<BR>of) समता, समानता, तुल्यता, साम्यं.<BR>— (Of food) परिणामः, परिणतत्वं,<BR>विपाकः, परिपक्वता.<BR>— (Of fractions) भागजातिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assimulate
To ASSIMULATE, v. a. छल् (nom. छलयति -यितुं), छद्म or कपटं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

