ASSIMULATION, s. छलनं, कपटः -टं, छद्म n. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

