assistance
ASSISTANCE, s. उपकारः, उपकारिता, उपकृतं, साहाय्यं, साहित्यं, उपग्रहः,<BR>अनुग्रहः, पक्षपातः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assistant
ASSISTANT, s. उपकारी m. (न्), उपकारकः, साहाय्यकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), सहायः,<BR>उत्तरसाधकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assisted
ASSISTED, p. p. उपकृतः -ता -तं, कृतोपकारः -रा -रं, उपचरितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assize
ASSIZE, s. (A court of justice) दोषादोषविचारसभा, दण्डयोगसभा,<BR>दण्डप्रणयनसभा.<BR>— (Market rate, measure) आपणिकः, अर्घबलाबलं,<BR>परिमाणं, मानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assize
