associate
ASSOCIATE, s. (A partner, confederate) सहायः, सङ्गी m. (न्),<BR>अनुषङ्गी m. (न्), उत्सङ्गी m. (न्), सहकारी m. (न्), सजूः m. (-जुस्),<BR>सहवासी m. (न्).<BR>— (A companion, equal) वयस्यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

associate
