ASTERN, adv. नावः पश्चद्भागं or पश्चिमभागं प्रति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

