auxiliary
AUXILIARY, a. उपकारकः -का -कं or -री -रिणी -रि (न्), सहकारी<BR>-रिणी -रि (न्), उत्तरसाधकः -का -कं.<BR>— (Auxiliary verb) गौणक्रिया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

avail
