avail
AVAIL, s. (Use) प्रयोजनं, उपयोगः.<BR>— (Profit) फलं, हितं, लाभः, साफल्यं,<BR>अर्थः.<BR>— (Aid) उपकारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=033-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

available
