AWN, s. (A beard of corn) शूकः -कं, शस्यशूकं, किंशारुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

