bailable
BAILABLE, a. यो लग्नकं दत्त्वा मोक्तुं शक्यते or शक्यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bailiff
BAILIFF, s. (An officer who arrests) आसेद्धा m. (द्धृ), आसेधकर्त्ता<BR>m. (र्त्तृ), ग्राहकः, यष्टिधरः, दण्डनायकः.<BR>— (A steward) कार्य्याधीशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bailment
BAILMENT, s. आक्षेपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bairn
BAIRN, s. बालः, बालकः, शिशुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bait
To BAIT, v. a. (To put meat on a hook to tempt animals)<BR>मत्स्यादिग्रहणार्थं वडिशे आमिषादि निधा (c. 3. -दधाति -धातुं), or नि-<BR>विश् in caus. (-वेशयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To give food to horses on<BR>the road) मध्ययाने यवादिना वाहनानि भुज् in caus. (भोजयति<BR>यितुं), यानश्रान्तानि वाहनानि विश्रम् in caus. (-श्रामयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To incite dogs to attack a bull) वृषभम् आक्रमितुं कुक्कुरान्<BR>प्रचुद् in caus. (-चोदयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bait
To BAIT, v. n. (To stop on the road for refreshment) मध्ययाने<BR>भोजनार्थं विश्रम् (c. 4. -श्राम्यति -श्रमितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bait
BAIT, s. मत्स्यग्रहणार्थं यद् आमिषं वडिशे निवेश्यते.<BR>— (Temptation)<BR>प्रलोभनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baize
BAIZE, s. शाणं, कम्बलः, ऊर्णामयो वस्त्रविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bake
To BAKE, v. a. आपाके or कन्दौ or चुल्लौ पच् (c. 1. पचति, पक्तुं) or<BR>तप् (c. 1. तपति, तप्तुं, c. 10. तापयति -यितुं) or भ्रज्ज् (c. 6. भृज्जति,<BR>भ्रष्टुं), कान्दवीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bake
To BAKE, v. n. (To be heated) तष् in pass. (तष्यते), पच् in pass.<BR>(पच्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baked
BAKED, p. p. कान्दवः -वा -वं, उख्यः -ख्या -ख्यं, कन्दुपक्वः -क्वा -क्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bakehouse
BAKEHOUSE, s. आपाकः, कन्दुः m. f., पूपागारं, पूपशाला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bake-meats
BAKE-MEATS, s. कान्दवं, कान्दवान्नं, उख्यं, पक्वान्नं, आपूपिकं, शाष्कुलिकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baker
BAKER, s. आपूपिकः, कान्दविकः, मोदककृत्, भक्ष्यकारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baking
BAKING, s. कन्दुपचनं, चुल्लिपचनं, पचनं, तपनं, तापनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balance
BALANCE, s. (Scales) तुला, मापनः, मापनदण्डं, तौलं, तौलदण्डं.<BR>— (The<BR>act of comparing two things in the mind) विवेचनं, विकल्पनं,<BR>विगणनं, उपमानं.<BR>— (That which is wanting to make two<BR>parts of an account even) अवशेषः, शेषं, शेषभागः, अधिकांशः,<BR>न्यूनांशः.<BR>— (Equipoise) तुल्यता, भारतुल्यता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balance
To BALANCE, v. a. (To weigh in a balance) तुल् (nom. तुलयति<BR>यितुं), तूल् (c. 10. तूलयति).<BR>— (In the mind) विकॢप् in caus.<BR>(-कल्पयति -यितुं), विगण् (c. 10. -गणयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To equipoise)<BR>समीकृ, तुल्यभारं -रां -रं कृ.<BR>— (To regulate an account) शुघ् in<BR>caus. (शोधयति -यितुं), समीकृ, अपनयनं कृ, विगणनं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balance
To BALANCE, v. n. (To hesitate, fluctuate) दोल (nom. दोलायते<BR>यितुं), विकॢप् (c. 1. -कल्पते -कल्पितुं).<BR>— (To be equipollent) समीभू,<BR>तुल्यीभू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balanced
BALANCED, p. p. तुलितः -ता -तं, समीकृतः -ता -तं, तुल्यभारः -रा -रं.<BR>—<BR>(As an account) शोधितः -ता -तं, अपनीतः -ता -तं, विगणितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balarama
BALARĀMA, s. (A celebrated demigod, half-brother to Kṛṣṇa,<BR>and the third of the Rāmas; and considered to be<BR>the eighth avatār of Viṣṇu) बलरामः, बलदेवः, रामः.<BR>— As<BR>elder brother of Kṛṣṇa) अच्युताग्रजः.<BR>— (As armed with a<BR>plough-share) हलायुधः, हलभृत् m., हली m. (न्), सीरपाणिः,<BR>सङ्कर्षणः.<BR>— (As carrying a pestle-like club) मुसली m. (न्).<BR>—<BR>(As having the palm for a banner) तालध्वजः, तालाङ्कः.<BR>— (As<BR>diverting the stream of the Yamunā) कालिन्दीभेदनः.<BR>— (As<BR>dressed in blue) नीलाम्बरः.<BR>— (As husband of Revatī) रेवती-<BR>रमणः.<BR>— (As killer of a certain demon) प्रलम्बघ्नः.<BR>— (As guar-<BR>dian of Kāma) कामपालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balcony
BALCONY, s. वरण्डः, इन्द्रकोषः, प्रग्रीवः -वं, निष्काशः, वितर्द्धिः f. or -र्द्धी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bald
BALD, a. (Without hair) मुण्डः -ण्डा -ण्डं, मुण्डितः -ता -तं, अकेशः -शा<BR>-शं, विकेशः -शी -शं, केशहीनः -ना -नं.<BR>— (Without natural co-<BR>vering) अनावृतः -ता -तं, विवृतः -ता -तं, नग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं.<BR>— (Un-<BR>adorned, inelegant) असंस्कृतः -ता -तं, अपरिष्कृतः -ता -तं, असभ्यः<BR>-भ्या -भ्यं.<BR>— (As style) अलङ्कारहीनः -ना -नं, अव्यञ्जनः -ना -नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balderdash
BALDERDASH, s. (Any thing jumbled together) प्रकीर्णकं.<BR>— (Non-<BR>sense) अनर्थकवाक्यं, आलस्यवचनं, वृथाकथा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baldness
BALDNESS, s. मौण्ड्यं, मुण्डता, अकेशत्वं.<BR>— (Inelegance) असभ्यता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bald-pated
BALD-PATED, a. मुण्डितशिराः -राः -रः (स्), मुण्डमस्तकः -का -कं, नग्न-<BR>मस्तकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baldrick
BALDRICK, s. (A girdle) मेखला, काञ्ची.<BR>— (The zodiac) राशिचक्रं,<BR>राशिमण्डलं, लग्नमण्डलं, ज्योतिश्चक्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bale
BALE, s. भाण्डकं, भाण्डं, द्रव्यकूर्च्चं, पोटलिका, द्रव्यपोट्टली, भारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bale
To BALE, v. a. (To make up into a bale) भाण्डं कृ, द्रव्याणि कूर्च्चीकृ.<BR>(To bale out water) अब्भ्रिणा or द्रोण्या जलम् उत्क्षिप् (c. 6.<BR>-क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं) or उत्तुल् (c. 10. -तोलयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baleful
BALEFUL, a. (Full of misery) क्लेशी -शिनी -शि (न्), दुःखी -खिनी<BR>-खि (न्), सशोकः -का -कं, शोकान्वितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Destructive)<BR>नाशी -शिनी -शि (न्), आत्पयिकः -की -कं, प्राणहरः -रा -रं, क्लेशकः -की<BR>-कं, हिंस्रः -स्रा -स्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balefully
BALEFULLY, adv. सशोकं, सक्लेशं, दुःखेन, यथा हिंसा जायते तथा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baling-vessel
BALING-VESSEL, s. सेकपात्रं, सेचनं, सेक्त्रं, अब्भ्रि n., अभ्रिः f., अम्बुसेचनी,<BR>द्रोणिः f., -णी, अवगादः, काष्ठकुद्दालः, काष्ठाम्बुवाहिनी f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balk
BALK, s. (A ridge of land left unploughed) सेतुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balk
To BALK v. a. (To frustrate, disappoint) खण्ड् (c. 10. खण्डयति<BR>-यितुं), प्रतिहन् (c. 2. -हन्ति -हन्तुं), वृथा कृ, मुधा कृ, भग्नाशं -शां -शं<BR>कृ, मोघाशं -शां -शं कृ, व्यर्थीकृ, मोघीकृ, वञ्च् in caus. (वञ्चयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

