ball
BALL, s. (Any thing round) गोलः -लं, मण्डलं, परिमण्डलं, गोलकः,<BR>वर्त्तुलः, निघः, पिण्डं.<BR>— (The ball of the earth) भूगोलः, भूमण्डलं.<BR>— (For playing) कन्दुकः, गुडः, गेण्डुः m., गेण्डुकः, गिरिः m.<BR>—<BR>(A dancing party) सहनर्त्तनं, नृत्यक्रीडा.<BR>— (A ball of thread)<BR>सूत्रकोषं.<BR>— (Ball of the eye) अक्षिगोलः.<BR>— (Ball-room) नृत्यस्थानं,<BR>रङ्गशाला, वासकर्णी f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ball
To BALL, v. a. (To make into a ball) वर्त्तुलीकृ, गोलीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ballad
