balloon
BALLOON, s. आकाशयानं, व्योमयानं, आकाशवर्त्मना गमनार्थं विमानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ballot
BALLOT, s. (A ball or ticket used in voting) गुटिका, गुलिका,<BR>काकिनी f., कपर्द्दकः, स्वीकृतास्वीकृतचिह्नं.<BR>— (The act of voting by<BR>ballot) गुटिकां निभृतं पातयित्वा स्वीकृतास्वीकृतज्ञापनं or मतामतसूचनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ballot
To BALLOT, v. n. स्वीकृतास्वीकृतज्ञापनाय गुटिकां निभृतं पत् in caus.<BR>(पातयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balm
BALM, s. (The juice of a shrub) गुग्गुलुः m.<BR>— (That which al-<BR>leviates) प्रशमनं, शान्तिः f., उपशान्तिः f., वेदनाशान्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

balmy
BALMY, a. (Having the qualities of balm) पूर्व्वोक्तवृक्षरसोपेतः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Soothing) उपशमकः -का -कं, उपशायी -यिनी -यि (न्).<BR>— (Fra-<BR>grant) सौगन्धिकः -की -कं, सुरभिः -भिः -भि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

