bamboo
BAMBOO, s. वेणुः, वंशः, वेतसः, त्वक्सारः, शतपर्व्वा m. (न्), मस्करः,<BR>तृणध्वजः, यवफलः, तेजनः, कर्म्मारः.<BR>— (When rattling) कीचकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

