BAMBOOZLED, p. p. वञ्चितः -ता -तं, प्रलब्धः -ब्धा -ब्धं, विप्रलब्धः -ब्धा -ब्धं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bamboozler
