ban
BAN, s. (Public notice of any thing) घोषणं -णा, घोषणापत्रं, उत्कीर्त्तनं,<BR>समाचारः.<BR>— (A curse) शापः, अभिशापः, आक्रोशः; ‘under a ban,’<BR>शापग्रस्तः -स्ता -स्तं.<BR>— (Interdiction) निषेधः, प्रतिषेधः, वारणं, विरोधः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ban
