band
BAND, s. (That which binds) बन्धनं or -नी or -नः.<BR>— (Bond)<BR>पाशः, शृङ्खलं.<BR>— (Union or connection) सम्बन्धः, संयोगः.<BR>— (A<BR>company of persons) पङ्क्तिः f., समूहः, श्रेणी, समागमः.<BR>— (Of<BR>musical instruments) वाद्यभाण्डं, वादित्रगणः, तूय्यौघः.<BR>— (A com-<BR>pany of soldiers) गुल्मः, सैनिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

band
To BAND, v.a. संयुज् (c. 10. -योजयति -यितुं), एकत्र कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

band
