bandbox
BANDBOX, s. यत् किञ्चिल्लघुवस्त्रं स्त्रीलोकेन भृतं तदाधानयोग्यः सम्पुटकः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">Page037-b+ 51</a>]<BR>or आधारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bandit
BANDIT, s. परिपन्थी m. (न्), दस्युः, प्रसह्यचौरः, चौरः, विप्लवकारी m.<BR>(न्), सारणिकघ्नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bandy
