bandy-legged
BANDY-LEGGED, a. प्रज्ञुः -ज्ञुः -ज्ञु, प्रगतजानुः -नुः -नु, विरलजानुः -नुः -नु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bane
BANE, s. (Poison) विषं, गरः -रं, हलाहलः.<BR>— (Ruin) नाशः, विनाशः,<BR>अत्ययः, दूषणं.<BR>— (Causing ruin) दूषकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baneful
BANEFUL, a. (Poisonous) विषधरः -रा -रं, गरली -लिनी -लि (न्)।<BR>विषान्वितः -ता -तं, विषतुल्यः -ल्या -ल्यं.<BR>— (Destructive) नाशी -शिनी<BR>-शि (न्), विनाशकः -का -कं, आत्ययिकः -की -कं, दूषकः -का -कं,<BR>हिंस्रः -स्रा -स्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

