BANISHMENT, s. (The act) प्रवासनं, विवासनं, निर्वासनं, प्रव्राजनं, निः-<BR>सारणं, निरसनं, अपनोदनं, निराकरणं.<BR>— (The state) प्रवासः, विवासः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banister
BANISTER, s. सोपाने उभयतः स्थापिता क्षुद्रस्तम्भपङ्क्तिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bank
BANK, s. (Of a river) तीरं, तटं -टः, कूलं, प्रतीरं, कच्छः, रोधः n.<BR>(स्); ‘the opposite bank,’ पारं, तीरान्तरं; ‘the near bank,’<BR>अवारं.<BR>— (Any heap) चयः, कूलं, पिण्डनः, वप्रः; ‘sand-bank,’ सैकतं.<BR>— (A place where money is laid up) धनागारं, मुद्रागारं,<BR>निक्षिप्तधनागारं, टङ्कागारं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bank
To BANK, v. a. (To inclose with a bank) कूलेन or वप्रेण परिवेष्ट्<BR>(c. 1. -वेष्टते -वेष्टितुं).<BR>— (To lay up money in a bank) धनागारे<BR>धनं निक्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं) or न्यस् (c. 4. -अस्यति -असितुं),<BR>कुसीदिकं निकटे धनं स्था in caus. (स्थापयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bank-bill
BANK-BILL, BANK-NOTE, s. आनृण्यप्रतिज्ञापत्रं or ऋणशोधनप्रतिज्ञापत्रं<BR>यद्दर्शनाद् मुद्रागारे निक्षिप्तधनं प्रतिदीयते, निक्षिप्तधनविनिमयेन यत्<BR>प्रतिज्ञापत्रं प्रचलीक्रियते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banker
BANKER, s. (Keeper of a bank) धनागारपतिः m., मुद्रागारपतिः.<BR>—<BR>(Trader in money) कुसीदिकः, कलोपजीवी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bankrupt
BANKRUPT, s. परिक्षीणः, ऋणशोधनाय अक्षम ऋणी (न्) or अधमर्णः or<BR>ऋणवान् (त्), असमर्थर्णशोधनः, अशक्तानृण्यः, गतविभवः, सर्व्वस्वच्युतः,<BR>निर्धनः, हतसम्पदः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bankruptcy
BANKRUPTCY, s. परिक्षीणता, ऋणशोधनाशक्तिः f., ऋणमोक्षासामर्थ्यं, निर्धनता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banner
BANNER, s. पताका, ध्वजः or -जं, केतनं, वैजयन्ती f., ध्वजपटः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banns
BANNS, s. (Of marriage) विवाहघोपणा, विवाहघोपणपत्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
BANQUET, s. उत्सवः, सम्भोजनं, स्वाद्वन्नभोजनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
To BANQUET, v. a. स्वाद्वन्नैः or मिष्टान्नैः or भोजनविशेषैः or सविशेषान्नैः<BR>भुज् in caus. (भोजयति -यितुं) or सन्तुप् in caus. (-तोषयति -यितुं)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">Page038-a+ 51</a>]<BR>or संवृध् in caus. (-वर्द्धयति -यितुं) or तृप् in caus. (तर्पयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
To BANQUET, v. n. उत्सवं कृ, विशिष्टान्नं or स्वाद्वन्नं or भोजनविशेषान्<BR>or सविशेषान्नं भुज् (c. 7. भुंक्ते, भोक्तुं), विशिष्टरूपेण आहारं कृ, आत्म-<BR>म्भरिः -रिः -रि अस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banqueter
BANQUETER, s. उत्सवकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), विशिष्टान्नभोक्ता m. (क्तृ), स्वाद्वन्नस-<BR>न्तोषितः, स्वाद्वन्नभक्षकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banqueting
BANQUETING, s. उत्सवकरणं, विशिष्टान्नभोजनं, स्वाद्वन्नखादनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banter
To BANTER, v. a. अवहस् (c. 1. -हसति -हसितुं), अपहस्, विहस् with<BR>acc.; अवक्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं), भर्त्स् (c. 10. भर्त्सगते -ति -यितुं),<BR>निन्द् (c. 1. निन्दति, निन्दितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banterer
BANTERER, s. अवक्षेपकः, क्षेपकः, निन्दकः, परिहासवेदी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bantling
BANTLING, s. बालः, -ला, बालकः, शिशुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banyan-tree
BANYAN-TREE, s. वटः, न्यग्रोधः, पर्कटी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptism
BAPTISM, s. मज्जनं, जलसंस्कारः, अवगाहनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptismal
BAPTISMAL, a. मज्जनसम्बन्धी -न्धिनी -न्धि (न्), जलसंस्कारविषयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptist
BAPTIST, s. मज्जयिता m. (तृ), अवगाहकः, जलसंस्कारकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptistery
BAPTISTERY, s. मज्जनस्थानं, अवगाहनस्थानं, जलसंस्कारकरणस्थानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptize
To BAPTIZE, v. a. मज्ज् in caus. (मज्जयति -यितुं), निमज्ज्, अवगाह् in<BR>caus. (-गाहयति -यितुं), जलसंस्कारं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bar
BAR, s. (Of a door) अर्गलं.<BR>— (Of a cage) शलाका.<BR>— (Any ob-<BR>stacle) विघ्नः, अवरोधः -धकं, व्याघातः, प्रतिष्टम्भः, बाधकः, प्रतिबन्धः,<BR>प्रत्यूहः.<BR>— (A sand-bank) सैकतं.<BR>— (The place where criminals<BR>are tried) धर्म्मसभा, विचारस्थानं.<BR>— (A solid mass of metal)<BR>लोहपिण्डः -ण्डं, कुशी.<BR>— (In music) तालनियामका रेखा.<BR>— (In a<BR>tavern) शुण्डापाने मद्यक्रेतृविक्रेत्रोरभ्यन्तरे स्थापितम् अवरोधकं तत्र च<BR>तन्मध्ये विगणनं क्रियते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bar
To BAR, v. a. (To fasten with a bar) अर्गलेन बन्ध् (c. 9. बध्नाति,<BR>बद्धुं).<BR>— (To hinder) वृ in caus. (वारयति -यितुं), निवृ, प्रतिवृ;<BR>प्रतिरुध् (c. 7. -रुणद्धि -रोद्धुं), निरुध्, विरुध्, प्रतिबन्ध्.<BR>— (To shut<BR>out from) निराकृ, निरस् (c. 4. -अस्यति -असितुं).<BR>— (To exclude)<BR>वहिष्कृ, निराकृ.<BR>— (To prohibit) प्रतिषिघ् (c. 1. -सेधति -सेद्धुं),<BR>निषिध्; अन्तःख्या (c. 2. -ख्याति -ख्यातुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barb
BARB, s. (A species of horse brought from Barbary) विदेश-<BR>जातीयः सुतनुकायविशिष्टस् तुरगप्रभेदः.<BR>— (A crooked point) फलं,<BR>कर्णः, शूलाग्रं, शरफलं.<BR>— (Armour for horses) प्रखरः, प्रक्षरः,<BR>अश्वतनुत्रं, अश्वसज्जा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbacan
BARBACAN, s. प्राकारीयनगरोपान्ते निर्म्मितं दुर्गं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarian
BARBARIAN, s. म्लेच्छः, म्लेच्छजातिः m., शवरः, किरातः, क्षुधुनः, पुलिन्दः.<BR>— (An uncivilized man) असभ्यलोकः, पुरुषपशुः.<BR>— (A foreigner)<BR>विदेशी m. (न्).<BR>— (A cruel tyrant) निर्दयः.<BR>— (The country of<BR>barbarians) प्रत्यन्तः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarian
BARBARIAN, BARBARIC, a. (Belonging to barbarians) म्लेच्छी -च्छिनी<BR>-च्छि (न्)। विदेशी -शिनी -शि (न्), वैदेशिकः -की -कं.<BR>— (Uncivi-<BR>lized) असभ्यः -भ्या -भ्यं, असंस्कृतः -ता -तं, अशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarism
BARBARISM, s. (In grammar) म्लेच्छितं.<BR>— (Savageness of manners)<BR>क्रूरता, क्रूराचारता, म्लेच्छत्वं, पशुता, दुराचारत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarity
BARBARITY, s. (Cruelty) निष्ठुरता, निर्दयत्वं, क्रूरता.<BR>— (Of manners)<BR>असभ्यता, क्रूराचारता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarous
BARBAROUS, a. (Foreign) म्लेच्छीयः -या -यं, वैदेशिकः -की -कं.<BR>— (Sa-<BR>vage in manners) क्रूराचारः -रा -रं, कुशीलः -ला -लं, दुराचारः<BR>-रा -रं, अशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, शौवापदः -दी -दं.<BR>— (Cruel) निष्ठुरः -रा -रं,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">Page038-b+ 51</a>]<BR>निर्द्दयः -या -यं, क्रूरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbarously
BARBAROUSLY, adv. म्लेच्छवत्, असभ्यलोकवत्, पशुवत्, श्वापदवत्.<BR>—<BR>(Cruelly) निर्द्दयं, निष्ठुरं, अतिक्रूरतया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbed
BARBED, a. कर्णी -र्णिनी -र्णि (न्), फलयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, लौहाग्रयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR>— (Mailed) वर्मितः -ता -तं, कवची -चिनी -चि (न्), परिदंशितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbel
BARBEL, s. नादेयमत्स्यविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barber
BARBER, s. नापितः, क्षुरी m. (न्), मुण्डी m. (न्), क्षौरिकः, अन्तावसायी<BR>m. (न्), दिवाकीर्त्तिः m.; ‘a barber's business,’ नापित्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barbes
BARBES, s. pl. (A disease of horses) अश्वीयरोगविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bard
BARD, s. मागधः, वन्दी m. (न्), मधुकः.<BR>— (Poet) कविः m., काव्यशास्त्रज्ञः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bardick
BARDICK, a. मागधसम्बन्धी -न्धिनी -न्धि (न्), काव्यशास्त्रसम्बन्धीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bare
BARE, a. (Naked) नग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं.<BR>— (Without ornament) अभूषितः<BR>-ता -तं, अनलङ्कृतः -ता -तं, असंस्कृतः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Unclothed) विवस्त्रः<BR>-स्त्रा -स्त्रं.<BR>— (Uncovered) अनावृतः -ता -तं, विवृतः -ता -तं, अपवृतः<BR>-ता -तं.<BR>— (Mere) केवलः -ला -लं, मात्रकः -का -कं, मात्रं.<BR>— (Thread-<BR>bare, worn) जीर्णः -र्णा -र्णं; ‘the bare ground,’ केवला भूमिः,<BR>पृथिवीतलं, भूतलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bare
To BARE, v. a. (To strip, uncover) नग्नीकृ; व्यक्तीकृ; उच्छद् (c. 10.<BR>-छादयति -यितुं), विवृ (c. 5. -वृणोति -वरितुं -वरीतुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bared
BARED, p. p. नग्नीकृतः -ता -तं, व्यक्तीकृतः -ता -तं, विवृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barefaced
BAREFACED, a. (Shameless) निर्लज्जः -ज्जा -ज्जं, लज्जाहीनः -ना -नं,<BR>धृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barefacedness
BAREFACEDNESS, s. निर्लज्जत्वं, धृष्टता, धार्ष्ट्यं, प्रगल्भता, प्रागल्भ्यं, वैयात्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

barefoot
BAREFOOT, a. नग्नपादः -दा -दं, शून्यपादः -दा -दं, पादुकाहीनः -ना -नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bareheaded
