base
BASE, a. (Mean, vile) नीचः -चा -चं, अधमः -मा -मं, निकृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं,<BR>अपकृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, खलः -ला -लं, अनार्य्यः -र्य्या -र्य्यं, निर्गुणः -णा -णं,<BR>दुष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, तुच्छः -च्छा -च्छं, जघन्यः -न्या -न्यं, कदर्य्यः -र्य्या -र्य्यं, हीनः<BR>-ना -नं, कुत्सितः -ता -तं; ‘a base man,’ कापुरुषः.<BR>— (Of mean<BR>parentage) अकुलः -ला -लं, अकुलीनः -ना -नं.<BR>— (Of mean spirit)<BR>कृपणः -णा -णं, दुष्टभावः -वा -वं; ‘base metal,’ कुप्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

base
BASE or BASS, a. (As sound) गम्भीरः -रा -रं, धीरः -रा -रं.<BR>— (A base<BR>sound) मन्द्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

base
BASE, s. (The bottom of any thing) अधोभागः, मूलं, तलं, उपष्टम्भः,<BR>उपान्तं.<BR>— (In geometry) मूर्द्धा m. (न्), भूमिः f.<BR>— (Base of a<BR>pillar) उपष्टम्भः, स्तम्भस्य अधोभागः.<BR>— (Base of a tree) तरुतलं.<BR>— (Foundation of a house) भित्तिमूलं, पोटः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

base-born
BASE-BORN, a. विहीनयोनिः -निः -नि, विजातः -ता -तं, कलुषयोनिजः<BR>-जा -जं, हीनजातिः -तिः -ति.<BR>— (Bastard) जारजः, कुण्डः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

base-minded
BASE-MINDED, a. दुष्टमतिः -तिः -ति, दुष्टचेताः -ताः -तः (स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

based
BASED, p. p. (Founded) मूलः -ला -लं in comp.; ‘based on know-<BR>ledge,’ ज्ञानमूलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baseless
BASELESS, a. निर्म्मूलः -ला -लं, अमूलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

basely
BASELY, adv. अपकृष्टं, निकृष्टं, नीचतया, सदैन्यं, दुष्टजनवत्, अधमप्रकारेण,<BR>कार्पण्येन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

basement
BASEMENT, s. (Foundation of a house) गृहस्य भित्तिमूलं, वास्तु n., पोटः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baseness
BASENESS, s. (Meanness) नीचता, दुष्टता, निकृष्टता, दैन्यं, कदर्य्यत्वं,<BR>अनार्य्यता, खलता.<BR>— (Of birth) हीनजातिता, वैजात्यं.<BR>— (Of Sound)<BR>गाम्भीर्य्यं.<BR>— (Of metal) मलं, कुप्यत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bashaw
BASHAW, s. तर्कीयदेशे ख्यातिविशेषः, सेनानीः m., सेनापतिः m., अधिपतिः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bashful
BASHFUL, a. ह्रीमान् -मती -मत् (त्), लज्जावान् -वती -वत् (त्), अपत्रपिष्णुः<BR>-ष्णुः -ष्णु, त्रपितः -ता -तं, त्रपायुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, क्रीडितः -ता -तं, शालीनः<BR>-ना -नं.<BR>— (Timorous) भीरुः -रुः -रु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bashfully
BASHFULLY, adv. लज्जया, सत्रपं, सव्रीडनं.<BR>— (Timorously) सचकितं, सभयं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bashfulness
BASHFULNESS, s. ह्रीः f., लज्जा, त्रपः -पा, अपत्रपा, व्रीडा, व्रीडनं, शालीनत्वं,<BR>मन्दाक्षं.<BR>— (Timidity) भीरुता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

basil
