BASILICA, s. (The middle vein of the arm) बाहुमध्यस्था वृहन्नाडिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

