basis
BASIS, s. (Foundation of any thing) मूलं, अघोभागः, उपष्टम्भः,<BR>तलं.<BR>— (Basis of a pillar) स्तम्भस्य अधोभागः.<BR>— (The ground-<BR>work of any thing) मूलं, वस्तु n., योनिः m.; ‘prosperity has<BR>virtue for its basis,’ धर्म्ममूला सम्पत्तिः; ‘the basis or ma-<BR>terial of cloth,’ वस्त्रयोनिः,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bask
