bassoon
BASSOON, s. शुषिरविशेषः, शुषिरवाद्यप्रभेदः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bastard
BASTARD, s. जारजः, असतीसुतः, कुण्डः -ण्डी m. (न्), उपस्त्रीजातः,<BR>दासीपुत्रः, कौलटेरः, कौलटेयः, बन्धुलः, बान्धकिनेयः.<BR>— (Born after<BR>the death of a husband) गोलकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

