BAY-WINDOW, s. पुटाकारो गवाक्षः, भित्तिवहिर्लम्बो गृहाक्षः, पुटरूपवातायनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bayonet
BAYONET, s. या लोहगुलिकाप्रक्षेपणे अधुनातनयोद्धृभिः प्रयुज्यते नाडिस्<BR>तदग्रे बद्धा कृपाणी or छुरिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bazar
BAZAR, s. पण्यवीथी, पण्यशाला, आपणः, हट्टः, क्रयारोहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bdellium
BDELLIUM, s. गुग्गुलुः m., कुम्भं, उलूखलकं, सर्व्वसहः, कौशिकः, पुरः,<BR>कक्कोलः, कोलकं, कोशफलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

be
To BE, v. n. (To be in some state) अस् (c. 2. अस्ति), आस् (c. 2.<BR>आस्ते).<BR>— (To enter into some state) भू (c. 1. भवति, भवितुं).<BR>—<BR>(To exist) अस्, वृत् (c. 1. वर्त्तते, वर्त्तितुं), विद् in pass. (विद्यते),<BR>जन् in pass. (जायते).<BR>— (To be in or at) वृत्, स्था (c. 1. तिष्ठति,<BR>स्थातुं); ‘be it so,’ एवम् अस्तु. The verb ‘to be’ is often<BR>expressed by the use of the passive form of the Sanskrit<BR>verb, and is not unfrequently omitted altogether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beach
BEACH, s. समुद्रतीरं, समुद्रकूलं, समुद्रतटं, वेला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beached
BEACHED, a. समुद्रतीरस्थः -स्था -स्थं, उत्तरङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beachy
BEACHY, a. तीरविशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, तटयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, कूलमयः -यी -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beacon
BEACON, s. आकाशदीपः, उन्नतभूभागे स्थापिता शत्रोर् आगमनसमये जाज्व-<BR>ल्यमाना महोल्का, समुद्रगामिनां पथदर्शनार्थम् उच्चीकृतं चिह्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bead
BEAD, s. (Little globular body) गुलिका, गुटिका, गुली, वर्त्तुलः.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">Page041-b+ 51</a>]<BR>— (A string of beads) माला, हारः.<BR>— (A rosary of beads)<BR>जपमाला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beadle
BEADLE, s. गर्व्वाटः, यष्टिधरः, राजदूतः, दण्डधरः, दण्डी m. (न्), दण्डहस्तः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beadroll
BEADROLL, s. ये लोका जपे कथयितव्यास् तत्परिसंख्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beadsman
BEADSMAN, s. परार्थं or अन्यनिमित्ते जपकरणे नियुक्तो जनः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beagle
BEAGLE, s. शशाखेटकः कुक्कुरप्रभेदः, शशाखेटे शिक्षितो मृगव्यश्वा m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beak
BEAK, s. (Of a bird) चञ्चुः f., चञ्चूः f., त्रोटी -टिः f., मुखः, तुण्डिः m.,<BR>तुण्डः.<BR>— (Of a ship) पित्तलमयं चञ्चुरूपेण तक्षितं नौकाग्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beaked
BEAKED, a. चञ्चुमान् -मती -मत् (त्), चञ्चुरूपः -पी -पं, चञ्चुविशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beam
BEAM, s. (Piece of timber) स्थूणा, दीर्घकाष्ठं, काष्ठं, वृहत्काष्ठं, नासा,<BR>यष्टिः m.<BR>— (Main support of a house) वेश्मस्थूणा.<BR>— (Ray of<BR>light) रश्मिः m., मरीचिः m. f., किरणः, अंशुः m.<BR>— (Part of a<BR>balance) तुलाधारः, तुलादण्डं.<BR>— (Pole of a carriage) धूः f. (धुर्),<BR>कूवरः.<BR>— (Part of a weaver's loom) वायदण्डः, वापदण्डः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beam
To BEAM, v. n. (To emit rays of light) स्फुर् (c. 6. स्फुरति, स्फुरितुं),<BR>अंशु (nom. अंशूयति -यितुं), किरण (nom. किरणायते -यितुं), दीप्<BR>(c. 4. दीप्यते, दीपितुं), वर्च्चस् (nom. वर्च्चायते -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beamless
BEAMLESS, a. रश्मिहीनः -ना -नं, निस्तेजाः -जाः -जः (स्), निष्प्रभः -भा -भं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beamy
BEAMY, a. (Radiant) अंशुमान् -मती -मत् (त्), अंशुलः -ला -लं, किरणमयः<BR>-यी -यं, मरीचिमाली -लिनी -लि (न्), प्रभावान् -वती -वत् (त्), देदी-<BR>प्यमानः -ना -नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bean
BEAN, s. शिम्बिकः, शिम्बा, मुद्गः, माषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bear
BEAR, s. ऋक्षः, भल्लकः, भल्लुकः, भल्लः, भाल्लुकः, अच्छः, अच्छभल्लः.<BR>—<BR>(The Great Bear, constellation) चित्रशिखण्डिनः m. pl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bear
To BEAR, v. a. (Carry) वह् (c. 1. वहति -ते, वोढुं), सह् (c. 1. सहते,<BR>सोढुं); ‘he bore his mother on his back,’ मातरं पृष्ठेन अवहत्;<BR>‘he is borne on a horse,’ अश्वेन उह्यते or अश्वेन सञ्चरति.<BR>—<BR>(Support) भृ (c. 1. भरति -ते, c. 3. बिभर्त्ति, भर्त्तुं), घृ (c. 1. धरति<BR>-ते, धर्त्तुं) or in caus. धारयति -यितुं), आलम्ब् (c. 1. -लम्बते -लम्बितुं).<BR>— (Suffer, endure) सह्, विषह्, क्षम् (c. 1. क्षमते, क्षन्तुं), सङ्क्षम्;<BR>तिज् in des. (तितिक्षते -क्षितुं), मृष् (c. 4. मृष्यति -ते, मर्षितुं, c. 10.<BR>मर्षयति -यितुं); ‘that is not to be borne,’ न सह्यं तत्.<BR>— (Per-<BR>mit) अनुज्ञा (c. 9. -जानाति -ज्ञातुं).<BR>— (Admit) ग्रह् (c. 9. गृह्लाति,<BR>ग्रहीतुं).<BR>— (Produce) उत्पद् in caus. (-पादयति -यितुं), जन् in caus.<BR>(जनयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Bring forth) सु (c. 1. सवति, c. 2. सौति, सोतुं),<BR>प्रसु; प्रजन् (c. 4. -जायते -जनितुं) or जन् in caus.<BR>— (Bear in mind)<BR>अनुस्मृ (c. 1. -स्मरति -स्मर्त्तुं), अनुचिन्त् (c. 10. -चिन्तयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Bear<BR>witness) साक्ष्यं दा (c. 3. ददाति, दातुं).<BR>— (Keep afloat) प्लु in caus.<BR>(प्लावयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Bear fruit) फल् (फलति, फलितुं).<BR>— (Possess)<BR>भृ, धा, धृ in caus.<BR>— (Bear up) उद्वह्.<BR>— (Bear away) अपवह्.<BR>— (Bear down) निपत् in caus. (-पातयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Be capable<BR>of) उत्सह् with inf.<BR>— (Bear on, incite) प्रोत्सह् in caus. (-साहयति<BR>-यितुं).<BR>— (Bear the blame) दोषं स्वीकृ; ‘I will bear the blame,’<BR>दोषो मयि वर्त्तिष्यते.<BR>— (Bear one's self, behave) वृत् (c. 1. वर्त्तते,<BR>वर्त्तितुं), काञ्चिद् वृत्तिम् अनुष्ठा (c. 1. -तिष्ठति -स्थातुं).<BR>— (Bear ma-<BR>lice) द्रुह् (c. 4. द्रुह्यति, द्रोहितुं). When this verb occurs in<BR>phrases such as, ‘to bear company,’ ‘to hear aid,’ ‘to bear<BR>resemblance, see ‘to ACCOMPANY,’ ‘to AID,’ ‘to RESEMBLE.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bear
To BEAR, v. n. (To be patient) सह् (c. 1. सहते, सोढुं), सोढ् (nom.<BR>सोढयते -यितुं).<BR>— (To wait patiently) विलम्ब् (c. 1. -लम्बते -लम्बितुं).<BR>— (To be fruitful) फल् (c. 1. फलति, फलितुं), फलं दा (c. 8. ददाति,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">Page042-a+ 51</a>]<BR>दातुं), सफलः -ला -लं भू.<BR>— (To be situated towards) प्रतिष्ठा (c. 1.<BR>-तिष्ठति -स्थातुं), दिश्यः -श्या -श्यं अस्; as, ‘bearing towards the<BR>east,’ पूर्व्वदिश्यः.<BR>— (To bear up) मनःस्थैर्य्यं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beard
BEARD, s. श्मश्रु n., मासुरी, मुखजं रोम n. (न्), मुखरोम n.<BR>— (Of corn)<BR>शस्यशूकं, शूकं, किंशारुः m.<BR>— (Barb of an arrow) फलं, कर्णः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beard
To BEARD, v. a. (To take by the beard) अवज्ञानात् परश्मश्रु सङ्ग्रह्<BR>(c. 9. -गृह्लाति -ग्रहीतुं).<BR>— (To insult to the face) मुखरीकृ, प्रतिमुखं<BR>or प्रत्यक्षे अवज्ञा (c. 9. -जानाति -ज्ञातुं), अवक्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bearded
BEARDED, a. (Having a beard) सश्मश्रुः -श्रुः -श्रु, श्मश्रुमान् -मती -मत्<BR>(त्), श्मश्रुलः -ला -लं.<BR>— (As corn) शूकवान् -वती -वत् (त्);<BR>‘bearded corn,’ शूकधान्यं.<BR>— (As an arrow) कर्णी -र्णिनी -र्णि (न्).<BR>-(A bearded dart) प्रासः, कुन्तः.<BR>— (Insulted) अवज्ञातः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beardless
BEARDLESS, a. श्मश्रुहीनः -ना -नं.<BR>— (A stripling) अप्राप्तव्यवहारः,<BR>वटुः, माणवकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bearer
BEARER, s. वाहकः, वाही m. (न्).<BR>— (Of burdens) भारवाहः -हनः,<BR>भारहारः, धुरन्धरः; ‘one who carries out the dead,’ प्रेतनिर्हारकः;<BR>‘letter-bearer,’ पत्रवाहः; ‘bearer of news,’ सन्देशहरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bearing
BEARING, s. (The relative situation of a place) दिश्यं, दिक् f.<BR>(श्), अवस्थानं, अवस्थितिः f., स्थानं.<BR>— (Behaviour) वृत्तिः f., दर्शनं,<BR>रीतिः f., गतिः f., भावः, वर्त्तनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bearish
BEARISH, a. ऋक्षशीलः -ला -लं, भल्लकस्वभावः -वा -वं, अशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beast
BEAST, s. पशुः m., जन्तुः m., तिर्य्यङ् (ञ्च्).<BR>— (Four-footed beast)<BR>चतुष्पात् m. f. n. (द्).<BR>— (Beast of prey) श्वापदः.<BR>— (Of burden)<BR>धुरीणः, धुरीयः, धुर्य्यः, भारवाहनः.<BR>— (Applied to a man) पुरुषपशुः<BR>m., दुराचारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beastliness
BEASTLINESS, s. पशुता -त्वं, पाशवं, पशुशीलता, अमनुष्यता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beastly
BEASTLY, a. पाशवः -वी -वं, पशुशीलः -ला -लं, पशुव्यवहारः -रा -रं,<BR>अमानुषः -षी -षं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beastly
BEASTLY, adv. पशुवत्, पशुव्यवहारानुसारेण, मानुषाचारविरुद्धं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beat
BEAT, s. आघातः, घातः, प्रहारः, पातः.<BR>— (Of the pulse or heart)<BR>स्पन्दनं, स्फुरणं, विष्पन्दः; ‘at the beat of the drum,’ आहतेषु पटहेषु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beat
To BEAT, v. a. तड् (c. 10. ताडयति -यितुं), वितड्; हन् (c. 2. हन्ति, हन्तुं),<BR>निहन्, अभिहन्; प्रहृ (c. 1. -हरति -ते -हर्त्तुं), तुद् (c. 6. तुदति, तोत्तुं),<BR>आतुद्, वितुद्.<BR>— (With a stick) वेत्राघातं कृ.<BR>— (To conquer, ex-<BR>cel) पराजि (c. 1. -जयति -ते -जेतुं), विजि; अभिभू (c. 1. -भवति -भवितुं),<BR>अती (c. 2. अत्येति, अत्येतुं).<BR>— (To mix by beating) आलुड् (c. 1.<BR>-लोडति -लोडितुं), मन्थ् (c. 1. मथति, मथितुं).<BR>— (To bruise) चूर्ण् (c. 10.<BR>चूर्णयति -यितुं), मृद् (c. 9. मृद्नाति, मर्द्दितुं).<BR>— (To beat off, beat<BR>back) प्रतिहन् (c. 2. -हन्ति -हन्तुं).<BR>— (To beat down) निपत् in<BR>caus. (-पातयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To beat down the price) मूल्यं न्यूनीकृ<BR>or ह्रस् in caus. (ह्रासयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To flap the wings) पक्षास्फालं<BR>कृ, पक्षौ चल् in caus. (चालयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To rouse game by<BR>striking the bushes) मृगयासमये यथा मृगाः स्वस्थानानि त्यजन्ति<BR>तथा कोलाहलेन गुल्मादिताडनं कृ, मृगान्वेषणे यथा मृमो निजाश्रयात्<BR>पलायते तथा गुल्मादीन् तड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beat
To BEAT, v. n. (To palpitate) स्पन्द् (c. 1. स्पन्दते, स्पन्दितुं), परिस्पन्द्;<BR>कम्प् (c. 1. कम्पते, कर्म्पितुं), स्फुर् (c. 6. स्फुरति, स्फुरितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beaten
BEATEN, part. a. आहतः -ता -तं, ताडितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Conquered) परा-<BR>जितः -ता -तं: ‘beaten by the waves,’ उत्तरङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं.<BR>— (One<BR>that deserves to be beaten) कश्यः -श्या -श्यं, कशार्हः -र्हा -र्हं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beater
BEATER, s. ताडयिता m. (तृ), ताडकः, घाती m. (न्).<BR>— (A gold-beater)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">Page042-b+ 51</a>]<BR>मुद्गरादिना यः सुवर्णम् अतिशयेन सूक्ष्मीकरोति स्वर्णकारविशेष; स्वर्णप-<BR>त्रकृत्.<BR>— (An instrument for comminuting) मुद्गरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beatific
BEATIFIC or BEATIFICAL, a. अपवर्गदः -दा -दं, परमसुखावहः -हा -हं,<BR>परमानन्दकरः -री -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beatification
BEATIFICATION, s. अमुकसाधुजनः स्वर्गं or अपवर्गं or सिद्धिं प्राप्तवान् इति<BR>घोषणापत्रेण महाधर्म्माध्यक्षसकाशाद् विज्ञापनं, स्वर्गीयलोकमध्ये आरोपणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beatified
BEATIFIED, p. p. गृहीतापवर्गः -र्गा -र्गं, स्वर्गप्राप्तः -प्ता -प्तं, स्वर्गारोपितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beatify
To BEATIFY, v. a. (To make happy) सुख् (c. 10. सुखयति -यितुं),<BR>परमसुखं or परमानन्दं दा (c. 3. ददाति -दातुं).<BR>— (To proclaim pub-<BR>licly that a person is received into heaven) अमुकसाधुजनः<BR>स्वर्गं or सिद्धिं प्राप्तवान् इति महाधर्म्माध्यक्षाज्ञया घोषणापत्रं प्रचर् in<BR>caus. (-चारयति -यितुं); स्वर्गीयलोकमध्ये आरुह् in caus. (-रोपयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beating
BEATING, s. ताडनं, आघातः, घातः, दण्डः.<BR>— (With a stick) वेत्राघातः.<BR>— (Throbbing) स्पन्दनं, स्फुरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beatitude
BEATITUDE, s. मुक्तिः f., मोक्षः, निर्वाणं, सिद्धिः f., अपवर्गः, स्वर्गप्राप्तिः f.,<BR>परमागतिः f., श्रेयः n. (स्) or निःश्रेयः, अमृतता, कैवल्यं.<BR>— (Feli-<BR>city) परमसुखं, परमानन्दः, श्रेयस्त्वं, सुखं.<BR>— (Desirous of) मुमुक्षुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beau
BEAU, s. सुवेशी m. (न्), सुवेशः, सुवस्त्रपरिच्छन्नः, दर्शनीयमानी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beau-monde
BEAU-MONDE, s. नृत्यगीतस्वाद्वन्नभोजनमद्यपानसुवस्त्रपरिधानादिभोगतत्परो<BR>लोकः, भोगासक्तो लोकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beauteous
BEAUTEOUS or BEAUTIFUL, a. चारुः -र्व्वी -रु, सुन्दरः -रा -री -रं, रुचिरः<BR>-रा -रं, सुदृश्यः -श्या -श्यं, शोभनः -ना -नं, कान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, वामः -मा -मं,<BR>रूपवान् -वती -वत् (त्), रूपी -पिणी -पि (न्), सुरूपः -पी -पं, मनोरमः<BR>-मा -मं, मनोज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं, लावण्यवान् -वती -वत् (त्), साधुः -धुः -ध्वी -धु,<BR>सौम्यः -म्या -म्यं, श्रीयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, सुमुखः -खी -खं, अभिरामः -मा -मं,<BR>सुषमः -मा -मं, पेशलः -ला -लं, रुच्यः -च्या -च्यं, मञ्जुः -ञ्जुः -ञ्जु, मञ्जुलः<BR>-ला -लं, वृन्दारः -रा -रं. Often expressed by सु; as, ‘a beau-<BR>tiful day,’ सुदिनं. ‘A beautiful woman,’ रूपवती, प्रमदा; ‘to<BR>be beautiful,’ शुभ् (c. 1. शोभते, शोभितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beauteously
BEAUTEOUSLY or BEAUTIFULLY, adv. साधु, सुन्दरं, रुचिरं, सुष्टु, सुन्द-<BR>रप्रकारेण, सु prefixed; as, ‘beautifully dressed,’ सुवेशी<BR>-शिनी -शि (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beauteousness
BEAUTEOUSNESS, s. कान्तता, अभिरामता, वामता, रूपवत्त्वं, रमणीयता, मुग्धता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beautified
BEAUTIFIED, p. p. शोभितः -ता -तं, उपशोभितः -ता -तं, कृतशोभः -भा -भं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beautifier
BEAUTIFIER, s. शोभकृत्, शोभकः, शोभयिता m. (तृ), भूपणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beautify
To BEAUTIFY, v. a. शुभ् in caus. (शोभयति -यितुं), उपशुभ्, अलङ्क,<BR>परिष्कृ, भूष् (c. 10. भूषयति -यितुं), विभूष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beauty
BEAUTY, s. सौन्दर्य्यं, चारुता, शोभा, कान्तिः f., रूपं, लावण्यं, रूपलावण्यं,<BR>श्रीः, आभा, अभिख्या, द्युतिः f., छविः f., मञ्जिमा m. (न्), सुषमा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beauty-spot
BEAUTY-SPOT, s. तिलकः -कं, सौन्दर्य्यवर्द्धकं चिह्नं, कान्तिदायकम् अङ्कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beaver
BEAVER, s. (An animal) स्थलजलचरजन्तुप्रभेदो यल्लोमनिर्म्मितं शिरस्कम्<BR>अधुनातनजनैर् भ्रियते.<BR>— (A hat) पूर्व्वोक्तजन्तुलोमनिर्म्मितं शिरस्कं or<BR>शिरस्त्राणं.<BR>— (Part of a helmet) शिरस्त्राणस्य यो भागश् चिवुकदेशं<BR>or मुखस्य अधोभागं प्रच्छादयति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becafico
BECAFICO, s. अञ्जीरद्राक्षादिखादको विदेशीयपक्षिभेदः, अञ्जीरप्रतुदः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becalm
To BECALM, v. a. (To still the elements) निर्व्वातं -तां -तं कृ, वायुं<BR>निवृत् in caus. (-वर्त्तयति -यितुं), निस्तरङ्गं -ङ्गां -ङ्गं कृ.<BR>— (To quiet)<BR>शम् in caus. (शमयति -यितुं), उपशम्, प्रशम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becalmed
BECALMED, p. p. निर्व्वातः -ता -तं, निर्वेगः -गा -गं, निस्तरङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

became
BECAME, the preterite of ‘become;’ which see. Sometimes<BR>expressed by जातः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=042-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

because
BECAUSE, conj. यतस्, यत्, येन, यस्मात्, इति हेतोः, यतोहतोः, हि.<BR>‘Because’ may be often expressed by the abl. or inst. c.<BR>of the abstract noun; as, ‘because it had no deepness<BR>of earth,’ मृदल्पत्वात्; ‘because he was a just man,’ सज्जन-<BR>त्वात्; ‘because he was a friend,’ मित्रतया. It may even<BR>be expressed by इति; thus, ‘I am come, because a ser-<BR>vant ought to be present at the fitting occasion,’ अनुजी-<BR>विना प्राप्तकाले सान्निध्यं कर्त्तव्यम् इति आगतोऽस्मि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

because of
BECAUSE OF, prep. (By reason of) हेतोः, हेतौ, कारणात्.<BR>— (For<BR>the sake of) अर्थं, अर्थे, कृते, निमित्ते affixed to a crude noun;<BR>‘because of that,’ अनेन हेतुना, इति हेतोः. ‘Because of’<BR>is often expressed by the abl. c. of the noun; as, ‘be-<BR>cause of their unbelief,’ तेषाम् अविश्वासात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beck
BECK, s. सङ्केतः, इङ्गितं.<BR>— (With the hand) करसङ्केतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beckon
To BECKON, v. n. शिरसा or हस्तेन सङ्केतं or इङ्गितं दा (c. 3. ददाति,<BR>दातुं) or कृ.<BR>— (To summon with a sign) इङ्गितेन समाह्वे (c. 1.<BR>-ह्वयति -ह्वातुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

become
To BECOME, v. n. भू (c. 1. भवति, भवितुं), सम्भू; सम्पद् (c. 4. -पद्यते<BR>-पत्तुं), प्रतिपद्, वृत् (c. 1. वर्त्तते, वर्त्तितुं), संवृत्, जन् (c. 4. जायते),<BR>सञ्जन्. The pass. part. of जन् (जात) is often used in the<BR>sense ‘became,’ आहृ in caus. (-हारयति -यितुं) with acc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

become
To BECOME, v. a. (Suit) युज् in pass. (युज्यते), उपपद् (c. 4. -पद्यते<BR>-पत्तुं) with loc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becoming
BECOMING, a. युक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, योग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, यथायोग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, उचितः<BR>-ता -तं, यथोचितः -ता -तं, समुचितः -ता -तं, समञ्जसः -सा -सं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becomingly
BECOMINGLY, adv. यथायोग्यं, यथोचितं, युक्तं, यथार्हं, यथातथं, यथायथं,<BR>योगतस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

becomingness
BECOMINGNESS, s. युक्तता, औचित्यं, योग्यता, उपयुक्तत्वं, सामञ्जस्यं, उपपत्तिः<BR>f., याथतथ्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bed
BED, s. शय्या, शयनं, पर्य्यङ्कः, तल्पः, खट्वा, संस्तरः, पल्यङ्कः, स्तरिमा m. (न्),<BR>शयनीयं, मञ्चः, मञ्चकः, प्रस्तरः, आस्तरणं.<BR>— (To go to bed) शी<BR>(c. 2. शेते, शयितुं); ‘gone to bed,’ शय्यागतः, खट्वारूढः -ढा -ढं.<BR>— (To make a bed) शय्यां प्रस्तुतीकृ or उपस्तृ (c. 5. -स्तृणोति<BR>-स्तरितुं -स्तरीतुं), आस्तृ.<BR>— (To lie down in bed) शय्याम् अधिशी.<BR>— (Channel of a river) गर्भः, नदीमध्यं, नदीवहनपथः, नदीरयपथः.<BR>— (Garden-bed) स्थलं, उद्याने पुष्पोत्पत्तियोग्य ईषदुन्नतो भूभागः.<BR>—<BR>(Marriage) विवाहः.<BR>— (A layer) फलकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=043-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bed
