bellows
BELLOWS, s. भस्त्रा f., भस्त्री, भस्त्रका, चर्म्मप्रसेवकः -विका, व्यजनं, दृतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bell-ringer
BELL-RINGER, s. घण्टाताडः -डकः, घण्टावादकः, घण्टावादयिता m. (तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belluine
BELLUINE, a. पाशवः -वी -वं, पशुशीलः -ला -लं, अमानुषः -षी -षं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belly
BELLY, s. उदरं, जठरं -रा, कुक्षिः m., पिचिण्डः, पिचण्डः, तुन्दं, तुन्दि n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belly
To BELLY or BELLY-OUT, v. n. (To swell out, bulge out) उदरवत्<BR>or उदररूपेण लम्ब् (c. 1. लम्बते, लम्बितुं) or पॄ in pass. (पूर्य्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belly-ache
BELLY-ACHE, s. उदरवेदना, उदरामयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belly-band
BELLY-BAND, s. उदरत्राणं, उदरदाम n. (न्), अवसक्तिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

belly-bound
BELLY-BOUND, a. आनद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, निबद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, बद्धोदरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

