BESPOKEN, p. p. प्रख्यातः -ता -तं, पूर्व्वादिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, अग्रनिवेदितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Any commodity bespoken) प्रख्यातभाण्डं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bespread
BESPREAD, p. p. आस्तीर्णः -र्णा -र्णं, आवृतः -ता -तं, परिच्छन्नः -न्ना -न्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

besprinkle
