To BESTREW, v. a. आस्तॄ (c. 5. -स्तृणोति -स्तरितुं -स्तरीतुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bestride
To BESTRIDE, v. a. (A horse) पादौ or जङ्घे पृथक्कृत्वा अश्वम् आरुह्<BR>(c. 1. -रोहति -रोढुं), अधिरुह्, अध्यारुह्; अधिक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रामति<BR>-क्रमितुं); ‘bestriding a horse,’ अश्वारूढः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bestud
To BESTUD, v. a. गण्डादिभूपणैर् अनुव्यध् (c. 4. -विध्यति -व्यद्धुं) or खच्<BR>(c. 10. खचयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bestudded
BESTUDDED, p. p. अनुविद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, खचितः -ता -तं, प्रत्युप्तः -प्रा -प्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bet
BET, s. (Wager) पणः, प्रतिज्ञा, आक्षिकपणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bet
To BET, v. n. पण् (c. 1. पणते, पणितुं), विपण्; दिव् (c. 4. दीव्यति, देवितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betake ones self
To BETAKE ONE'S SELF, v. r. आश्रि (c. 1. -श्रयति -ते -श्रयितुं), अभिश्रि,<BR>उपाश्रि, संश्रि, समुपाश्रि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betel
BETEL, s. (Nut) ताम्बूलं, पूगं, उद्वेगं, पूगफलं.<BR>— (The plant) ताम्बूली,<BR>ताम्बूलवल्ली, नागवल्ली.<BR>— (A seller of it) ताम्बूलिकः.<BR>— (Relating<BR>to it) ताम्बूली -लिनी -लि (न्).<BR>— (Betel box) पूगपात्रं, ताम्बूलपेटिका.<BR>— (Betel-bearer) ताम्बूलवाहकः, ताम्बूलदः, वाग्गुलिः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bethink ones self
To BETHINK ONE'S SELF, v. r. अनुचिन्त् (c. 10. -चिन्तयति -यितुं), सञ्चिन्त्,<BR>अनुध्यै (c. 1. -ध्यायति -ध्यातुं), विमृश् (c. 6. -मृशति -मर्ष्टुं -म्बष्टुं), अनुबुध<BR>(c. 4. -बुध्यते -बोद्धुं), अनुस्मृ (c. 1. -स्मरति -स्मर्त्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bethump
To BETHUMP, v. a. तड् (c. 10. ताडयति -यितुं), प्रहृ (c. 1. -हरात -हर्त्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betide
To BETIDE, v. n. सम्भू (c. 1. -भवति -भवितुं), उपस्था (c. 1. -तिष्ठति -स्थातुं),<BR>निपत् (c. 1. -पतति -पतितुं), सम्पद् (c. 4. -पद्यते -पत्तुं), घट् (c. 1.<BR>घटते, घटितुं); ‘may good betide you,’ भद्रं ते भूयात्; ‘woe<BR>betide you,’ अवग्राहस्ते or अजीवनिस्ते or अकरणिस्ते भूयात्त्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betimes
BETIMES, adv. प्रभाते, सकालं, प्रातर्, व्युष्टं, प्रत्यूषे, समया, समये, उप-<BR>युक्तसमये, वेलायां.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betoken
To BETOKEN, v. a. सूच् (c. 10. सूचयति -यितुं), प्रदिश् (c. 6. -दिशति<BR>-देष्टुं), सन्दिश्; अभिदृश् in caus. (-दर्शयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To foreshew)<BR>प्रदृश् in caus.; ‘betokening,’ सूचकः -का -कं, वाचकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betoss
To BETOSS, v. a. क्षुभ् in caus. (क्षोभयति -यितुं), क्षिप् (c. 6. क्षिपति, क्षेप्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betray
To BETRAY, v. a. परहस्तेषु or शत्रुकरेषु or शत्रुपाणिषु or अन्येषां करेषु<BR>समृ in caus. (-अर्पयति -यितुं), परादा (c. 3. -ददाति -दातुं), प्रदा, वञ्च्<BR>(c. 10. वञ्चयते -यितुं), विश्वासघातं or विश्वासभङ्गं कृ, खण्ड् (c. 10.<BR>खण्डयति -यितुं), शत्रोरायत्तं -त्तां -त्तं कृ.<BR>— (To shew, discover) सूच्<BR>(c. 10. सूचयति -यितुं); दृश् in caus. (दर्शयति -यितुं), पिशुन (nom.<BR>पिशुनयति -यितुं), व्यक्तीकृ, प्रकटीकृ.<BR>— (To betray secrets) गोप्यानि<BR>प्रकाश् in caus. (-काशयति -यितुं), मन्त्रभेदं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrayed
BETRAYED, p. p. शत्रुहस्तार्पितः -ता -तं, वञ्चितः -ता -तं, परादत्तः -त्ता -त्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrayer
BETRAYER, s. परहस्तार्पकः, वञ्चकः, विश्वासघातकः, प्रदाता m. (तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrim
To BETRIM, v. a. भूष् (c. 10. भूषयति -यितुं), अलङ्कृ, परिष्कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betroth
To BETROTH, v. a. वाग्दानं कृ, नियमपत्रेण विवाहप्रतिज्ञां कृ, प्रतिज्ञापत्रेण<BR>विवाहसम्बन्धं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrothed
BETROTHED, p. p. वाग्दत्तः -त्ता -त्तं, प्रदत्तः -त्ता -त्तं, प्रत्तः -त्ता -त्तं, प्रति-<BR>ज्ञाविवाहितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Woman) वाग्दत्ता, प्रत्ता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrothment
BETROTHMENT, s. वाग्दानं, कन्याप्रदानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betrust
To BETRUST, v. a. परिदा (c. 3. -ददाति -दातुं), नियुज् in caus. (-योजयति<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">Page049-a+ 51</a>]<BR>-यितुं), समृ in caus. (-अर्पयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

better
BETTER, (compar. of good) a. भद्रतरः -रा -रं, श्रेयान् -यसी -यः (स्),<BR>श्रेष्ठः -ष्ठा -ष्ठं, गरीयान् -यसी -यः (स्), प्रशस्तः -स्ता -स्तं, अर्हत्तरः -रा -रं,<BR>साधीयान् -यसी -यः (स्), ज्यायान् -यसी -यः (स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

better
BETTER (compar. of well) adv. वरं, प्रशस्तं, श्रेयस्, भद्रतरं, भद्रतरप्रकारेण,<BR>श्रेष्ठं.<BR>— (More) अधिकं, अधिकतरं, अतिरिक्तं.<BR>— (The better, the<BR>superiority) श्रेष्ठता, श्रेयस्त्वं, प्रधानता, प्रमुखत्वं.<BR>— (To get the bet-<BR>ter) अभिभू, अतिरिच् in pass. (-रिच्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

better
To BETTER, v. a. भद्रतरं -रां -रं कृ, श्रेयांसं -यसीं -यः कृ.<BR>— (To ad-<BR>vance) वृध् in caus. (वर्धयति -यितुं), संवृध्, परिवृध्, एध् in caus.<BR>(एधयति -यितुं), समेध्.<BR>— (To surpass) अतिरिच् in pass. (-रिच्यते),<BR>अभिभू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betters
BETTERS, s. pl. (Superiors) श्रेष्ठाः m. pl., प्रधानपुरुषाः m. pl., उत्त-<BR>मपुरुषाः m. pl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betting
BETTING, s. पणनं, पणकरणं, पणार्पणं, आक्षिकपणकरणं, प्रतिज्ञानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bettor
BETTOR, s. पणकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), पणकः, पणार्पकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

betty
BETTY, s. द्वारकपाटादिभञ्जने सन्धिचौरैः प्रयुक्तं लोहयन्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

between
BETWEEN or BETWIXT, prep. मध्ये, अभ्यन्तरे, अन्तरेण, अन्तरे, अन्तर्,<BR>अन्तरा, मध्यतस्, मध्यस्थाने; ‘the mediator between God and<BR>man,’ ईश्वरस्य माणुषाणाञ्च मध्ये मध्यस्थः. Between is sometimes<BR>expressed by the gen. or inst. c.; as, ‘there is a great<BR>difference between a master and a servant,’ सेव्यसेवकयोर्<BR>महदन्तरं; ‘great is the difference between thee and the<BR>ocean,’ त्वया समुद्रेण च महदन्तरं; ‘I will put enmity between<BR>thee and the woman,’ त्वया नार्य्या च वैरितां जनिष्पामि; ‘I am in<BR>a strait betwixt two,’ उभाभ्यां सङ्कुचितोऽस्मि; ‘they parted the<BR>paternal inheritance between them,’ दायं पित्र्यं परस्परं व्यभजन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bever
BEVER, s. माध्यन्दिनभोजनानन्तरं प्राग्रात्रिभोजनात् तत्कालान्तरे लध्वाहारः<BR>or अर्द्धाशनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beverage
BEVERAGE, s. पानीयं, पेयं, पानं, पयः n. (स्).<BR>— (Of the gods) अमृतं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bevy
BEVY, s. गणः, सङ्घः, समवायः, यूथं, कुलं; ‘a bevy of young lasses,’<BR>तरुणीगणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewail
To BEWAIL, v. a. and n. विलप् (c. 1. -लपति -लपितुं), शुच् (c. 1.<BR>शोचति, शोचितुं), अनुशुच्, परिदेव् (c. 1. -देवति -ते -देवितुं); ‘to<BR>grieve exceedingly,’ शुच् in freq. (शोशुच्यते), परिशुच् in freq.,<BR>लप् in freq. (लालप्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewailable
BEWAILABLE, a. शोच्यः -च्या -च्यं, शोचनीयः -या -यं, विलपनीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewailing
BEWAILING, s. विलपनं, विलापः, परिदेवनं, अनुशोचनं, क्रन्दनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beware
To BEWARE, v. n. अवधा (c. 3. -धत्ते -धातुं), सावधानः -ना -नं भू, अवधानं<BR>कृ.<BR>— (Abstain from, avoid) परिहृ (c. 1. -हरति -हर्त्तुं), वृज् in<BR>caus. (वर्जयति -यितुं), विवृज्, परिवृज्; ‘beware of men,’ सानु-<BR>षेभ्योऽवधत्त; ‘beware of too great avarice,’ अतिलोभात् साव-<BR>धानो भव; ‘beware lest any one deceive you,’ सावधाना भवत<BR>कोऽपि युष्मान् न भ्रमयेत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beweep
To BEWEEP, v. a. रुद् (c. 2. रोदिति, रोदितुं), अनुशुच् (c. 1. -शोचति,<BR>शोचितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewet
To BEWET, v. a. क्लिद् in caus. (क्लेदयति -यितुं), सिच् (c. 6. सिञ्चति, सेक्तुं),<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewilder
To BEWILDER, v. a. मुह् in caus. (मोहयति -यितुं), व्यामुह्, परिमुह्,<BR>विप्रमुह्; आकुलीकृ, व्याकुलीकृ, विभ्रम् in caus. (-भ्रमयति -यितुं), सम्भ्रम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewildered
BEWILDERED, p. p. आकुलः -ला -लं, व्याकुलः -ला -लं, आकुलितः -ता -तं।<BR>आकुलीकृतः -ता -तं, सम्भ्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, कातरः -रा -रं, व्यग्रः -ग्रा -ग्रं।<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">Page049-b+ 51</a>]<BR>मोहितः -ता -तं, मुग्धः -ग्धा -ग्धं, विमूढः -ढा -ढं, विमुग्धः -ग्धा -ग्धं,<BR>व्यस्तः -स्ता -स्तं, परिविह्वलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewilderment
BEWILDERMENT, s. व्याकुलता, आकुलत्वं, व्यग्रता, वैक्लव्यं, सम्भ्रमः, कातरता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitch
To BEWITCH, v. a. मन्त्रद्वारा वशीकृ or मुह् in caus. (मोहयति -यितुं),<BR>मोहं कृ, अभिमन्त्र् (c. 10. -मन्त्रयते -यितुं).<BR>— (To captivate) मनो हृ<BR>(c. 1. हरति, हर्त्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitched
BEWITCHED, p. p. मोहितः -ता -तं, वशीकृतः -ता -तं, अभिमन्त्रितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitcher
BEWITCHER, s. मोहकः, मोहनः, मायी m. (न्), वशीकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), मायाकृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitchment
BEWITCHMENT, s. वशीक्रिया, वशिः m., वशिता, वशीकरणं, मोहनं,<BR>परिमोहनं, विमोहनं, सम्मोहः, मोहः, माया, कार्म्मणत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitching
BEWITCHING, a. मोही -हिनी -हि (न्), मोहनः -नी -नं, मनोहारी -रिणी<BR>-रि (न्), मनोहरः -रा -रं, प्रलोभकः -का -कं, आकर्षिकः -की -कं,<BR>मायी -यिनी -यि (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewitchingly
BEWITCHINGLY, adv. यथा मनो ह्रियते or वशीक्रियते तथा, मनोहरप्र-<BR>कारेण, यथा मोहो जायते तथा, मायया, प्रलोभनाय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bewray
To BEWRAY, v. a. (To betray) परादा (c. 3. -ददाति -दातुं), प्रदा;<BR>शत्रुहस्तेषु समृ in caus. (-अर्पयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To indicate) सूच् (c. 10.<BR>(सूचयति -यितुं), पिशुन (nom. पिशुनयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

beyond
BEYOND, prep. and adv. अति prefixed.<BR>— (On the farther side)<BR>पारं, पारे; ‘beyond the sea,’ समुद्रपारं; ‘from beyond,’ पारात्;<BR>‘to go beyond,’ अतिक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रामति -क्रमितुं), अतिचर् (c. 1.<BR>-चरति -चरितुं).<BR>— (In front) अग्रे.<BR>— (Superior to) अतिरेकी -किणी<BR>-कि (न्), विशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR>— (More than) अधिकं, or expressed<BR>by अति prefixed; as, ‘beyond mortal strength,’ अतिमानुषः<BR>-षा -षं; ‘beyond's one's power,’ अतिशक्ति; ‘beyond mea-<BR>sure,’ अतिशयं, अतीव; ‘passed beyond the range of sight,’<BR>चक्षुर्विषयम् अतिक्रान्तः.<BR>— (At a distance) दूरे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bezel
BEZEL or BEZIL, s. रत्नाधारयोग्योऽ ङ्गुरीयकभागः, अङ्गुरीयकस्य यत्स्थाने<BR>मणिः स्वच्यते or प्रणिधीयते तत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bhavani
BHAVĀNĪ, s. (The wife of the god Śiva, and the goddess of<BR>destruction; called Bhavānī in her amiable form) भवानी,<BR>उमा, महादेवी, देवी.<BR>— (The pure one) गौरी.<BR>— (As terrible in<BR>form and irascible in temper) दुर्गा, काली, चण्डी, चण्डिका.<BR>— (As daughter of Himālā, the sovereign of the snowy<BR>mountains) पार्व्वती, हैमवती.<BR>— (As wife of Śiva) शिवा, ईश्वरी,<BR>रुद्राणी, सर्व्वाणी, मृडानी.<BR>— (The all-auspicious) सर्व्वमङ्गला.<BR>—<BR>(The mother) अम्बिका.<BR>— (As the performer of austerities)<BR>कात्यायनी, अपर्णा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

biangulated
BIANGULATED, a. द्विकोणः -णा -णं, द्व्यस्रकः -का -कं, कोणद्वयविशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bias
BIAS, s. (Inclination) भावः, शीलः, शीलत्वं, वाञ्छा, स्वभावः, इच्छा,<BR>अभिलाषः, सङ्कल्पः, छन्दं, चिकीर्षा, स्पृहा, अभिप्रायः.<BR>— (Inclination<BR>to go on one side) पार्श्वे गसनेच्छा.<BR>— (Partiality) वक्षपातः,<BR>पक्षपातिता, साचीकृतं.<BR>— (That which biasses, or induces to<BR>act) प्रवर्त्तः -र्त्तकः, प्रणोदः, प्रोत्साहः -हकः, प्रयोजकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bias
To BIAS, v. a. प्रवृत् in caus. (-वर्त्तयति -यितुं), आवृज् in caus. (-वर्जयति<BR>-यितुं); साचीकृ; प्रणुद् (c. 6. -णुदति -णोत्तुं), आकृष् (c. 1. -कर्षति<BR>-क्रष्टुं), चेष्ट् in caus. (चेष्टयति -यितुं), प्रोत्सह् in caus. (-साहयति -यितुं),<BR>आकृ in caus. (-कारयति -यितुं), पक्षपातीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

biassed
BIASSED, p. p. प्रवर्त्तितः -ता -तं, प्रोत्साहितः -ता -तं, प्रणोदितः -ता -तं,<BR>साचीकृतः -ता -तं, आकृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR>— (In favour of a side)<BR>पक्षोताही m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bib
