bibber
BIBBER, s. सुरापी m. (न्), सुरापः, मद्यपायी m. (न्), पानपरः, मद्यपाः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

