BIBULOUS, a. जलशोषकः -का -कं, जलनिपानशीलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bicapsular
BICAPSULAR, a. वीजकोशो द्वैधीकृतो यस्य, द्विधाभूतवीजकोशः -शा -शं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

