BICIPITAL, a. द्विमुर्द्धः -र्द्धा -र्द्धं, द्विशीर्षकः -का -कं, द्विशिराः -राः -रः (स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bicker
To BICKER, v. n. (To skirmish) डिम्बाहवं कृ; कलह (nom. कलहायते<BR>-यितुं), कलहं कृ.<BR>— (To wrangle) विवद् (c. 1. -वदते -वदितुं), वाग्युद्धं<BR>कृ.<BR>— (To quiver) स्फुर् (c. 6. स्फुरति, स्फुरितं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

