bigness
BIGNESS, s. स्थूलता, स्थौल्पं, वृहत्त्वं, विपुलता.<BR>— (Size, comparative<BR>bulk) परिमाणं; ‘of the bigness of an egg,’ अण्डपरिमाणः -णा -णं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

