bill
BILL, s. (Beak of a bird) चञ्चुः f., तुण्डः, तुण्डिः m., मुखः.<BR>— (A kind<BR>of hatchet) दात्रं, स्तम्बघ्नः.<BR>— (An act of parliament) व्यवस्था.<BR>— (A written paper of any kind) पत्रं, लेखः -खा, लेख्यं.<BR>—<BR>(An account of money) विक्रयपत्रं.<BR>— (An advertisement)<BR>घोषणापत्रं.<BR>— (In law) भाषापादं, पूर्व्वपक्षपादः, अभियोगपत्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bill
