billet
BILLET, s. (A note) पत्रं, लेखः, लेख्यं.<BR>— (A ticket) निदर्शनपत्रं, चिह्नं.<BR>— (A log of wood) काष्ठखण्डं, काष्ठं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

billet
