billiards
BILLIARDS, s. pl. इदानीन्तनजनैः सेविता गुलिकाक्रीडा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

billion
BILLION, s. खर्व्वः.<BR>— (A million millions) नियुतनियुतानि, शङ्खः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

billow
BILLOW, s. ऊर्म्मिः m. f., महोर्व्यिः m. f., भङ्गः, तरङ्गः, उल्लोलः, पयो-<BR>राशिः f., वारिराशिः f., कल्लोल, अर्गलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

billow
To BILLOW, v. n. तरङ्ग (nom. तरङ्गायते), तरङ्गरूपेण प्रलुठ् (c. 1.<BR>-लाठति -लोठितुं), महावेलया प्रवृध् (c. 1. -वर्धते -वर्धितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

billow-beaten
