blowzy
BLOWZY, a. आतपदग्धवदनः -नी -नं, सूर्य्यतेजसा विकृतवर्णः -र्णा -र्णं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

blubber
