bludgeon
BLUDGEON, s. लगुडः, परिधः, परिघातनं, गदा.<BR>— (Armed with) लगुडहस्तः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

blue
