blue-eyed
BLUE-EYED, a. नीलनयनः -नी -नं, नीलाक्षः -क्षी -क्षं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

