BLUNTED, p. p. धनीकृतः -ता -तं, विरुग्नधारः -रा -रं, विरुग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bluntly
BLUNTLY, adv. पारुष्येण, कार्कश्येन, कर्कशवाक्येन, परुषोक्त्या, सपारुष्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bluntness
