BOA-CONSTRICTOR, s. (A snake) अजगरः, वाहसः, शयुः m., वोड्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boar
BOAR, s. वराहः, शूकरः, दंष्ट्री m. (न्), स्थूलनासः, पृथुस्कन्धः, कोलः,<BR>किरः, दृढलोमा m. (न्), वक्रदंष्ट्रः; ‘wild boar,’ वनशूकरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

board
BOARD, s. (A plank) फलकः -कं, दीर्घकाष्ठं.<BR>— (A table) भोजनाधारः,<BR>फलकः, भोजनासनं, मञ्चः.<BR>— (Food) भोजनं, आहारः, भृतिः f., अन्नजलं.<BR>‘board and clothing,’ ग्रासाच्छादनं; ‘board and lodging,’<BR>ग्रासावासौ du.<BR>— (A council) सभा; ‘the members of it,’ सभासदः<BR>m. pl.<BR>— (The deck of a ship) नौकापृष्ठं, पोतपृष्ठं, नौकातलं,<BR>नौकाफलकं, पोतास्तरणं; ‘on board,’ नौकारूढः -ढा -ढं.<BR>— (A<BR>board for playing drafts, &c.) अष्टापदं, शारिफलं, नयपीठी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

board
To BOARD, v. a. (To enter a ship by force) नावं बलात् or बलेन<BR>or प्रसह्य आरुह् (c. 1. -रोहति -रोढुं) or अधिक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रामति<BR>-क्रमितुं) or आक्रम् or अवप्लु (c. 1. -प्लवते -प्लोतुं).<BR>— (To lay with<BR>boards) फलक (nom. फलकयति -यितुं), फलकैः or दीर्घकाष्ठैः or का-<BR>ष्ठफलकेन आस्तृ (c. 9. -स्तृणाति -स्तरितुं -स्तरीतुं).<BR>— (To diet another<BR>at a settled rate) निरूपितमूल्येन स्वगृहे अन्तेवासिनं भुज् in caus.<BR>(भोजयति -यितुं) or भृ (c. 3. बिभर्त्ति, भर्त्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

board
To BOARD, v. n. (To diet with another at a settled rate)<BR>निरूपितवेतनं दत्त्वा or निरूपितमूल्येन परगृहे भोजनशयनादि कृ or<BR>अन्तेवासी भू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boarder
BOARDER, s. (One who diets with another) निरूपितमूल्येन परगृहे<BR>भोजनशयनादिकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), सहभोजी m. (न्), सहभोक्ता m. (क्तृ), पांक्त्यः.<BR>— (A pupil at a boarding-school) अन्तेवासी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boarding-school
BOARDING-SCHOOL, s. यस्मिन् विद्यालये अन्तेवासिनः शिक्षकगृहे भोज-<BR>नशयनादि कुर्व्वन्ति सः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

board-wages
BOARD-WAGES, s. भोजनक्रयणार्थं वेतनं, अन्नक्रयणार्थं वर्त्तनं, भोजनात्<BR>प्रति वेतनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boarish
BOARISH, a. वाराहः -ही -हं, सौकरः -री -रं, असभ्यः -भ्या -भ्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boast
To BOAST, v. n. आत्मानं श्लाघ् (c. 1. श्लाघते, श्लाघितुं), कत्थ् (c. 1.<BR>कत्थते, कत्थितुं), विकत्थ् with inst. of the thing of which<BR>boast is made, दम्भं कृ, परिकॄत् (c. 10. -कीर्त्तयति -यितुं), दृप् (c. 4.<BR>दृप्यति, द्रप्तुं), गर्व्व् (c. 1. गर्व्वति, गर्व्वितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boast
BOAST, BOASTING, s. आत्मश्लाघा, विकत्था, विकत्थनं, परिकीर्त्तनं, अह-<BR>ङ्कारोक्तिः f., शूरमानं, दम्भः, दर्पकरणं, दर्पः, गर्व्वः, अभिमानं, आहोपु-<BR>रुषिका, अहमहमिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boasted
BOASTED, p. p. श्लाघितः -ता -तं, परिकीर्त्तितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boaster
BOASTER, s. आत्मश्लाघी m. (न्), विकत्थी m. (न्), -त्थिनी f., -त्थनः,<BR>उपजल्पी m. (न्), दम्भी m. (न्), शूरम्मन्यः, शूरमानी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boastful
BOASTFUL, a. दाम्भिकः -की -कं, दम्भी -म्भिनी -म्भि (न्), गर्व्वितः -ता -तं,<BR>गर्व्वपूर्णः -र्णा -र्णं, विकत्थनः -ना -नं, अवलिप्तः -प्ता -प्तं, वाचालः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boastfully
BOASTFULLY, adv. गर्व्वेण, दम्भेन, सदर्पं, सगर्व्वं, सदम्भं, विकत्थनपूर्व्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boastless
BOASTLESS, a. दम्भहीनः -ना -नं, अगर्व्वः -र्व्वा -र्व्वं, अभिमानरहितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boat
BOAT, s. नौः f., नौका, पोतः, तरी, तरणी, तरण्डः, उडुपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boatful
BOATFUL, s. नौकापूरणं, पोतपूरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boatload
BOATLOAD, s. नौकाभारः, पोतभारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boatman
BOATMAN, s. नाविकः, पोतवाहः, निर्यामः, नौकारूढः, औडुपिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

boatswain
BOATSWAIN, s. मुख्यनाविकः, प्रधाननाविकः, नाविकः, कर्णधारः, निर्या-<BR>माधिष्ठाता m. (तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bob
To BOB, v. a. (To crop) ह्रस् in caus. (ह्रासयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To beat)<BR>तड् in caus. (ताडयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bob
To BOB, v. n. (To play backwards and forwards) इतस्ततो लुठ्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">Page057-a+ 51</a>]<BR>(c. 6. लुठति, लुठितुं) or स्फुर् (c. 6. स्फुरति, स्फुरितुं) or प्रेङ्ख् (c. 1.<BR>प्रेङ्खति, प्रेङ्खितुं), दोल (nom. दोलायते -यितुं), चञ्च् (c. 1. चञ्चति, चञ्चितुं,),<BR>चञ्चल (nom. चञ्चलायते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bob
BOB, s. (Ear-ring) कुण्डलं, कर्णिका.<BR>— (A blow) प्रहारः, आघातः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bobbin
BOBBIN, s. कपालनालिका, सूत्रगण्डिका, तन्तुकीलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bobtail
BOBTAIL, s. छिन्नबालधारी m. (न्), ह्रस्वपुच्छी m. (न्), कर्त्तितलाङ्गूली m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bobtailed
BOBTAILED, a. छिन्नबालः -ला -लं, ह्रस्वपुच्छः -च्छा -च्छं, ह्रसितलाङ्गूलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bobwig
BOBWIG, s. शिरोरुहहीनैर् भृतं परकीयकॢप्तकेशनिर्म्मितं शिरस्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bode
To BODE, v. a. शुभाशुभं or मङ्गलामङ्गलं प्रदृश् in caus. (-दर्शयति -यितुं),<BR>इष्टानिष्टम् आविद् in caus. (-वेदयति -यितुं) or सूच् (c. 10. सूचयति<BR>-यितुं), पूर्व्वलिङ्गं or पूर्व्वचिह्नं or पूर्व्वलक्षणं दा (c. 3. ददाति, दातुं),<BR>निपातं or विनिपातं शंस् (c. 1. शंसति, शंसितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodement
BODEMENT, s. पूर्व्वलक्षणं, पूर्व्वचिह्नं, पूर्व्वलिङ्गं, चिह्नं, शुभाशुभलक्षणं,<BR>शुभाशुभचिह्नं, शकुनं, उत्पातः, अजन्यं, निमित्तं, उपसर्गः, उपलिङ्गः,<BR>भाविसूचकं चिह्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodice
BODICE, s. चोलः -ली, अङ्गिका, चेलिका, कञ्चुलिका, कूर्पासकः -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodied
BODIED, a. शरीरी -रिणी -रि (न्), देही -हिनी -हि (न्), अङ्गी -ङ्गिनी<BR>-ङ्गि (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodiless
BODILESS, a. अशरीरः -रा -रं or -री -रिणी -रि (न्), अनङ्गः -ङ्गा -ङ्गं,<BR>अङ्गहीनः -ना -नं, निराकारः -रा -रं, अमूर्त्तः -र्त्ता -र्त्तं, व्यङ्गः -ङ्गी -ङ्गं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodily
BODILY, a. शारीरिकः -की -कं, दैहिकः -की -कं, शरीरजः -जा -जं, कायिकः<BR>-की -कं, अङ्गकः -का -की -कं, आङ्गः -ङ्गी -ङ्गं.<BR>— (Bodily hardship)<BR>कायक्लेशः, देहक्लेशः, कृच्छ्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodily
BODILY, adv. शरीरतस्, सदेहं, सशरीरं, सकायं, साङ्गं.<BR>— (In a mass)<BR>साकल्येन.<BR>— (United with the body) शरीरसंयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, शरीर-<BR>सम्पृक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bodkin
BODKIN, s. सूचिविशेषः, सूचिः -ची, सूचिनी.<BR>— (A dagger) छुरिका,<BR>शङ्कुः m.<BR>— (Instrument for piercing) आविधः, वेधनिका.<BR>— (For<BR>the hair) केशरचनायोग्यः कीलविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

body
BODY, s. (As opposed to the immaterial substance of an ani-<BR>mal) शरीरं, देहः, कायः, गात्रं, मूर्त्तिः f., अङ्गं, वपुः n. (स्), कलेवरं,<BR>वर्म्म n. (न्), विग्रहः, संहननं, तनुः f. -नूः f., करणं; ‘a dead body,’<BR>मृतशरीरं, शवः, कुणपः; ‘a little body,’ शरीरकं.<BR>— (Substance)<BR>मूर्त्तिः f.; ‘the body of cloth,’ वस्त्रयोनिः m.<BR>— (A person) पुरुषः,<BR>जनः, मनुष्पः, लोकः.<BR>— (A collective mass) समूहः, समवायः, सङ्घातः,<BR>समुदायः, मण्डलं, सङ्घः, वृन्दं, निवहः, ओघः; ‘a body of men,’<BR>जनसमूहः; ‘a body of water,’ पयोराशिः m., वारिराशिः m.; ‘in<BR>a body,’ सङ्घशस्, सङ्गम्य, समूह्य.<BR>— (A society of men) संसर्गः,<BR>समागमः, पङ्क्तिः f.<BR>— (A corporate body) श्रेणी.<BR>— (A collegiate<BR>or religious body) आश्रमः.<BR>— (Strength) बलं.<BR>— (The main<BR>part) प्रधानभागः; ‘body of a tree,’ प्रकाण्डः, स्कन्धः; ‘the body<BR>or interior of a building,’ प्रासादाभ्यन्तरं, अन्तर्वृहं, अन्तर्भवनं,<BR>भवनोदरं, भवनगर्भः.<BR>— (A body of troops) गुल्मः, सैन्यदलं, सैनिकः;<BR>‘a body of reserve,’ प्रतिग्रहः; ‘body to body,’ अङ्गाङ्गि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

body-clothes
BODY-CLOTHES, s. (Of horses) आस्तरः, पर्य्ययणं, अश्वानां गात्रवस्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

body-forth
To BODY-FORTH, v. a. रूप् (c. 10. रूपयति -यितुं), निर्मा (c. 2. -माति -मातुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

body-guard
BODY-GUARD, s. परिचरः, परिधिस्थः, अनुचरः, परिवारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bog
