bothered
BOTHERED, p. p. क्लेशितः -ता -तं, पीडितः -ता -तं, व्यथितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bottle
BOTTLE, s. काचकूपी, कूपी, कुतूः f., काचपात्रं, काचभाजनं, सुराभाजनं,<BR>मद्यभाजनं, पुटग्रीवः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=059-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bottle
