bowling-green
BOWLING-GREEN, a. गुलिकाक्रीडायोग्यं समस्थलं or समस्थलीकृतो भूभागः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bowman
BOWMAN, s. धन्वी m, (न्), धनुप्मान् m. (त्), धानुष्कः, धनुर्धारी m. (न्),<BR>धनुर्धरः, धनुर्भृत् m., इष्वासः, इषुधरः, काण्डीरः, काण्डवान् m. (त्),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=061-a" target="_blank">Page061-a+ 51</a>]<BR>निषङ्गी m. (न्), अस्त्री m. (न्), शार्ङ्गी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=060-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bowshot
BOWSHOT, s. वाणगोचरं, शरगोचरं, धनुःक्षेपणं, शरैकक्षेपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=061-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bowsprit
