brainsickness
BRAINSICKNESS, s. मूढता, चञ्चलत्वं, चपलत्वं, प्रामाद्यं, प्रमादित्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brake
BRAKE, s. (A thicket of brambles) कण्टकगहनं, गुल्मगहनं, झाटः<BR>-टं.<BR>— (A snaffle) खलीनः -नं, मुखयन्त्रणं.<BR>— (That which moves<BR>a military engine) युद्धयन्त्रवाहनं, युद्धयन्त्रचालनसाधनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=061-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bramble
