branchless
BRANCHLESS, a. शाखाहीनः -ना -नं, विटपरहितः -ता -तं, अभिन्नः -न्ना -न्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

branchy
