brand
BRAND, s. (A burning stick) उल्का, दग्धकाष्ठं, तप्तकाष्ठं.<BR>— (A mark<BR>of infamy) अपकीर्त्तिचिह्नं, अभिशस्ताङ्कः, अङ्कः, अङ्कनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brand
