braved
BRAVED, p. p. (Challenged) आहूतः -ता -तं, समाहूतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=062-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bravely
