bridewell
BRIDEWELL, s. निग्रहगृहं, निग्रहागारं, दण्डप्रणयनगृहं, कारागारं, कारा-<BR>वेश्म n. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=064-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bridge
BRIDGE, s. सेतुः m., पिण्डलः, पिण्डिलः, धरणः, संवरः, सम्बरः.<BR>— (Foot-<BR>bridge) सङ्कमः.<BR>— (A bridge of boats) नौसेतुः m.<BR>— (Of the<BR>nose) नासावंशः.<BR>— (Of a musical instrument) तन्त्रालम्बः,<BR>तन्त्रधारणार्थं काष्ठखण्डं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=064-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bridge
