bridle
BRIDLE, s. वागा, रश्मिः m., वल्गा, दन्तालिका.<BR>— (Restraint) संयमः,<BR>यमः, यन्त्रणं, निग्रहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=064-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bridle
