brocade
BROCADE, s. सुवर्णरूप्यतन्तुस्यूतं दुकूलं, कार्म्मिकवस्त्रं, नानावर्णकौशाम्बरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=066-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brocaded
