brother
BROTHER, s. भ्राता m. (तृ).<BR>— (Of whole blood) सोदरः, सहोदरः,<BR>सोदर्य्यः, समानोदर्य्यः, सगर्भः, सगर्भ्यः, सनाभिः m., स्वयोनिः m., सहजः.<BR>— (Of half blood) भिन्नोदरः.<BR>— (Half-brother, step-mother's<BR>son) वैमात्रेयः, विमातृजः.<BR>— (Brother in law, husband's brother)<BR>देवा m. (वृ), देवरः.<BR>— (Wife's brother) श्यालः.<BR>— (Brother's<BR>wife) भ्रातृजाया, प्रजावती.<BR>— (Brother and sister) भ्रातृभगिन्यौ<BR>m. du., भ्रातरौ m. du.<BR>— (Any one closely united) बन्धुः m.,<BR>बान्धवः, सजातिः m., समानगोत्रः, सहायः, सहकारी m. (न्), संसर्गी<BR>m. (न्); ‘a brother in arms,’ सहयुध्वा m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=067-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brotherhood
