BRUSHY, a. लोमशः -शा -शं, दृढलोमा -मा -म (न्), स्तब्धरोमा -मा -म (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=067-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

