BUCCANIER or BUCCANEER, s. आमेरिकादेशीयः समुद्रयायी दस्युविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buck
BUCK, s. (Male of the deer) पुम्मृगः; ‘male of the rabbit,’<BR>पुंशशकः; ‘male of the goat,’ पुंश्छागः.<BR>— (Liquor in which<BR>clothes are washed) वस्त्रधावनार्थं जलं.<BR>— (Clothes washed in<BR>that liquor) पूर्व्वोक्तजलधावितं वस्त्रं.<BR>— (A fop) दर्शनीयमानी m. (न्),<BR>सुवेशी m. (न्), रूपगर्व्वितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buck
