buckler
BUCKLER, s. चर्म्म n. (न्), फलकः -कं<BR>— (Armed with) फलकपाणिः,<BR>फलकी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buckram
