caballer
CABALLER, s. कुमन्त्रणकृत्, कुमन्त्री m. (न्), भेत्ता m. (त्तृ), भेदकरः,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=073-a" target="_blank">Page073-a+ 51</a>]<BR>राजद्रोही m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabbage
