canton
To CANTON, v. n. (To divide into parts) खण्डशस् or भागशस् or<BR>खण्डं खण्डं विभज् (c. 1. -भजति -भक्तुं) or परिकॢप् (c. 10. -कल्पयति<BR>-यितुं) or व्यंश् (c. 10. -अंशयति -यितुं).<BR>— (To canton a town for<BR>soldiers) नगरे स्वं स्वम् आवासं सैन्यानां कॢप् (c. 10. कल्पयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cantonment
CANTONMENT, s. सैन्यावासः, नगरे पृथक् पृथक् परिकल्पितं सैन्यनिवासस्थानं.<BR>— (Camp) कटकः, शिविरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

canvass
CANVASS, s. (A coarse cloth) शाणं, शणवस्त्रं, पटः, पटी, स्थूलपट्टं,<BR>स्थूलशाटिः m.<BR>— (Sails of a ship) वातवसनं.<BR>— (Solicitation upon<BR>an election) अमुकपदप्रेप्सया परसम्मतप्रार्थनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

canvass
To CANVASS, v. a. (To sift, examine) परीक्ष् (c. 1. -ईक्षते -ईक्षितुं),<BR>निरूप् (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं), अनुसन्धा (c. 3. -दधाति -धातुं).<BR>— (To<BR>debate) विचर् in caus. (-चारयति -यितुं), तर्क् (c. 10. तर्कयति -यितुं),<BR>वितर्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

canvass
