capcase
CAPCASE, s. लघुवस्त्राधारः, भाण्डं, समुद्गः -द्गकः, सम्पुटः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cape
