caper
CAPER, s. (A jump) प्लुतं, प्लवः, झम्पः, वल्गितं, उत्फालः, लङ्घनं नर्त्तनं.<BR>— (A kind of pickle) सन्धितविशेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=077-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caper
