car
CAR, s. रथः, चक्रयानं, गन्त्री, गन्त्रीरथः, शकटः; ‘of the gods,’ विमानः<BR>-नं; ‘war-car,’ स्यन्दनः, शताङ्गः; ‘pleasure-car,’ क्रीड<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=079-a" target="_blank">Page079-a+ 51</a>]<BR>पुष्परथः; ‘a covered car,’ कर्णीरथः, हयनं, प्रवहणं; ‘multitude<BR>of cars,’ रथ्या, रथकट्या; ‘car-maker,’ रथकारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carabine
