carack
CARACK, s. (A large ship of burthen) भारवाहिनी वृहन्नौका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=079-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caracole
CARACOLE, s. तिर्य्यक्प्लुतं, तिर्य्यग्वल्गितं, वक्रगतिः f., कुटिलगतिः, अर्द्धच-<BR>न्द्राकारा तुरङ्गगतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=079-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

