card
CARD, s. (A painted paper used in games of chance) क्रीडापत्रं,<BR>द्यूतपत्रं, चित्रितद्यूतपत्रं.<BR>— (The paper on which the points of<BR>the compass are marked under the needle) दिग्विदिगङ्कितं<BR>पत्रं.<BR>— (The instrument for combing wool, flax, &c.) ऊर्णा-<BR>शणादिमार्जनार्थं लोहदन्तयुक्तं यन्त्रं, ऊर्णामार्जनी, ऊर्णानिर्घर्षणयन्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=079-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

card
