CHANCE-MEDLEY, s. डिम्बाहवे अनिच्छातो नृहत्या or मनुष्पमारणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=088-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chancer
CHANCER, s. विद्रधिः m., उपदंशः, गलितक्षतं. See CANCER.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=088-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chancery
