CHAPS, s. pl. (The mouth of a beast of prey) आस्यं, मुखं, वदनं।<BR>हनुः m.<BR>— (Entrance of a channel) सङ्कटमुखं, सङ्कटप्रवेशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chapter
CHAPTER, s. (Division) अध्यायः, अध्ययह्, सर्गः, पर्व्व n. (न्), परिछेदः,<BR>विछेदः, काण्डः -ण्डं, खण्डः -ण्डं, स्कन्धः, उच्छ्वासः, आश्वासः, प्रकरणं, लम्बकः.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=089-b" target="_blank">Page089-b+ 51</a>]<BR>— (An assembly of canons) महामन्दिरे प्रधानपुरोहितानां सभा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

char
