CHASED, p. p. अनुधावितः -ता -तं, मृगितः -ता -तं, द्रावितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaser
