clothing
CLOTHING, s. परिधानं, प्रवारः, प्रच्छादनं, आच्छादनं, परिच्छदः; ‘under-<BR>clothing,’ अधोवसनं, अन्तर्वासः n. (स्), अन्तरीयं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clotpoll
