commons
COMMONS, s. pl. (The lower orders) अवरवर्णाः m. pl., अन्त्यवर्णाः.<BR>— (House of Commons) अवरसभा, प्रजाप्रतिनिधिसभा, महासभा.<BR>— (Food eaten in common) गणान्नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commonweal
