COMPARATIVELY, adv. उपमानेन, औपम्येन, सादृश्येन, उपमानपूर्व्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compare
