compared
COMPARED, p. p. उपमितः -ता -तं, उपमेतः -ता -तं, साधारणीकृतः -ता -तं,<BR>तुलितः -ता -तं, उत्प्रेक्षितः -ता -तं, समीकृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comparison
COMPARISON, s. उपमा, उपमितिः f., उपमानं, तोलनं, उत्प्रेक्षा, साधारणं,<BR>सादृश्यं, औपम्यं; ‘by comparison with one's self,’ आत्मौपम्येन;<BR>‘without comparison,’ अतुलनीयः -या -यं, अतुल्यः -ल्या -ल्यं,<BR>असाधारणः -णा -णं.<BR>— (Simile) दृष्टान्तः, उपमा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compartment
COMPARTMENT, s. (Division) छेदः, भागः, विभागः, परिच्छेदः, अंशः,<BR>खण्डः -ण्डं.<BR>— (Of an edifice) कक्षः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compass
COMPASS, s. (Circuit) परिवेष्टनं, मण्डलं, परिमण्डलं, परिधिः m., परिणाहः.<BR>— (Extent, limits) परिमाणं, पर्य्यन्तं, विस्तारः, सीमा.<BR>— (Range,<BR>reach) विषयः, परिमाणं; ‘within compass of the under-<BR>standing,’ बुद्धिगम्यः -म्या -म्यं; ‘of the ear,’ कर्णगोचर। -रा -रं.<BR>— (Due limits, moderation) परिमितत्वं, अनतिक्रमः, अप्रशक्तिः f.<BR>— (Instrument to find the quarter) दिङ्निरूपणयन्त्रं, उत्तरदिक्-<BR>प्रदेशिनी सूचिः, दिङ्निर्णययन्त्रं, दिग्लक्षणं, समुद्रपथलक्षणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compass
To COMPASS, v. a. (Surround) वेष्ट् (c. 1. वेष्टते -ष्टितुं), परिवेष्ट्, परिवृ<BR>(c. 5. -वृणोति -वरितुं -रीतुं), परिष्ठा (c. 1. -तिष्ठति -ष्ठातुं).<BR>— (Go<BR>round) परिगम् (c. 1. -गच्छति -गन्तुं), परिचर् (c. 1. -चरति -रितुं);<BR>‘reverentially,’ प्रदक्षिणीकृ.<BR>— (Attain) अधिगम् (c. 1. -गच्छति<BR>-गन्तुं), गम्, प्रतिपद् (c. 4. -पद्यते -पत्तुं), अभिपद्; आपद्; आसद् in<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">Page113-b+ 51</a>]<BR>caus. (-सादयति -यितुं), लभ् (c. 1. लभते, लब्धुं), साध् in caus.<BR>(साधयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Contrive) घट् (c. 1. घटते -टितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compass
COMPASS or COMPASSES, s. कर्कटः, कर्काटकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassion
COMPASSION, s. कारुण्यं, करुणः -णा, दया, कृपा, अनुकम्पा, घृणा,<BR>अनुक्रोशः, अनुग्रहः, दयालुता -त्वं, करुणार्द्रता, हन्तोक्तिः f., आपन्नरक्षणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassionate
To COMPASSIONATE, v. a. अनुकम्प् (c. 1. -कम्पते -म्पितुं), समनुकम्प्<BR>with acc.; दय् (c. 1. दयते -यितुं) with gen.; करुण (nom.<BR>करुणायते), कृपा (nom. कृपायते), अनुकृपा, दयां कृ, कृपां कृ, करुणां कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassionate
COMPASSIONATE, a. दयालुः -लुः -लु, कृपालुः -लुः -लु। सदयः -या -यं,<BR>कारुणिकः -की -कं, सकरुणः -णा -णं, कारुण्यवेदी -दिनी -दि (न्),<BR>घृणी -णिनी -णि (न्), करुणामयः -यी -यं, करुणार्द्रः -र्द्रा -र्द्रं, अनुकम्पी<BR>-म्पिनी -म्पि (न्), सानुकम्पः -म्पा -म्पं, सानुक्रोशः -शा -शं, कृपावान्<BR>-वती -वत् (त्), कृपामयः -यी -यं, हृदयालुः -लुः -लु, दयायुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं,<BR>दयामयः -यी -यं, दयाशीलः -ला -लं, दयाकरः -रा -रं, दयान्वितः -ता -तं,<BR>सुरतः -ता -तं, आपन्नरक्षणशीलः -ला -लं, क्षमावान् -वती -वत् (त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassionately
COMPASSIONATELY, adv. सानुकम्पं, सदयं, सकारुण्यं, कारुण्येन, कृपया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compaternity
COMPATERNITY, s. धर्म्मपितृत्वं, धर्म्मपितुर् अवस्था or दशा or भावः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatibility
COMPATIBILITY, s. योग्यता, उपयुक्तता, सम्भवः, सम्भाव्यता, अविरोधः,<BR>अविरुद्धता, अविगुणता, अनुसारित्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatible
COMPATIBLE, a. अविरुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, योग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, सम्भाव्यः -व्या -व्यं,<BR>अविगुणः -णा -णं, अनुसारी -रिणी -रि (न्), अनुगुणः -णा -णं, उपयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatibly
COMPATIBLY, adv. अविरुद्धं, अविगुणं, उपयुक्तं, अनुसारात् -रेण -रतस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatriot
COMPATRIOT, s. स्वदेशजः, स्वदेशीयः, एकदेशीयः, एकदेशवासी m. (न्),<BR>सांस्थानिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compeer
COMPEER, s. वयस्यः, तुल्यपदभाक् m. (ज्), समानपदस्थः, समानवयस्कः,<BR>सवयाः m. (स्), तुल्यवृत्तिः, प्रतियोगी m. (न्), सङ्गी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compel
To COMPEL, v. a. Expressed by the causal form, usually in<BR>conjunction with the adverb बलात् or बलेन; as, ‘the king<BR>should compel him to pay,’ तं राजा बलाद् दापयेत्; ‘he com-<BR>pels the Brahmans to perform the sacrifice,’ ब्राह्मणान् यज्ञं<BR>कारयति. The root अर्ह् (c. 1. अर्हति -र्हितुं) has sometimes<BR>the sense of ‘being compelled’; as, ‘he is compelled to<BR>pay,’ दातुम् अर्हति. In modern Sanskrit such expressions<BR>as the following are found; ‘They compelled him to<BR>bear a burden, भारं वोढुं तं बलाद् दध्रुः (root धृ); ‘Compel the<BR>people to come,’ लोकान् आगन्तुं प्रवर्त्तय. See CONSTRAIN.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compellable
COMPELLABLE, a. Expressed by the fut. pass. part. of the<BR>causal form; as, ‘compellable to pay,’ दापनीयः -या -यं, दाप्यः<BR>-प्या -प्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compellation
COMPELLATION, s. आभाषणं, आमन्त्रणं, अभिवादः, सम्बोधनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compelled
COMPELLED, p. p. Expressed by the pass. part. of the causal<BR>form; as ‘compelled to pay,’ दापितः -ता -तं. The adverb<BR>बलात्, or बलेन may be joined with it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compeller
COMPELLER, s. कारपिता m. (तृ), प्रवर्त्तकः, प्रयोजकः, प्रेरकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendious
COMPENDIOUS, a. साङ्क्षेपिकः -की -कं, सामासिकः -की -कं, संक्षिप्तः -प्ता -प्तं,<BR>समस्तः -स्ता -स्तं, सङ्गृहीतः -ता -तं, परिमितः -ता -तं, अविस्तीर्णः -र्णा -र्णं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendiously
COMPENDIOUSLY, adv. संक्षेपेण, संक्षेपात्, संक्षेपतस्, समासतस्, अविस्तरेण,<BR>अविस्तरशस्, संक्षिप्तप्रकारेण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendiousness
COMPENDIOUSNESS, s. संक्षिप्तता, संक्षिप्तिः f., संक्षेपः, उपसंक्षेपः, समस्तत्वं,<BR>समासः, संहारः, चुम्बकत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compend
COMPEND or COMPENDIUM, s. संक्षेपः, सङ्ग्रहः, प्रत्याहारः, संहारः,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">Page114-a+ 51</a>]<BR>उपसंहारः, उपसंक्षेपः, संहिता, सारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=113-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensable
COMPENSABLE, a. परितोषणीयः -या -यं, प्रतिफलार्हः -र्हा -र्हं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensate
To COMPENSATE, v. a. परितुष् in caus. (-तोषयति -यितुं), पारितोषिकं<BR>or प्रतिफलं or निष्कृतिं दा (c. 3. ददाति, दातुं), निष्कृ, अपाकृ, प्रतिकृ,<BR>शुध् in caus. (शोधयति -यितुं), परिशुध्, निस्तारं कृ.<BR>— (Be equiva-<BR>lent) तुल्यीभू, तुल्यबलः -ला -लम् अस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensated
COMPENSATED, p. p. प्रतिफलितः -ता -तं, प्रत्युपकृतः -ता -तं, परितोषितः -ता -तं,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensation
COMPENSATION, s. पारितोषिकं, निष्कृतिः f., निस्तारः, प्रतिफलं, प्रत्युपकारः,<BR>क्षतिपूरणं, दण्डः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensative
COMPENSATIVE, a. पारितोषिकः -की -कं, प्रत्युपकारी -रिणी -रि (न्),<BR>क्षतिपूरकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competence
COMPETENCE or COMPETENCY, s. (Adequacy, sufficiency) सामर्थ्यं,<BR>योग्यत्वं, उपयुक्तत्वं, युक्तता, औचित्यं, सम्भावना, सामयिकसम्भावना,<BR>निर्वाहः<BR>— (Fortune sufficient for subsistence) वृत्त्युचितं धनं,<BR>जीवननिर्वाहसमर्थं धनं.<BR>— (Bare subsistence, food and clothing)<BR>ग्रासाच्छादनं, अशनाच्छादनं (or -ने).<BR>— (Enough) अलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competent
COMPETENT, a. (Adequate) शक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, क्षमः -मा -मं, योग्यः -ग्या<BR>-ग्यं, उपयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, उचितः -ता -तं, समर्थः -र्था -र्थं, पर्य्याप्तः -प्ता -प्तं.<BR>— (Adequate to any work) कार्य्यक्षमः -मा -मं, कर्म्मक्षमः -मा -मं,<BR>अलङ्कर्मीणः -णा -णं, कृती -तिनी -ति (न्).<BR>— (Reasonable, mode-<BR>rate) मितः -ता -तं, परिमितः -ता -तं, समः -मा -मं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competently
COMPETENTLY, adv. पर्य्याप्तं, युक्तं, उपयुक्तं, उचितं, सामर्थ्येन, योग्यप्रकारेण.<BR>— (Sufficiently) अलं, यथावत्.<BR>— (Moderately) परिमितं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competible
COMPETIBLE, a. योग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, अविरुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं. See COMPATIBLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competition
COMPETITION, s. जिगीषा, विजिगीषा, स्पर्द्धा, प्रतिस्पर्द्धा, आस्पर्द्धा, सङ्घर्षः,<BR>अहम्पूर्व्विका, परस्पराभिभवेच्छा, उपप्लवः, समवायः; ‘of buyers,’ प्रयामः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competitor
COMPETITOR, s. जिगीषुः m., विजिगीषुः m., स्पर्द्धी m. (न्), प्रतिस्पर्द्धी<BR>m. (न्), अभियोक्ता m. (क्तृ), अर्थी m. (न्), दायादः, प्रतिपक्षः, एका-<BR>र्थाभिलापी m. (न्), एकचेष्टः, प्रतियोगी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compilation
COMPILATION, s. सङ्ग्रहः -हणं, सङ्क्षेपः, संहारः, समाहारः, समाहृतिः f.,<BR>संहिता, खिलः -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compile
To COMPILE, v. a. समाहृ (c. 1. -हरति -हर्त्तुं), संहृ, उद्धृ; सङ्ग्रह् (c. 9.<BR>-गृह्लाति -ग्रहीतुं), संक्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compiled
COMPILED, p. p. समाहृतः -ता -तं, संहृतः -ता -तं, सङ्गृहीतः -ता -तं, संक्षिप्तः<BR>-प्ता -प्तं, प्रणीतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compiler
COMPILER, s. व्यासः, समाहर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), उद्धर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), निबन्धा m. (न्धृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=114-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complacence
