congestible
CONGESTIBLE, a. सञ्चयनीयः -या -यं, एकराशीकरणीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=123-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congestion
CONGESTION, s. (Of blood) रक्तावरोधः, रक्तावष्टम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=123-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglobate
