conglobate
CONGLOBATE, a. एकपिण्डीभूतः -ता -तं, मण्डलीभूतः -ता -तं, एकमण्डला-<BR>कारः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=123-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglobation
