connexive
CONNEXIVE, a. यौक्तिकः -की -कं, सम्बन्धकः -का -कं, आनुषङ्गिकः -की -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=125-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

