consequent
CONSEQUENT, s. प्रयोगः, अनुषङ्गः, अनुवृत्तं, फलं, अन्वयः, परिणामः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequential
CONSEQUENTIAL, a. (Full of conceit) गर्व्वी -र्व्विणी -र्व्वि (न्), साटोपः<BR>-पा -पं, मानी -निनी -नि (न्).<BR>— (Following as effect and cause)<BR>प्रयुक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, आनुषङ्गिकः -की -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequentially
CONSEQUENTIALLY, adv. प्रयोगतस्, प्रयुक्तं.<BR>— (Arrogantly) साटोपं, सगर्व्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequently
CONSEQUENTLY, adv. प्रयोगतस्, प्रयुक्तं, कार्य्यतस्, कार्य्यवशात्, अनुसारेण,<BR>तदनुसारतस्, इति हेतोः, अतस्, अर्थात्, तदर्थं, तस्य हेतोः, तन्निमित्ते,<BR>अंवश्यं, इति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequentness
