conserve
CONSERVE, s. मिष्टं, मोदकः -कं, खण्डमोदकः, खण्डः, सन्धितं, सन्धानं, गुडकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consession
CONSESSION, s. सहासनं, उपासनं, अन्येन सह उपवेशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=126-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

