consist
To CONSIST, v. n. संस्था (c. 1. -तिष्ठति -स्थातुं), परिसंस्था, अवस्था, विष्ठा,<BR>सम्भू, वृत् (c. 1. वर्त्तते -र्त्तितुं), संवृत्.<BR>— (Be comprised, be com-<BR>posed) अन्तर्गतः -ता -तं भू. But in this sense आत्मकः -का<BR>-त्मिका -कं or रूपः -पा -पं are used; as, ‘the army consists<BR>of elephants, horses, and infantry,’ हस्त्यश्वपादातात्मकं बलं;<BR>‘the country consists of valleys and mountains,’ दरीपर्व्व-<BR>तरूपो विषयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=127-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

