COUNTERSIGN, s. प्रत्याभिज्ञानं.<BR>— (Watchword) सम्भाषा, संविद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

counter-tenor
COUNTER-TENOR, s. उदात्तविपरीतः स्वरमार्गः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

counter-tide
COUNTER-TIDE, s. प्रतिवेला, विपरीतवेला, प्रतिरयः, विपरीतप्रवाहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

countervail
To COUNTERVAIL, v. a. तुल्यबलः -ला -लम् अस्, तुल्यीभू, समानबलीभू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

countess
COUNTESS, s. विशिष्टपदस्थितस्य कुलीनपुरुषस्य पत्नी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

counting
COUNTING, s. गणनं -ना.<BR>— (Counting-house) लेख्यस्थानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

countless
COUNTLESS, a. असंख्येयः -या -यं, असंख्यः -ख्या -ख्यं, असंख्यकः -का -कं,<BR>अगण्यः -ण्या -ण्यं, अगणनीयः -या -यं, लक्षगुणः -णा -णं, अस्तसंख्यः -ख्या -ख्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country
COUNTRY, s. (A region) देशः, प्रदेशः, विषयः, राष्ट्रं, दिक् f. (श्),<BR>आशा, तायिकः, धिष्ण्यं; ‘inhabitated country,’ जनपदः, नीवृत्;<BR>‘barbarous country,’ म्लेच्छदेशः.<BR>— (As opposed to the town)<BR>ग्रामः, जनपदः.<BR>— (Native country) जन्मभूमिः f., स्वदेशः, स्वराष्ट्रं,<BR>स्वविषयः.<BR>— (Country-road) दिङ्मार्गः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country
COUNTRY, a. जानपदः -दी -दं, ग्राम्यः -म्या -म्यं, ग्रामीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country-dance
COUNTRY-DANCE, s. पंक्तिक्रमेण सम्मुखस्थानां स्त्रीपुरुषाणां नृत्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country-house
COUNTRY-HOUSE, s. जाङ्गलप्रदेशे गृहं, पौरजनस्य नगरोपान्ते खेलिगृहं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country-life
COUNTRY-LIFE, s. जानपदानां व्यवहारः or व्यापारः, जनपदे or जङ्गलदेशे<BR>वर्त्तनं, वनवर्त्तिभिः प्रवृत्तं जीवनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

countryman
COUNTRYMAN, s. (Rustic) जानपदः, ग्राम्यजनः, ग्रामवासी m. (न्),<BR>ग्रामी m. (न्), ग्रामीयः.<BR>— (Fellow-countryman) स्वदेशीयः,<BR>स्वदेशजः, एकदेशस्थः, संस्थः, सांस्थानिकः, एकग्रामीणः, एकपौरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

country-parson
COUNTRY-PARSON, s. ग्राम्यगुरुः m., ग्रामवासिनाम् आचार्य्यः, जानपदानां<BR>पुरोहितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

county
COUNTY, s. मण्डलं, चक्रं, देशः, प्रदेशः, राष्ट्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

couple
COUPLE, s. (A brace) मिथुनं, द्वम्द्वं, युगं, युग्मं, युगलं, यमलं, यामलं,<BR>यमः, यमकं, द्वयं in comp.; as, ‘a couple of men,’ पुरुषद्वयं;<BR>‘a couple of oxen,’ गोयुगं, गोमिथुनं; ‘a married couple,’<BR>दम्पती m. du. भार्य्यापती m. du.<BR>— (A tie for fastening two dogs<BR>together) कुक्कुरद्वयसम्बन्धनार्थं रज्जुः or शुङ्खला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

couple
To COUPLE, v. a. संयुज् (c. 7. -युनक्ति -योक्तुं), सन्धा (c. 3. -दधाति -धातुं),<BR>संश्लिष् in caus. (-श्लेषयति -यितुं), सम्बन्ध् (c. 9. -बध्नाति -बन्धुं), एकत्र कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

couple
