courtship
COURTSHIP, s. (Of a woman) विवाहार्थं प्रार्थनं -ना or याच्ञा, स्त्र्युपासनं.<BR>— (Soliciting favour) आराधनं, अनुरञ्जनं, भजनं, आनन्दनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

court-yard
COURT-YARD, s. अङ्गनं, प्राङ्गणं, चत्वरं, चतुःशालं -ला, अभ्यन्तरचतुःशालकः,<BR>अजिरं, गृहाङ्गणं, गृहप्राङ्गणं, प्रकोष्ठः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cousin
COUSIN, s. (Male, by father's brother) पितृव्यपुत्रः, पितृभ्रात्रीयः.<BR>— (Female) पितृव्यपुत्री, पितृभ्रात्रीया.<BR>— (Male, by father's<BR>sister) पितृष्वस्रीयः, पितृष्वसेयः.<BR>— (Female) पितृष्वस्रीया, पितृष्व-<BR>सेयी.<BR>— (Male, by mother's brother) मातुलपुत्रः, मातृभ्रात्रीयः.<BR>— (Female) मातुलपुत्री, मातृभ्रात्रीया.<BR>— (Male, by mother's<BR>sister) मातृष्वस्रीयः, मातृष्वसेयः.<BR>— (Female) मातृष्वस्रीया, मातृष्व-<BR>सेयी.<BR>— (A kinsman) ज्ञातिः m., बान्धवः, सहजमित्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cove
COVE, s. वङ्कः, खल्लः, खातं, अखातं, पोतबन्धनस्थानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

covenant
COVENANT, s. नियमः, संविद् f., समयः, पणः, सङ्घट्टनं, समाधिः m.,<BR>उपगमः, संश्रवः; ‘written covenant,’ नियमपत्रं; ‘covenant-<BR>breaker,’ समयभेदी m. (न्), नियमलङ्घी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=141-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

covenant
