crumpling
CRUMPLING, s. (The act of crumpling) कुञ्चनं, सङ्कोचनं, सम्मर्द्दः,<BR>अवमर्द्दः.<BR>— (Fruit) शिथिलत्वग्विशिष्टं क्षुद्रफलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

crupper
