crustaceous
CRUSTACEOUS, a. कवची -चिनी -चि (न्), काम्बवः -वी -वं, वल्कवान्<BR>-वती -वत् (त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=149-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

crustily
