curbed
CURBED, p. p. शृङ्खलितः -ता -तं, यन्त्रितः -ता -तं, संयतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

curb-stone
