depravation
DEPRAVATION, s. (Act of depraving) दूषणं, भ्रष्टीकरणं.<BR>— (State) दुष्टता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=171-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

deprave
