DEPRECIATION, s. अपकर्षः -र्षणं, लघूकरणं, न्यूनीकरणं, अवमानं, ह्रासः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

depredate
