disciplinable
DISCIPLINABLE, a. शासनीयः -या -यं, शास्यः -स्या -स्यं, शिक्षणीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=187-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

