DISFIGURATION, s. विरूपकरणं, अपरूपीकरणं, कदाकारकरणं, विकृतिकरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfigure
To DISFIGURE, v. a. विरूप् (c. 10. -रूपयति -यितुं), विरूपीकृ, अपरूपीकृ,<BR>कुरूपीकृ, विकृ, कदाकारीकृ, व्यङ्गीकृ, विकलीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

