disorganize
To DISORGANIZE, DISORGANIZED. See To DISORDER, DISORDERED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=194-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disown
