drinker
DRINKER, s. पाता m. (तृ), पायी m. (न्), पानरतः, पानप्रसक्तः, मद्यपीतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

drinking
DRINKING, s. पानं, पीतिः f., निपानं, आचमनं; ‘drinking together,’<BR>सम्पीतिः f., सपीतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

drinking-vessel
DRINKING-VESSEL, s. पानपात्रं, पानभाजनं, पानयोग्यभाजनं, आचमनो-<BR>-पयुक्तपात्रं, चषकः, सरकः, अनुतर्षः -र्षणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

drip
