drip
DRIP, s. (Edge of a roof) पटलप्रान्तः, वलिकः -कं, नीध्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=210-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

