be enamoured
To BE ENAMOURED, v. n. अनुरागवान् -वती -वत् or अनुरक्तः -क्ता -क्तं<BR>or आसक्तः -क्ता -क्तं भू or अस् with inst. c. or loc. c., अनुरञ्ज्<BR>in pass. (-रज्यते) आसञ्ज् in pass. (-सज्यते). with loc. c., सह्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=226-a" target="_blank">Page226-a+ 51</a>]<BR>(c. 4. मुह्यति, मोहितुं); ‘he is enamoured with her,’ तया<BR>अनुरागवान् अस्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=225-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enamoured
