engineering
ENGINEERING, s. यन्त्रकारस्य व्यापारः or कर्म्म n. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=229-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

