enthrone
To ENTHRONE, v. a. राजासने or सिहासने उपविश् in caus. (-वेश-<BR>-यति -यितुं) or अध्यास् in caus. (-आसयति -यितुं), राज्ये अभिपिच्<BR>(c. 6. -पिञ्चति -षेक्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enthroned
ENTHRONED, p. p. सिंहासनोपविष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, सिंहासनाध्यासितः -ता -तं,<BR>अध्यासीनः -ना -नं, राज्ये अभिपिक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=232-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enthronement
