enticement
ENTICEMENT, s. आकर्षणं, आकृष्टिः f., प्रलोभनं, विलोभनं, मोहनं, विमोहनं,<BR>मोहः, लोभः, लालनं, लोभदर्शनं, वञ्चनं, प्रलम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enticer
