ENUNCIATED, p. p. उच्चारितः -ता -तं, उदीरितः -ता -तं, उदाहृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enunciation
ENUNCIATION, s. उच्चारणं, उदीरणं, उदाहरणं, व्याहारः -हरणं, समुदाहरणं,<BR>ख्यापनं, विज्ञापनं, प्रकीर्त्तनं, प्रकाशनं, घोषणा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

enunciative
ENUNCIATIVE, a. उच्चारकः -का -कं, ख्यापकः -का -कं, आवेदकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

envelop
To ENVELOP, v. a. आवेष्ठ् (c. 1. -वेष्टते -ष्टितुं), परिवेष्ट्, संवेष्ट्, आछद्<BR>(c. 10. -छादयति -यितुं), परिछद्, समाछद्, प्रछद्, प्रतिछद्, संछद्;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=233-b" target="_blank">Page233-b+ 51</a>]<BR>परिवृ (c. 5. -वृणोति -वरितुं -रीतुं), आवृ; पिधा (c. 3. -दधाति -धातुं),<BR>कोशेन परिवेष्ट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

envelope
