except
EXCEPT, prep. वर्ज्जयित्वा, अपास्य, अपहाय, भुक्ता all with acc. c.,<BR>विना with inst. or acc. c., ऋते with abl. or acc. c., अन्तरेण,<BR>अन्तरा, व्यतिरेकेण, व्यतिरिक्तं, वर्ज्जं, अन्यत्र, पृथक्.<BR>— (Unless) यदि<BR>न. Sometimes expressed by the loc. absolute; as, ‘ex-<BR>-cept ye eat flesh,’ आमिषे न भुक्ते or by the indecl. part.; as,<BR>‘except ye see,’ न दृष्ट्वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

