exchanger
EXCHANGER, s. परिवर्त्तकः, परिवर्त्तनकृत्, विनिमयकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), विमय-<BR>-कारी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

exchequer
EXCHEQUER, s. (Treasury) राजकोषः, राजधनागारः, राजधनगृहं।<BR>राजस्वकोषः; ‘chancellor of the exchequer,’ कोषाध्यक्षः, कोषा<BR>धीशः, कोशाधीशः, राजधनाधिकारी m. (न्), राजस्वपालकः, गञ्जाधिपः<BR>— (Court). See CHANCERY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

