fabrication
FABRICATION, s. (Construction) निर्म्माणं, निर्म्मितिः f., रचना, विरचना,<BR>कल्पनं -ना, घटनं.<BR>— (Falsehood, forgery) मनःकल्यितं, मिथ्याकथा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=254-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fabricator
