fag
FAG, s. दासः, निरन्तरायासी m. (न्), अतिश्रमेण नीचकर्म्मकारी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=255-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fag-end
FAG-END, s. अन्तः -न्तं, अग्रं, अग्रभागः, शेषभागः.<BR>— (Refuse) शेषः,<BR>अवशिष्टं, उच्छिष्टं, परभागः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=256-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

