FAINT-HEARTEDLY, adv. भीरुवत्, भीतवत्, कापुरुषवत्, कातर्य्येण, चकितं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=256-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

