falcon
FALCON, s. श्येनः, कपोतारिः m., घातिपक्षी m. (न्), खगान्तकः, शशादनः,<BR>पत्री m. (न्), नीलपिच्छः, कपोताद्यनुसरणे शिक्षितः श्येनः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

falconer
FALCONER, s. श्येनजीवी m. (न्), श्येनपोषकः, श्येनपालकः, श्येनशिक्षकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=257-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

