farinaceous
FARINACEOUS, a. शस्यमयः -यी -यं, धान्यमयः -यी -यं, गोधूमचूर्णमयः -यी -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=260-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

farm
