faster
FASTER, s. उपवासी m. (न्), उपवासकर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ), कृतोपवासः, सोपवासः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=261-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

faster
FASTER, adv. (More rapidly) शीघ्रतरं, अधिकवेगेन, लघुतरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=261-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fastidious
FASTIDIOUS, a. उपेक्षकः -का -कं, अवमानी -निनी -नि (न्), सावहेलः<BR>-ला -लं, सावज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं, घृणी -णिनी -णि (न्), दुस्तोषणीयः -या -यं,<BR>दुःखतोषणीयः -या -यं, दुःखेन सन्तोषणीयः -या -यं or तर्पणीयः -या -यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=261-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

