feasting
FEASTING, s. उत्सवकरणं, परमान्नभोजनं, उत्तमाहारकरणं, सहभोजनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=264-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

feat
