fellow-commoner
FELLOW-COMMONER, s. विद्यालये आचार्य्यगणसहभोजी कुलीनछात्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fellow-councilor
