fellow-countryman
FELLOW-COUNTRYMAN, s. स्वदेशजः, स्वदेशीयः, एकदेशीयः, एकदेशवासी m.<BR>(न्), एकस्थानजः, सांस्थानिकः, संस्थः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=265-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fellow-creature
