found
To FOUND, v. a. (Lay the foundation) मूलं न्यस् (c. 4. -अस्यति<BR>-असितुं) or धा (c. 3. दधाति, धातु) or रुह् in caus. (रोपयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Build) निर्मा (c. 2. -माति -तुं or in caus. मापयति -यितुं), कृ<BR>in caus. (कारयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Establish) स्था in caus. (स्थापयति<BR>-यितुं), प्रतिष्ठा, अवस्था, संस्था, रुह् in caus., प्रतिनिधा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=289-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

foundation
