FRANTICNESS, s. उन्मत्तता, उन्मादः, उन्मादसंरब्धता, चित्तविक्षिप्तता,<BR>चित्तव्यस्तता, चित्तविप्लवः, विमोहः, सोन्मादत्वं, वातुलता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fraternal
FRATERNAL, a. भ्रात्रीयः -या -यं, भ्रातृकः -का -कं, भ्रातृसन्निभः -भा -भं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fraternally
FRATERNALLY, adv. भ्रातृवत्, भ्रातृरूपेण, सोदरवत्, भ्रात्रीयप्रकारेण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fraternity
FRATERNITY, s. (Brotherhood) भ्रातृत्वं, सौभ्रात्रं.<BR>— (Association)<BR>संसर्गः, संसर्गित्वं, साहित्यं, बन्धुता.<BR>— (Body of men associated)<BR>सहकारिजनसमूहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

fraternize
