freakishness
FREAKISHNESS, s. चापल्यं, चपलता, लौल्यं, लीलावत्त्वं, विलासिता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

freckle
