fulfilling
FULFILLING, part. पूरयन् -यन्ती -यत् (त्), पूरणः -णा -णी -णं, सम्पादकः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=296-a" target="_blank">Page296-a+ 51</a>]<BR>-का -कं, निष्पादनः -ना -नं, समापकः -का -कं; ‘fulfilling the<BR>desires,’ कामपूरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=295-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

