furthest
FURTHEST, FURTHERMOST, a. दूरतमः -मा -मं, विदूरतमः -मा -मं, दविष्ठः<BR>-ष्ठा -ष्ठं, सुदूरः -रा -रं, अत्पन्तदूरः -रा -रं, अतिदूरस्थः -स्था -स्थं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

furthest
FURTHEST, adv. दूरतमं, विदूरतमं, सुदूरं, अत्यन्तदूरं, दविष्ठं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=298-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

