gain
To GAIN, v. n. (Have advantage) लाभं कृ, फलं कृ.<BR>— (Grow rich,<BR>prosper) समृद्धीभू, समृध् (c. 5. -ऋध्नोति -अर्धितुं), वृध् (c. 1. वर्धते<BR>-र्धितुं).<BR>— (Advance on, encroach) क्रमे क्रमे प्रसृप् (c. 1. -सर्पति<BR>-स्रप्तुं) or प्रगम् (c. 1. -गच्छति -गन्तुं).<BR>— (Prevail against) अतिरिच्<BR>in pass. (-रिच्यते), अभिभू, प्रभू, जि (c. 1. जयति, जेतुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=299-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

