GAMMON, s. (Dried hog's flesh) वल्लूरं, शूकरस्य शुष्कमांसं or वासि-<BR>-तमांसं.<BR>— (Game) चर्म्मपट्टिकाक्रीडा, शारिक्रीडा.<BR>— (Imposition, hoax)<BR>छलं, वञ्चनं, कपटः, दम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

