giddily
GIDDILY, adv. भ्रामररोगग्रस्तवत्, सभ्रामरं, चपलं, मनोलौल्यात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=306-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

giddiness
