girlish
GIRLISH, a. कन्यायोग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं, कुमारीयोग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=307-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

