hand-breadth
HAND-BREADTH, s. एकहस्तपरिमाणं, एककरपरिमाणं, पाणितलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handcuff
