HAZARDED, p. p. संशयितः -ता -तं, दैववशङ्गमितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hazarder
