HAZARDOUSNESS, s. सन्दिग्धता, भयाक्रान्तता, दैवाधीनता, दैवायत्तत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=335-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

haze
