HEALTHFULLY, adv. अरोगेण, सारोग्यं, निरामयं, स्वास्थ्येन, कुशलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=336-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

healthfulness
