hearkener
HEARKENER, s. श्रोता m. (तृ), श्रवणकारी m. (न्), निशमनकारी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=337-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

