heptagonal
HEPTAGONAL, a. सप्तास्रः -स्रा -स्रं, सप्तकोणः -णा -णं, सप्तभुजः -जा -जं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

her
HER, pron. तां acc. c. f. (तद्), इमां acc. c. f. (इदं); ‘of her,’ तस्याः,<BR>अस्याः; as, ‘her house,’ तस्या गृहं; ‘her own,’ expressed by<BR>स्व; as, ‘her own house,’ स्वगृहं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

herald
