herb
HERB, s. ओषधिः -धी f., शाकः, तृणं, लता, हरितकं, अर्भः, कन्दः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

