HERBAGE, s. तृणं, घासः, यवसः, गवादनं, गवादिखाद्यं, क्षेत्रियं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

