HERBID, a. तृणाद्यावृतः -ता -तं, तृणादिविशिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

