here
HERE, adv. (In this place) अत्र, इह, इहस्थाने, अस्मिन् देशे.<BR>— (In<BR>this world) इह, इहलोके, इहकाले; ‘in this world and the<BR>next,’ इहामुत्र; ‘on this occasion,’ इहसमये; ‘here am I,’<BR>सोऽहं, एषोऽस्मि; ‘here we are,’ इमे स्मः; ‘here and there,’<BR>इतस्ततस्, इतश्चेतस्, प्रतिदेशं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=341-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

