hoop
HOOP, s. (Any thing circular) चक्रं, चक्रवालं, वलयः -यं.<BR>— (For<BR>playing with) क्रीडाचकं, क्रीढावलयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=348-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hoop
To HOOP, v. a. (Bind with hoops) लोहवलयान् बन्ध् (c. 9. बध्नाति,<BR>बन्द्धं), लोहचक्रादिभिर् युज् (c. 10. योजयति -यितुं).<BR>— (Shout out)<BR>चित्कारं कृ, चित्कारशब्दं कृ, उच्चैःस्वरेण उद्घुष् (c. 10. -घोषयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=349-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hooper
