if
IF, conj. यदि, चेत् usually used with the indicative; as, ‘if<BR>he live he will behold prosperity,’ यदि जीवति भद्राणि पश्यति;<BR>‘if there be need of me,’ यदि मया प्रयोजनम् अस्ति; ‘if<BR>avarice were abandoned, who would be poor?’ तृष्णा चेत्<BR>परित्यक्ता को दरिद्रः.<BR>— (As if) इव.<BR>— (If so) यद्येवं.<BR>— (If not)<BR>यदि न, न चेत्, नो चेत्, न वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=357-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

