INTERNODE, s. (In botany) ग्रन्थिद्वयमध्यं, पर्व्वद्वयमध्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=405-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

