intimate
INTIMATE, s. (A friend) सुपरिचितः, दृढसुहृद् m., दृढमित्रं, सुसंसर्गी m.<BR>(न्), सुहृत्तमः, प्रियसुहृद्, प्रियवयस्यः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=407-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimate
