investment
INVESTMENT, s. (Clothes) परिधानं, आच्छादनं, वस्त्रं.<BR>— (Besieging,<BR>surrounding) अवरोधः -धनं, प्रतिरोधः, रोधः, वेष्टनं, परिवेष्टनं -वेष्टः,<BR>उद्वेष्टः, पर्य्यवष्टम्भनं.<BR>— (Laying out money) धनप्रयोगः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=411-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

