iterative
ITERATIVE, a. पुनर्वादी -दिनी -दि (न्), पुनःकारी -रिणी -रि (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=416-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

