jack
JACK, s. (Instrument for pulling off boots) पादुकानिष्कर्षणयन्त्रं.<BR>— (Instrument for turning a spit) यन्त्रं यद्द्वारेण पाकशूलः परि-<BR>वर्त्तते.<BR>— (A fish) जलसूचिः m.<BR>— (Coat of mail) कवचः -चं, तनुत्रं.<BR>— (Horse, wooden frame) मञ्चः, वृक्षः, उपस्तम्भः, आधारः.<BR>—<BR>(Male of certain animals) expressed by पुं prefixed.<BR>— (Flag<BR>at the end of a bow-sprit) नौकाग्रवहिःप्रलम्बो ध्वजपटः.<BR>— (Bread-<BR>fruit tree) पनसः, पनसनालिका, कगदकिफलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=416-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

