kneepan
KNEEPAN, s. जानुफलकं, कपोली, नलकिनी, अष्ठीवत् n., जानुफलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=429-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knee-tribute
KNEE-TRIBUTE, s. जानुपूजा, जानुभ्यां पूजा, जानुनतिपूर्व्वा सेवा or अर्चना.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=429-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knell
