loutishness
LOUTISHNESS, s. स्थूलता -त्वं, स्थौल्यं, बुद्धिस्थूलता, ग्राम्यता, अशिष्टता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

louver
