love-quarrel
LOVE-QUARREL, s. प्रीतिकलहः, प्रेमकलहः, प्रणयकोपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lover
LOVER, s. प्रणयी m. (न्), प्रियः, कान्तः, नायकः, रमणः, रमकः, रमः,<BR>दयितः, वल्लभः, कामी m. (न्), हृदयेशः, प्राणेशः, जीवितेशः, प्राण-<BR>पतिः m., प्रियतमः, बन्धुः m., इष्टः: ‘lover of knowledge,’ विद्या-<BR>नुरागी m. (न्), ज्ञानेप्सुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-shaft
LOVE-SHAFT, s. मदनशरः, स्मरशरः, कामशरः, कन्दर्पवाणः, मदनेषुः m.<BR>The god of love is fabled by the Hindūs as having five<BR>arrows, each tipped with the blossom of a flower. See<BR>KAMADEVA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-sick
LOVE-SICK, a. कामरोगी -गिणी -गि (न्), मदनरोगी &c., कामातुरः -रा<BR>-रं, कामार्त्तः -र्त्ता -र्त्तं, कामपीडितः -ता -तं, मदनपीडितः &c., काम-<BR>विह्वलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-song
LOVE-SONG, s. मदनगीतं, प्रेमगीतं, शृङ्गारगीतं, शृङ्गारगानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-tale
LOVE-TALE, s. कामकथा, शृङ्गारकथा, मदनकथा, प्रेमकथा, शृङ्गारव्या-<BR>ख्यानं, प्रेमव्याख्यानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

