LOVE-TRICK, s. प्रेमक्रीडा, अनङ्गक्रीडा, हावः, भावः, ललितं, विलासः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=468-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loving
