MANNERISM, s. एकरीतिसेवनं, एकरसासक्तिः f., अनन्यरससेवनं, एकरसत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=481-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

