midst
MIDST, s. or adv. मध्यं, मध्ये, अन्तरं -रे; ‘in the midst,’ मध्ये;<BR>‘from the midst,’ मध्यात्; ‘to be in the midst of troubles,’<BR>दुःखग्रस्तः -स्ता -स्तं भू, दुःखसागरमग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं भू. Sometimes<BR>मध्ये is put first in a compound; as, ‘in the midst of the<BR>sea,’ मध्येसमुद्रं, मध्येऽर्णवं,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=499-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

