minikin
MINIKIN, a. अतिसूक्ष्मः -क्ष्मा -क्ष्मं, अत्पल्यः -ल्या -ल्यं, अणुकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=502-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

minim
