misgovern
To MISGOVERN, v. a. असम्यक् पाल् (c. 10. पालयति -यितुं) or शास्<BR>(c. 2. शास्ति -सितुं), असम्यक्पालनं कृ, कुशासनं कृ, असम्यक्शासनं<BR>कृ, असत्पालनं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

misgoverned
MISGOVERNED, p. p. असम्यक्पालितः -ता -तं, कुशासितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

misgovernment
MISGOVERNMENT, MISGOVERNANCE, s. असम्यक्पालनं, असम्यक्शासनं,<BR>कुशासनं, कुशास्तिः f., असत्पालनं, अन्यथाशासनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=506-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

misguide
