misproportioned
MISPROPORTIONED, a. विषमप्रमाणः -णा -णं, असमप्रमाणकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=507-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

