mortally
MORTALLY, adv. प्राणनाशेन, प्राणघातेन, सनाशं, सप्राणघातं, सप्राणनाशं;<BR>mortally wounded,’ भिन्नमर्म्मा -र्म्मा -र्म्म (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mortar
MORTAR, s. (Vessel in which substances are pounded) उलूखलं,<BR>उडूखलः -लं, उदूखलं; ‘pestle and mortar,’ उलूखलमुषले;<BR>‘pounded in a mortar,’ उलूखलिकः -की -कं.<BR>— (Cement) सुधा,<BR>लेपः, विलेपः, चूर्णलेपः, कर्करलेपः, उदपेपः; ‘very hard,’ वज्रलेपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=515-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mortgage
