MOULDED, p. p. कल्पितः -ता -तं, संस्कृतः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Kneaded) मर्दितः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=517-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

moulder
