nickname
To NICKNAME, v. a. उपाधिं दा, उपाधिनाम कृ, तिरस्कारार्थं नाम दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=532-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

nictate
