nictation
NICTATION, s. निमेषः, निमीलनं, पक्षिनिमेषः, पक्षिवद् निमेषः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=532-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

nictitating membrane
