NOTABLENESS, s. स्मरणीयता, प्रसिद्धता, लोकप्रसिद्धता, विशिष्टता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=537-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

