outgoing
OUTGOING, s. (Expenditure) व्ययः, अपव्ययः, अपचयः, उपक्षयः,<BR>विनियोगः, अपहारः; ‘incomings and outgoings,’ आयव्ययौ m. du.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=560-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

outgrow
