outline
OUTLINE, s. (Exterior line) वाह्यरेखा, वहिर्लेखा.<BR>— (Slight sketch<BR>of a figure or subject) पाण्डुलेख्यं, पाण्डुरेखा, पाण्डुलेख्यमात्रं,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=560-b" target="_blank">Page560-b+ 51</a>]<BR>आलेख्यं, लघ्वालेख्यं, वस्तुमात्रं, वस्तु n., आकारः.<BR>— (Of a picture)<BR>चित्रारम्भः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=560-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

outline
To OUTLINE, v. a. वाह्यरेखामात्रं लिख् (c. 6. लिखति, लेखितुं), पाण्डुलेख्यं<BR>कृ, पाण्डुरेखाम् अङ्क् (c. 10. अङ्कयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=560-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

outlive
