PAR, s. (State of equality) समता, साम्यं, समभावः, समानता, तुल्यता,<BR>साम्यता; ‘that is at par,’ समानकक्षः -क्षा -क्षं, समकक्षः &c.;<BR>‘that is above par,’ अधिकोत्तरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=570-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

parable
PARABLE, s. दृष्टान्तः, दृष्टान्तरूपकथा, उत्प्रेक्षा, उपमा, समासोक्तिः f.,<BR>समासोक्तिरूपकथा, निदर्शनं, उदाहरणं, हितोपदेशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=570-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

parabola
