paragraph
PARAGRAPH, s. परिच्छेदः, विच्छेदः, खण्डः, लेखपरिच्छेदः, लेखखण्डः,<BR>वाक्यपरिच्छेदः, वाक्यखण्डः, वाक्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=570-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

paralipomena
