paraphernalia
PARAPHERNALIA, s. pl. (Articles which a wife brings with her)<BR>स्त्रीधनं, यौतकं, औद्वाहिकं, पारिणाय्यं.<BR>— (Appendages, trappings)<BR>परिच्छदः, सामग्र्यं, पारिणाह्यं, उपकरणं, व्यञ्जनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=570-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

