PARAPHRASTICALLY, adv. मूलशब्दविस्तारेण, मूलशब्दाधिक्यपूर्व्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=571-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

paraquet
