patcher
PATCHER, s. वस्त्रखण्डसन्धाता m. (तृ), जीर्णवस्त्रसमाधाता m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=576-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

patch-work
PATCH-WORK, s. खण्डकर्म्म n. (न्), कन्थाकरणं, कर्पटकरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=576-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pate
