patrician
PATRICIAN, s. कुलीनजनः, कुलीनपुरुपः, शिष्टजनः, अभिजनवान् m. (त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=577-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

