payer
PAYER, s. दाता m. (तृ), शोधयिता m., शोधकः, परिशोधकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=578-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pay-master
