phrenitis
PHRENITIS, PHRENSY, s. (In medicine) सन्निपातज्वरः.<BR>— (Madness)<BR>उन्मादः, सम्मादः, उन्मादवायुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=590-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

