PHYSIOGNOMY, s. (Art of discerning the character from the<BR>features) मुखलक्षणनिरूषणविद्या, मुखलक्षणनिरूपणात् स्वभावपरिच्छेदः.<BR>— (Countenance) मुखं, वदनं, आननं, आस्यं, वक्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiologic
PHYSIOLOGIC, PHYSIOLOGICAL, a. प्राणिधर्म्मगुणविद्यासम्बन्धी &c., प्राणि-<BR>धर्म्मगुणविद्याविषयकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiologist
PHYSIOLOGIST, s. प्राणिधर्म्मगुणविद्याज्ञः, प्राणिधर्म्मगुणवेत्ता m. (त्तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiology
PHYSIOLOGY, s. प्राणिधर्म्मगुणविद्या, प्राणिधर्म्मगुणज्ञानं, प्राणिधर्म्मगुणशास्त्रं,<BR>जन्तुगुणधर्म्मविद्या, द्रव्यतत्त्वज्ञानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

