picekt
PICEKT, s. सेनायाः पुरतः स्थापितं रक्षकदलं, सज्जनं, उपरक्षणं, सेनारक्षः.<BR>— (Stake) शङ्कुः m., शल्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

picking
PICKING, s. (Plucking, selecting) ग्रहणं, अङ्गुलिभिर् ग्रहणं, उद्ग्रहणं<BR>उद्धारः, उद्धरणं.<BR>— (Stealing). अपहारः, अपहरणं, क्षुद्रद्रव्यहरणं.<BR>—<BR>(Extra gain) अधिकलाभः, अधिकप्राप्तिः f., अवान्तरलाभः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pickle
PICKLE, s. (Vegetable, &c., pickled) सन्धितं, सन्धानं, लवणशाकः,<BR>सन्धितशाकः, लवणितशाकः.<BR>— (Brine) लवणोदं, लवणं.<BR>— (State<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-b" target="_blank">Page591-b+ 51</a>]<BR>of difficulty) दुर्दशा, दुर्गतिः f., दुरवस्था.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=591-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

