planing
PLANING, s. तक्षणं, त्वक्षणं, श्लक्ष्णीकरणं, समीकरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=598-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plank
PLANK, s. फलकः -कं, काष्ठफलकः -कं, दारुफलकः, दीर्घकाष्ठं, दीर्घदारुः m.,<BR>मूक्ष्मदारुः m., काष्ठं, किलिञ्चः, कटः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=598-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plank
To PLANK, v. a. फलकैः or दीर्घकाष्ठैः or काष्ठफलकैर् आस्तॄ (c. 9.<BR>-स्तृणाति -स्तरितुं -रीतुं), फलक (nom. फलकयति -यितुं), सफलकीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=598-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

