PLEASURE-HOUSE, s. केलिगृहं, क्रीडागृहं, विलासगृहं, विलासमन्दिरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=600-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pleasurist
PLEASURIST, s. भोगासक्तः, विषयासक्तः, विषयसेवी m. (न्), केलिनागरः,<BR>केलिपरः, विषयी m. (न्), वैषयिकः, भोगपरायणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=600-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plebeian
