plucker
PLUCKER, s. उत्पाटयिता m. (तृ), उत्पाटी m. (न्), उद्धर्त्ता m. (र्त्तृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=601-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plucking
PLUCKING, s. उत्पाटः -टनं, उत्कर्षणं, निष्कर्षणं, उद्धरणं.<BR>— (As of hair)<BR>उल्लुञ्चनं, अवलुञ्चनं.<BR>— (Gathering) चयः -यनं, अवचयः, ग्रहणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=601-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plug
PLUG, s. रोधनी, निरोधनी, स्तम्भनी, पिधानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=601-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

plug
