prelectior
PRELECTIOR, s. पाठकः, पाठकारी m. (न्). See LECTURER.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

prelibation
PRELIBATION, s. पूर्व्वभोगः, पूर्व्वभुक्तिः f., पूर्व्वानुभवः, आदिभोगः. See<BR>FORETASTE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

preliminary
