PRIVATIVE, s. (Word) अभावशब्दः, अभावसूचकशब्दः.<BR>— (Prefix, in<BR>grammar) नपदं, नप्र्पदं. Privative prefixes are such as अ,<BR>अन्, निर्, वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

