propitiously
PROPITIOUSLY, adv. प्रसन्नं, प्रसादेन, सप्रसादं, अनुकूलं, सानुकूल्यं, सानुग्रहं,<BR>कल्पाणं, समाङ्गल्यं, क्षेमेण. See AUSPICIOUSLY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=635-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

propitiousness
