QUARTER-DECK, s. नौपृष्ठस्य पश्चिमभागः or उन्नतभागः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

quartered
QUARTERED, p. p. चतुर्भागीकृतः -ता -तं, चतुर्धा विभिन्नः -न्ना -न्नं, चतुर्धा<BR>खण्डितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Lodged) वासितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

