QUARTERLY, a. त्रैमासिकः -की -कं, त्रिमासीनः -ना -नं, पादिकः -की -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

