QUARTERLY, adv. त्रिमासान्ते, मासत्रयान्ते, मासत्रयावसाने.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

quarto
QUARTO, s. चतुःपत्रकपुस्तकं, चतुःफलकपुस्तकं, चतुःपत्रकः -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

