QUATRAIN, s. चतुष्पादकविता, चतुष्पदकविता, चतुष्पदश्लोकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

quaver
To QUAVER, v. n. (Sing with tremor of the voice) स्वरभङ्गेन or<BR>स्वरकम्पेन or कम्पनस्वरेण गै (c. 1. गायति, गातुं), शारीरं कृ.<BR>— (Vi-<BR>brate) कम्प्, स्फुर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

quaver
