queen
QUEEN, s. (Wife of a king) राजपत्नी, राजमहिषी, महिषी, राज्ञी,<BR>देवी, नृपपत्नी, नृपवल्लभा, भट्टिनी; ‘principal queen, one who<BR>has been inaugurated and crowned,’ पट्टमहिषी, पट्टदेवी, पट्टा-<BR>भिषिक्तराज्ञी; ‘queen mother,’ राजजननी.<BR>— (Woman who is<BR>the sovereign of a kingdom) राज्ञी, राज्यकारिणी महिषी.<BR>— (At<BR>chess) प्रधानः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

queenly
