rattle
RATTLE, s. (Rattling noise^1) क्वणितं, क्वणनं, स्तनितं, स्तननं, ध्वनिः m.,<BR>ध्वनितं, शिञ्जितं, झज्झनं, झज्झा, झनत्कारः, झणझणशब्दः.<BR>— (Clat-<BR>tering talk) जल्पनं, जल्पितं, चटचटशब्दः.<BR>— (Instrument for<BR>making a rattling sound) शिञ्जिनी, क्वणनी, झज्झनी.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=657-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rattling
