refrigerant
REFRIGERANT, a. तापहरः -रा -रं, सन्तापहरः &c., दाहहरः &c., दाह-<BR>नाशकः -का -कं, शीतलकारी रिणी -रि (न्), निर्वापकः -का -क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=668-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

refrigerant
