re-imbursement
RE-IMBURSEMENT, s. पुनर्दानं, प्रतिदानं, क्षतिपूरणं, हानिपूरणं, परिशोधनं<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=671-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rein
REIN, s. (Of a horse) रश्मिः m., अभीशुः m., अभीषुः m., प्रग्रहः,<BR>प्रग्राहः, वसुः m., वागा, वल्गा, दन्तालिका.<BR>— (Reins), see the word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=671-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rein
