ridiculousness
RIDICULOUSNESS, s. उपहास्यता, अपहास्यता, परिहास्यता, हास्यत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

riding
RIDING, s. अश्वारोहणं, हयारोहः, अश्वारोहणविद्या, अश्वविद्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

riding
