rife
RIFE, a. प्रसिद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, प्रचलः -ला -लं. See PREVALENT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

