riff-raff
RIFF-RAFF, s. खलाः m. pl., पृथग्जनाः, अधमवर्णाः &c. See RABBLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rifle
