rifle
RIFLE, s. (Kind of gun) सीतारूपेण सुषिरीकृता गुलिकाप्रक्षेपणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

