RIGHTEOUSLY, adv. धर्म्मतस्, न्यायतस्, धर्म्मानुसारेण. See JUSTLY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

righteousness
RIGHTEOUSNESS, s. धर्म्मः, धर्म्मता, धार्म्मिकता -त्वं, न्यायः, न्याय्यता,<BR>न्यायिता, साधुता -त्वं, पुण्यता, शुचिता. See JUSTICE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rightful
RIGHTFUL, a. (Having a just title) अधिकारी -रिणी -रि (न्), अधि-<BR>कारवान् -वती -वत् (त्), साधिकारः -रा -रं, स्वत्वाधिकारी &c.<BR>—<BR>(Agreeable to justice), see JUST.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rightfully
RIGHTFULLY, adv. अधिकारेण, अधिकारतस्, साधिकारं. See JUSTLY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=692-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

