ring-leader
RING-LEADER, s. मुख्यः, मुखरः, प्रमुखः, प्रवर्त्तकः, प्रयोजकः, नायकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=693-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

