ripen
To RIPEN, v. a. पच् (c. 1. पचति, पक्तुं, c. 10. पाचयति -यितुं), पक्वं -क्वां<BR>कृ, परिपक्वं -क्वां कृ, पक्वीकृ, पाकं कृ or जन्. See To MATURE, v. a.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=693-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

