rubicund
RUBICUND, a. ईषद्रक्तः -क्ता -क्तं, आरक्तः &c., पाटलवर्णः -र्णा -र्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=700-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

rubric
