saccharine
SACCHARINE, a. (Pertaining to sugar) शर्करासम्बन्धी -न्धिनी &c.,<BR>शार्करः -री -रं, शार्करिकः -की -कं, ऐक्षवः -वी -वं.<BR>— (Having the<BR>qualities^1 of sugar, sweet) शर्करागुणकः -का -कं, शर्कराधर्म्मकः<BR>&c., मिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, मधुरः -रा -रं, सुमधुरः &c.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=703-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

