sake
SAKE s. कारण, हेतुः m., निमित्तं, प्रयोजनं; ‘for the sake of,’ अर्थं<BR>or अर्थे in comp., हेतोः, हेतौ, कारणात्, कृते, निमित्ते with the<BR>gen. c. or crude form; ‘for one's own sake,’ आत्मार्थं;<BR>‘for my sake,’ मदर्थं -र्थे; ‘for his sake,’ तदर्थं, तस्य हेतोः;<BR>‘for the sake of happiness,’ सुखार्थं, सुखहेतोः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=706-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sal
