scornfulness
SCORNFULNESS, s. अवज्ञाशीलता, सावहेलत्वं, अवलिप्तता, सोन्माथत्वंः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

scorpio
SCORPIO, s. (The sign) वृश्चिकः, कौर्प्पः, अलिः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

