scourging
SCOURGING, s. कशाघातः, कशाताडनं, रज्वाघातः, कशाप्रह्नारः; ‘worthy<BR>of scourging,’ कशार्हः -र्हा -र्हं, कश्यः -श्या -श्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

