scout
SCOUT, s. चारः, चरः, गुप्तचरः, गुप्तदूतः, गूढचारः -री m. (न्), गुप्तगतिः m.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=716-a" target="_blank">Page716-a+ 51</a>]<BR>गूढदूतः, गूढनिरूपकः, शत्रुचेष्टानिरूपकः, प्रणिधिः m. See SPY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=715-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

scout
