SEAL, s. (Stamp) मुद्रा.<BR>— (Signet) मुद्रा, प्रत्ययकारिणी, दीनारः.<BR>—<BR>(Finger-ring seal) अङ्गुलिमुद्रा.<BR>— (Seal or tie with a seal for<BR>fastening a letter) तालिकः.<BR>— (Impression of a seal) मुद्रा.<BR>— (Sea-calf) समुद्रवत्सः, मकरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=719-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

seal
