seed-time
SEED-TIME, s. वीजकालः, वीजारोपणकालः, उप्तिकालः, वापकालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=723-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

seed-vessel
