shackled
SHACKLED, p. p. निगडितः -ता -तं, शृङ्खलितः &c., संरुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=733-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

shad
SHAD, s. (Sort of fish) पाठीनः, मद्गुरः, शृङ्गी f., सहस्रदंष्ट्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=733-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

shaddock
SHADDOCK, s. (Citrus decumana, a fruit) गिरिजा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=733-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

shade
SHADE, s. (Obscurity caused by interruption of light) छाया,<BR>अनातपः, आतपाभावः, अतेजस् n., सूर्य्यप्रकाशाभावः, अप्रकाशः,<BR>श्यामा.<BR>— (Obscurity) अन्धकारः, तिमिरं, तमस् n., अप्रकाशत्वं.<BR>—<BR>(Screen) व्यवधा, व्यवधानं, वितानं, तिरस्करिणी, see SCREEN; ‘for<BR>a lamp,’ अश्मन्तकं.<BR>— (Degree, gradation) अंशः, भागः, क्रमः.<BR>—<BR>(Minute difference) अत्यल्पान्तरं, स्वल्पान्तरं, अत्यल्पमात्रं, अत्यल्पं.<BR>— (Ghost) अपच्छाया, प्रेतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=733-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

shade
