shaded
SHADED, p. p. छादितः -ता -तं, प्रच्छादितः &c., वितानीकृतः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=733-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

