sheepishness
SHEEPISHNESS, s. अतिलज्जा, मेषशीलता, जनभीतिः f., सभाभीतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=736-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

