sheep-stealing
SHEEP-STEALING, s. मेषहरणं, मेषापहारः, मेषापहरणं, मेषचौरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=736-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sheer
