sheer off
To SHEER OFF, v. n. अपसृ, अपसृप्, व्यपसृप्, पलाय्, see To DECAMP.<BR>— (Move off on one side) पार्श्वे or पार्श्वतो गम् or चल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=736-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sheet
SHEET, s. (Of a bed, &c.) प्रच्छदपटः, प्रच्छदवस्त्रं, उत्तरप्रच्छदः, उत्तरछदः,<BR>शय्याच्छादनं, निचोलः.<BR>— (Of paper) पत्रं -त्रकं, पत्रिका, फलकः.<BR>—<BR>(Of metal) पत्रं, फलकः.<BR>— (Of water) वारिराशिः m., वारिचत्वरः.<BR>— (Winding sheet) शववस्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=736-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sheet-anchor
