shipping
SHIPPING, s. नौकासमूहः, नौकादिसमूहः नौकास्रमवायः, नाविकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ship-wreck
