ship-wreck
To SHIP-WRECK, v. a. नौकां भञ्ज् (c. 7. भनक्ति, भंक्तुं) or भिद् (c. 7.<BR>भिनत्ति, भेत्तुं) or नश् (c. 10. नाशयति -यितुं) or विनश्, नौभङ्गं कृ,<BR>नौभेदं कृ, नौव्यसनं कृ or जन्, उत्कूल् (c. 10. -कूलयति -यितुं),<BR>कूलोपरि क्षिप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ship-wrecked
SHIP-WRECKED, p. p. भिन्ननौकः -का -कं, भग्ननौकः &c., उत्कूलतः -ता<BR>-तं, कूलोपरि क्षिप्तः -प्ता -प्तं, सैकतोपरि क्षिप्तः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

shirk
