smack
SMACK, adv. आस्फोटनशब्देन, आकस्मिकशब्देन, आकस्मिकाघातेन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

small
SMALL, a. अल्पः -ल्पा -ल्पं, क्षुद्रः -द्रा -द्रं, see LITTLE, a.<BR>— (In sta-<BR>ture) अल्पतनुः -नुः -नु, अल्पशरीरः -रा -रं, see LITTLE, a.<BR>— (Small<BR>quantity) अल्पभागः, see LITTLE, s.<BR>— (In a small degree)<BR>ईषत्, see LITTLE, adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

