smoke
SMOKE, s. धूमः, धूमिका, धूपः -पिका, दहनकेतनं, मरुद्वाहः, करमालः,<BR>खतमालः, व्यामः; ‘quantity of smoke,’ धूम्या; ‘volume of it,’<BR>धूमावलिः -ली, धूममाला; ‘cloud of it,’ धूममेघः, धूमौघः, धूमपटलः<BR>-लं; ‘absence of it,’ विधूमः, धूमाभावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=753-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

smoke
To SMOKE, v. n. (Emit smoke) धूम (nom. धूमायति -ते), धूमम् उत्सृज्<BR>(c. 6. -सृजति -स्रष्टुं) or उत्क्षिप् (c. 6. -क्षिपति -क्षेप्तुं) or निःसृ in<BR>caus. or निर्गम् in caus., धूम्र (nom. धूम्रायति -ते), धूप (nom.<BR>धूपायति -ते).<BR>— (Inhale tobacco through a pipe) नालद्वारेण<BR>ताम्रकुट्टधूमिकां निपा, धूमनिपानं कृ.<BR>— (Cause to emit smoke)<BR>धूम in caus. (धूमाययति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=753-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

smoke
