softening
SOFTENING, part. or a. शान्तिदः -दा -दं, शान्तिकः -की -कं, शान्तिकरः -री -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=757-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

softly
