SOOTHSAYER, s. दैवज्ञः, सांवत्सरिकः, सावितृकः. See DIVINER.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=759-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

soothsaying
SOOTHSAYING, s. शकुनपरीक्षणं, गणना, दैवज्ञानं. See DIVINATION.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=759-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sooty
