spoil
SPOIL, s. (That which is taken in war, plunder) लोप्त्रं, लोत्रं,<BR>लोतः -तं, युद्धोपार्जितद्रव्यं, युद्धजितद्रव्यं, युद्धजितधनं, युद्धसम्पादितधनं,<BR>युद्धसम्पादितद्रव्यं, see PLUNDER.<BR>— (In cattle) गोग्रहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=766-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

