sterling
STERLING, a. अकृत्रिमः -मा -मं, सारः -रा -रं.<BR>— (Money) सारधनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

