STERNUM, s. (Breast-bone) उरोस्थि n., वक्षोस्थि n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

