STEWED, p. p. क्वथितः -ता -तं; ‘stewed meat,’ क्वथितमांसं, रसकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

