STIFFENED, p. p. स्तब्धीकृतः -ता -तं, स्तब्धीभूतः &c., घनीभूतः &c<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

stiffly
STIFFLY, adv. स्तब्धं, स्तब्धत्वेन, कठिनं, दृढं, अशिथिलं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

stiff-necked
STIFF-NECKED, STIFFHEARTED, a. स्तब्धमतिः -तिः -ति. See STUBBORN.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

stiffness
STIFFNESS, s. स्तब्धत्वं -ता, कठिनत्वं, काठिन्यं, दृढत्वं -ता, दार्ढ्यं, घनता<BR>-त्वं, अशिथिलता, अशैथिल्यं. See RIGIDITY, FORMALITY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

