still
To STILL, v. a. (Quiet, calm) शम् (c. 10. शमयति -यितुं), प्रशम्,<BR>उपशम्.<BR>— (Make silent) निःशब्दीकृ, see To SILENCE.<BR>— (Stop)<BR>निवृत् (c. 10. -वर्त्तयति -यितुं), निवृ (c. 10. -वारयति -यितुं), स्थिरीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

