still
STILL, adv. (Until now, even now) अद्यापि, अद्ययावत्, अद्यावधि.<BR>—<BR>(Nevertheless) तथापि.<BR>— (Quietly, silently) शान्तं, तूष्णीं, निःशब्दं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

still-born
STILL-BORN, a. मृतजातः -ता -तं; ‘a still-born child,’ मूढगर्भः, मृत-<BR>गर्भः; ‘bearing a still-born child,’ नश्यत्प्रसूतिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=774-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

stillness
