stuck
STUCK, p. p. लग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं, परिलग्नः &c., संलग्नः &c., आसक्तः -क्ता -क्तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=780-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

stud
STUD, s. (Ornamental knob) गण्डः -ण्डका, गण्डालङ्कारः.<BR>— (Of horses)<BR>बाडवं, आश्वं, अश्वीयं, अश्वसमूहः, अश्ववृन्दं, अश्वगणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=780-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

studded
