submerged
SUBMERGED, p. p. मज्जितः -ता -तं, निमज्जितः &c., निमग्नः -ग्ना -ग्नं,<BR>आप्लावितः -ता -तं, see PLUNGED, IMMERSED; ‘is submerged,’ प्लाव्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=782-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

submersion
