substantiation
SUBSTANTIATION, s. उपपादनं, साधनं, सिद्धिः f., विभावनं, भावनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=783-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

substantive
SUBSTANTIVE, s. (In grammar) विशेष्यं, सत्त्ववाचकः, द्रव्यवाचकः,<BR>सत्त्वं; ‘proper substantive,’ नामवाचकः, संज्ञावाचकः, संज्ञा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=783-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

substantive
SUBSTANTIVE, a. सात्त्विकः -की -कं, सत्त्ववाचकः -का -कं, वास्तविकः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=783-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

substitute
