system
SYSTEM, s. (Plan) कल्पना, अनुसन्धानं, see SCHEME.<BR>— (Method)<BR>क्रमः, पर्य्यायः, see METHOD.<BR>— (Of the body, constitution)<BR>शरीरप्रकृतिः f., देहप्रकृतिः f., भावः, शरीरं.<BR>— (Assem-<BR>blage of parts adjusted into a regular whole) रीतिः f., स्थि-<BR>तिः f. संस्थानं, संस्थितिः f., मार्गः, क्रमः.<BR>— (Systems of philosophy).<BR>These are six, see under SCHOOL. The three leading<BR>systems are the Nyāya, Vedānta, and Sānkhya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=793-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

