tasting
TASTING, s. आस्वादः -दनं, स्वादनं, प्राशनं, रसनं, लेहनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tastiness
TASTINESS, TASTEFULNESS, s. रसिकता, सरसत्वं, सौरस्यं, रोचकता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tasty
TASTY, TASTEFUL, a. रसिकः -का -कं, सरसः -सा -सं, सुरसः &c.,<BR>रसवान् -वती -वत् (त्), रसी -सिनी -सि (न्), रोचकः -का -कं,<BR>रुचिरः -रा -रं, रुच्यः -च्या -च्यं, रुचिकरः -रा -रं, रसितः -ता -तं.<BR>See SAVORY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

