To TATTLE, TATTLE, TATTLER. See To PRATE, BLAB, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

taught
