tax
TAX, s. करः, शुल्कः -ल्कं, राजकरः -रं, कारः, राजस्वं, see IMPOST;<BR>‘exempt from it,’ अकरः -रा -रं.<BR>— (Burthen) भारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tax
