taxable
TAXABLE, a. कराधीनः -ना -नं, शुल्काधीनः -ना -नं, करयोग्यः -ग्या -ग्यं,<BR>करदः -दा -दं; ‘taxable article,’ शुल्कस्थानं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

