taxed
TAXED, p. p. सकरः -रा -रं, सशुल्कः -ल्का -ल्कं, करदः -दा -दं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

