TEASED, p. p. बाधितः -ता -तं, पीडितः &c., व्यग्रः -ग्रा -ग्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

teat
TEAT, s. स्तनाग्रं, स्तनः, see NIPPLE; ‘having two teats,’ द्विस्तनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

