TECHNICALLY, adv. परिभाषानुसारेण, विशेषकलानुसारेण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

technicality
TECHNICALITY, s. लाक्षणिकत्वं, पारिभाषिकत्वं, साङ्केतिकत्वं.<BR>— (A tech-<BR>nical term) परिभाषा, लाक्षणिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

