TEDIOUS, a. दीर्घसूत्रः -त्रा -त्रं, अतिदीर्घः -र्घा -र्घं, खेदजनकः -का -कं,<BR>श्रमजनकः &c. See LONG, PROLIX, IRKSOME.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

