TEDIOUSLY, adv. अतिदीर्घं, दीर्घसूत्रवत्, सुदीर्घं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

