teem
To TEEM, v. n. पूर्णगर्भः -र्भा -र्भं भू, अतिपूर्णः -र्णा -र्णं भू.<BR>— (Bring<BR>forth abundantly) बाहुल्येन उत्पद् (c. 10. -पादयति -यितुं) or जन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

teeming
TEEMING, part. पूर्णगर्भः -र्भा -र्भं, परिपूर्णः -र्णा -र्णं, सम्पूर्णः &c., पूर्णः<BR>&c., आकुल in comp., आढ्य in comp. See PROLIFIC.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

teeth
