TEMPORARINESS, s. अनित्यता, अचिरस्थायिता, क्षणिकता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

