To TEMPORIZE, v. n. समयानुरोधं कृ, समयानुवर्त्तनं कृ, कालानुरोधं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

temporizer
TEMPORIZER, s. समयानुरोधी m. (न्), कालानुरोधी m., कालानुवर्त्ती m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tempt
To TEMPT, v. a. (Entice to evil) प्रलुभ् (c. 10. -लोभयति -यितुं), परि-<BR>लुभ्, लुभ्, आकृष् (c. 1. -कर्षति -कर्ष्टुं), मुह् (c. 10. मोहयति -यितुं),<BR>प्रलोभनं कृ, विमोहनं कृ.<BR>— (Try, prove) परीक्ष् (c. 1. -ईक्षते -क्षितुं),<BR>परीक्षां कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

temptation
TEMPTATION, s. (Enticement to evil) प्रलोभनं, विलोभनं, आकर्षण,<BR>आकृष्टिः f., मोहः -हनं, विमोहनं.<BR>— (Trial) परीक्षा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tempted
TEMPTED, p. p. प्रलोभितः -ता -तं, आकृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, मोहितः &c., ‘by<BR>avarice,’ लोभाकृष्टः &c.<BR>— (Tried) परीक्षितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tempter
TEMPTER, s. प्रलोभकः, विलोभकः, मोहकः, परीक्षकः, परीक्षाकृत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=797-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tempting
TEMPTING, a. आकर्षकः -का -कं, विमोहनः -ना -नं. See ENTICING.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ten
TEN, a. देश m. f. n. pl. (न्), दशकः -का -कं, दशसंख्यकः -का -कं;<BR>‘aggregate of ten,’ दशकं; ‘ten days,’ दशाहं; ‘in ten<BR>ways,’ दशधा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenable
TENABLE, a. रक्षणीयः -या -यं, प्रतिपादनीयः &c., स्थापनीयः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenacious
TENACIOUS, a. (Holding fast) संलग्नशीलः -ला -लं, see RETENTIVE.<BR>— (Persistent in a course) अभिनिविष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, आग्रही -हिणी<BR>&c., दृढः -ढा -ढं, दृढसङ्कल्पः -ल्पा -ल्पं.<BR>— (Of opinions) स्वमता-<BR>ग्रही &c.<BR>— (Of life) दुर्मरः -रा -रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenacity
TENACITY, s. अभिनिवेशः, आग्रहः, ग्रहः, दृढता, धृतिः f., धारणा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenant
TENANT, s. अधिवासी m. (न्), परस्वामिकक्षेत्राधिवासी m., परस्वामिकगृ-<BR>हाधिवासी m., परस्वत्वयुक्तभूम्यधिवासी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenant
To TENANT, v. a. परस्वामिकभूमिम् अधिवस् (c. 1. -वसति -वस्तुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenanted
TENANTED, p. p. अध्युषितः -ता -तं, अधिष्ठितः &c. See OCCUPIED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tenantry
TENANTRY, s. परस्वामिकक्षेत्राधिवासिनां गणः, अधिवासिगणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tend
