TENDRIL, s. (Of a vine or creeper) लतातन्तुः m., तन्तुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

