tepid
TEPID, a. ईषदुष्णः -ष्णा -ष्णं, कोष्णः &c., कवोष्णः &c., मन्दोष्णः &c.,<BR>कुतपः -पा -पं, अनुष्णाशीतः -ता -तं. See LUKEWARM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=798-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

