TESTIMONIAL, s. प्रमाणपत्रं, प्रमाणलेखः, प्रामाणिकलेखः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=799-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

testimony
TESTIMONY, s. साक्ष्यं, साक्षिता, प्रमाणं, प्रामाण्यं. See EVIDENCE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=799-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

testiness
TESTINESS, s. कर्कशता, कार्कश्यं, वक्रता, कटुता. See PEEVISHNESS.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=799-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

testy
