tetragon
TETRAGON, s. चतुरस्रं, चतुष्कोणः, चतुर्भुजः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=799-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

