thaw
THAW, s. हिमद्रवः, हिमद्रावः, हिमगलनं, हिमक्षरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

the
THE. This definite article may be either expressed by the<BR>pronoun सः सा तत्, or is more usually omitted altogether;<BR>as, ‘the man,’ स पुरुषः or पुरुषः; ‘the woman,’ सा स्त्री or<BR>स्त्री; ‘the lion,’ स सिंहः or सिंहः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theatre
THEATRE, s. रङ्गः, रङ्गशाला, नाटकशाला, नाट्यशाला, नाटकगृहं, नाट-<BR>कमन्दिरं, नृत्यशाला, रङ्गभूमिः f., समाजसन्निवेशः, आनर्त्तः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theatrical
THEATRICAL, a. नाटकीयः -या -यं, नाट्यसम्बन्धी -न्धिनी &c., नाट्य-<BR>विषयकः -का -कं, नाटकसम्बन्धी &c., नाट्यशालासम्बन्धी &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thee
THEE, pron. त्वां acc. c.; ‘by thee,’ त्वया; ‘to thee,’ तुभ्यं, ते;<BR>‘of thee,’ तव, ते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theft
THEFT, s. स्तेयं, चौर्य्यं, चौरं, चौरिका, स्तैन्यं, स्तैनं, चुरा, तास्कर्य्यं, तस्क-<BR>रता, मुष्टं, मुष्टिः f., अपहारः, परद्रव्यापहारः, चौर्य्यकर्म्म n. (न्). See<BR>STEALING.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

their
THEIR, pron. तेषां gen. pl. m., तासां f., एतेषां gen. pl. m., एतासां f.,<BR>एषां gen. pl. m., आसां gen. pl. f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theism
THEISM, s. आस्तिक्यं, आस्तिक्यमतं, आस्तिक्यवादः, ईश्वरवादः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theist
THEIST, s. आस्तिकः, आस्तिक्यवादी m. (न्), ईश्वरवादी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

them
THEM, pron. तान् or एतान् acc. pl.; ‘by them,’ तैः; ‘of them,’ तेषां.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theme
THEME, s. (Topic) प्रकरणं, विषयः, see SUBJECT.<BR>— (Short disser-<BR>tation) अल्पप्रबन्धः, अल्पलेखः, अल्पप्रसङ्गः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

themselves
THEMSELVES, pron. Expressed by आत्मा m. (न्). See MYSELF.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

then
THEN, adv. (At that time) तदा, तदानीं, तर्हि, एतर्हि, तस्मिन् काले,<BR>तत्काले.<BR>— (After that) ततः, अथ, तदनन्तरं, तदुपरि; ‘now and<BR>then,’ कदाचित्, कदापि, see under Now.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thence
THENCE, adv. (From that place) ततस्, तस्मात् स्थानात्, तस्माद्<BR>देशात्.<BR>— (For that reason) तस्मात्, see THEREFORE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thenceforth
THENCEFORTH, THENCEFORWARD, adv. ततःप्रभृति, तदाप्रभृति, तत्काला-<BR>दारभ्य, तत आरभ्य, तदारभ्य, तदवधि, तत्कालावधि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theocracy
THEOCRACY, s. ईश्वरकर्त्तृकराज्यं, ईश्वरकर्त्तृकशासनं, ईश्वरप्रभुत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theogony
THEOGONY, s. देवोत्पत्तिः f., देवजन्म n. (न्), देववंशः -वंशावली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theologian
THEOLOGIAN, s. परमार्थविद् m., परमार्थज्ञानी m. (न्), ब्रह्मज्ञानी m.,<BR>ब्रह्मविद्याज्ञः, अध्यात्मज्ञानी m., अध्यात्मदृक् m. (श्), श्रोत्रियः, श्रुताध्य-<BR>यनसम्पन्नः, धर्म्मशास्त्रज्ञः, वेदान्ती m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theological
THEOLOGICAL, a. परमार्थविद्याविषयकः -का -कं, परमार्थविद्यासम्बन्धी -न्धिनी<BR>&c., अध्यात्मज्ञानविषयकः &c., औपनिषदः -दी -दं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theology
THEOLOGY, s. परमार्थविद्या, परमार्थज्ञानं, श्रुतिविद्या, धर्म्मविद्या, देवज्ञानं,<BR>ब्रह्मज्ञानं, ब्रह्मविद्या, तत्त्वज्ञानं, तत्त्वविद्या, अध्यात्मज्ञानं, अध्यात्मविद्या,<BR>श्रोत्रियता, परार्थप्रकरणं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theorem
THEOREM, s. (Proposition to be proved) प्रमेयं, प्रमेयोपपाद्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theoretic
THEORETIC, THEORETICAL, a. मानसिकः -की -कं, काल्पनिकः &c.,<BR>अव्यवहारिकः -की -कं, व्यवहारागम्यः -म्या -म्यं, मनोमयः &c. See<BR>SPECULATIVE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theoretically
THEORETICALLY, adv. मनःकल्पनानुसारेण, मनःकल्पनया, कल्पनापूर्व्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

theory
THEORY, s. (Speculation, scheme) कल्पना, मनःकल्पना, मानसक-<BR>ल्पना, मानससृष्टिः f., तर्कः, कल्पितं, मनःकल्पितं, अर्थापत्तिः f.; ‘anxious<BR>to establish one's own theory,’ स्वकल्पनासाधनेच्छुः -च्छुः -च्छु.<BR>— (Exposition of principles) वीजनिर्देशः, उपपत्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

therapeutic
THERAPEUTIC, रोगशमकः -का -कं, रोगप्रतिकारकः &c., see CURATIVE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

there
THERE, adv. तत्र, तत्स्थाने, तस्मिन् स्थाने, तस्मिन् देशे; ‘here and<BR>there,’ इतस्ततस्; ‘produced there, or relating to that place,’<BR>तत्रत्यः -त्या -त्यं, तत्रस्थः -स्था -स्थं; ‘the people residing there,’<BR>तत्रस्थजनाः m. f., तत्रत्यजनाः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thereabouts
THEREABOUTS, adv. (Near that place) तत्रोपान्ते, तत्स्थानसमीपे -निकटे,<BR>तत्रसमीपे, आदिपश्चात्.<BR>— (Nearly), see NEARLY, adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thereat
THEREAT, adv. तेन, तस्मात्, तदुपरि, ततस्, अतस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thereby
THEREBY, adv. तेन, तेनोपायेन, तद्द्वारा, तद्द्वारेण, अनेनोपायेन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

therefore
THEREFORE, adv. तेन, तस्मात्, अनेन हेतुना, तेन हेतुना, तस्य हेतोः,<BR>तेन कारणेन, तत्कारणात्, अतस्, ततस्, अतःकारणात्, अतोहेतोः,<BR>तन्निदानात्, तत्, इति, इति हेतोः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

therein
THEREIN, adv. तत्र, तस्मिन्, एतस्मिन्, अस्मिन्, अस्मिन् विषये.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thereof
THEREOF, adv. तस्य, एतस्य, तदीयः -या -यं; ‘belonging to that<BR>place,’ तत्रत्यः -त्या -त्यं, तत्स्थानिकः -की -कं, तत्स्थानीयः -या -यं,<BR>तत्रस्थः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thereupon
THEREUPON, adv. ततस्, अतस्, तत्रोपरि, तदनन्तरं, अत्रान्तरे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thermometer
THERMOMETER, s. उष्णानुष्णमापनयन्त्रं, शीतोष्णमापनयन्त्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

these
THESE, pron. एते m. एताः f. एतानि n. pl. (एतत्), इमे m., इमाः f.,<BR>इमानि n. pl. (इदं), अमी m. pl. (अदस्); ‘these two,’ एतौ m. du.,<BR>एते f. du.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thesis
THESIS, s. (Proposition) पक्षः, पूर्व्वपक्षः, प्रतिज्ञा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

they
THEY, pron. ते m., ताः f., तानि n. pl. (तद्), एते &c., इमे &c. (इदं),<BR>अमी m. pl. (अदस्); ‘they two,’ तौ m. du., ते f. du.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thick
THICK, a. घनः -ना -नं, स्थूलः -ला -लं, सान्द्रः -न्द्रा -न्द्रं, निविडः -डा<BR>-डं, अविरलः -ला -लं, नीरन्ध्रः -न्ध्रा -न्ध्रं, श्यानः &c., स्त्यानः &c.,<BR>see DENSE.<BR>— (As water, &c., turbid) कलुषः -षा -षं, अनच्छः<BR>-च्छा -च्छं, आविलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thick
THICK, adv. (In quick succession) निरन्तरं, अविरतं, see FRE-<BR>QUENTLY.<BR>— (Closely) निरन्तरं, अविरलं, निविडं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thicken
To THICKEN, v. a. वमीकृ, सान्द्रीकृ, स्थूलीकृ, श्यानीकृ, निविडीकृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thicken
To THICKEN, v. n. घनीभू, सान्द्रीभू, स्थूलीभू, श्यानीभू, निविडीभू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

thickened
THICKENED, p. p. घनीभूतः -ता -तं, घनीकृतः -ता -तं, स्थूलीभूतः &c.,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=800-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

