THOROUGHLY, adv. साद्यन्तं, पर्य्याप्तं, साकल्येन. See COMPLETELY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=801-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

