THOSE, pron. ते m., ताः f., तानि n. pl. (तद्), अमी m. pl. See THESE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=801-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

