tile
To TILE, v. a. पक्वेष्टकाभिर् आछद्, पक्वेष्टकाच्छादनं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

till
TILL, s. (Money-box) मुद्राभाण्डं, मुद्रापात्रं, मुद्राधारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

till
TILL, prep. or adv. यावत्, पर्य्यन्तं, अवधि, आ. The last is pre-<BR>fixed, and governs the abl. c.; ‘till now,’ अद्य यावत्, इदानी,<BR>यावत्, अद्यपर्य्यन्तं, एतत्कालपर्य्यन्तं, अद्यावधि, आवर्त्तमानकालात्; ‘till<BR>then,’ तदानीं यावत्, तत्कालं यावत्, तत्कालपर्य्यन्तं; ‘till satisfied,’<BR>आतृप्तेः; ‘till death,’ आमृत्योः, आमरणात्; ‘till the whole was<BR>mixed together,’ आसर्व्वमिश्रणात्, सर्व्वमिश्रणपर्य्यन्तं; ‘abide ye<BR>there till you have to go to another place,’ स्थानान्तरगम-<BR>नपर्य्यन्तं तत्र तिष्ठत; ‘he kept him in prison till he should<BR>pay the debt,’ यावद् ऋणं न परिशोधयति तावत् तं कारायां बद्धवान्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

till
To TILL, v. a. कृष् (c. 1. कर्षति, क्रष्टुं), कर्षणं कृ, कृषिं कृ, see To<BR>PLOUGH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tillage
TILLAGE, TILLING. s. कृषिः f., कृषिकर्म्म n. (न्), प्रमृतं. See PLOUGHING.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tilled
TILLED, p. p. कृष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, कर्षितः -ता -तं. See PLOUGHED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tiller
TILLER, s. कृषकः, कर्षकः, क्षेत्रकर्षकः, कृषीबलः, कृषिजीवी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tilt
TILT, s. (Kind of awning) वितानं -नकं, आच्छादनं, उल्लोचः.<BR>— (Tour-<BR>nament) अश्वारोहिणां क्रीडायुद्धं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tilt
To TILT, v. a. (Incline) आवृज् (c. 10. -वर्जयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tilt
To TILT, v. n. (Lean) नम्, अवनम्.<BR>— (Fight) क्रीडायुद्धं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tilted
TILTED, p. p. (Inclined) आवर्जितः -ता -तं.<BR>— (Covered) सवितानः -ना -नं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

timber
TIMBER, s. दारुः m. -रु n., काष्ठं, दलिकः, विसारं; ‘of a door,’ नासा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

timbrel
TIMBREL, s. मृदङ्गः, पटहः, पणवः. See TABOR, DRUM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

time
TIME, s. (In general) कालः, समयः, वेला, दिष्टः, अनेहाः m. (स्),<BR>हरिमा m. (न्), सर्व्वमूषकः, भसन्तः, अमसः, जहकः; ‘lapse of time,’<BR>कालगतिः f., कालचक्रं, कालावृत्तिः f., कालपर्य्यायः; ‘in the course<BR>of time,’ कालगत्या, काले गच्छति, दिनेषु गच्छत्सु, कालपर्य्यायेण;<BR>‘through the influence of time,’ कालवशात्; ‘measurement<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">Page804-b+ 51</a>]<BR>of time,’ कालमानं, कालमापनं, कालसाधनं; ‘spirit of the time,’<BR>कालधर्म्मः; ‘to waste one's time,’ कालं क्षिप्, कालक्षेपं कृ, see<BR>To SPEND; ‘to make good use of one's time,’ सत्कालक्षेपं<BR>कृ; ‘without loss of time,’ अकालक्षेपं -पेण; ‘one whose<BR>time is come,’ प्राप्तकालः.<BR>— (Space of time) कालः, समयः,<BR>अवधिः m., कालमर्य्यादा, see SPACE; ‘for a long time,’ चिरं,<BR>चिरकालं, चिरात्, see LONG; ‘for a short time,’ किञ्चित्कालं,<BR>कियत्कालं, see SHORT; ‘for the time being,’ आपाततस्; ‘at<BR>this time,’ इदानीं, अधुना, एतर्हि, see Now; ‘at that time,’<BR>तदानीं, तत्काले, see THEN; ‘at a certain time,’ एकदा; ‘at<BR>any time,’ यदा कदाचित्, कदापि; ‘at times,’ see SOMETIMES;<BR>‘at all times,’ सर्व्वदा, सदा; ‘at the same time,’ युगपत्, एकपदे;<BR>‘for such a time,’ तावत्कालं; ‘former time,’ पूर्व्वकालः; ‘in<BR>former time,’ see FORMERLY; ‘past time,’ गतकालः; ‘spe-<BR>cific time,’ निमित्तकालः; ‘during all time,’ सर्व्वकालं; ‘the<BR>three times, or present, past, and future,’ त्रिकालं.<BR>— (Sea-<BR>son) कालः, समयः, प्रसङ्गः; ‘in time, out of time,’ see SEA-<BR>SONABLY, UNSEASONABLY.<BR>— (Particular time, occasion) समयः,<BR>कालः, समयविशेषः, विशेषकालः, वारः, वारुरः; ‘according to<BR>the time,’ समयानुसारेण; ‘auspicious time,’ सुवेला, शुभवेला;<BR>‘hard times,’ आपत्कालः; ‘dark times,’ कलिकालः; ‘from<BR>time to time,’ वारं वारं, काले काले, अनुवेलं.<BR>— (A time, with<BR>reference to repetition) कृत्वस् or वारं in comp., गुण in comp.,<BR>आवृत्ति in comp.; as, ‘five times,’ पञ्चकृत्वस्; ‘three times,’<BR>त्रिवारं, वारत्रयं; ‘a hundred times,’ शतकृत्वस्, शतगुणं; ‘for<BR>a thousand times,’ सहस्रकृत्वस्, सहस्रावृत्तिं; ‘often times,’ बहु-<BR>वारं; ‘how many times?’ कतिकृत्वस्; ‘the repetition of<BR>texts is a hundred times better than sacrifices,’ जपो यज्ञाद्<BR>दशगुणैर् विशिष्यते; ‘the second number is contained in the<BR>first as many times as the fourth in the third,’ द्वितीया<BR>संख्या प्रथमायां तावद्वारं वर्त्तते यावद्वारं चतुर्थी तृतीयायां; ‘gold is<BR>nineteen times as heavy as water,’ मुवर्णगुरुत्वं जलगुरुत्वमपेक्ष्य<BR>एकोनविंशतिगुणं.<BR>— (In music) तालः, लयः; ‘beating time,’<BR>तालः, कुलक्कः; ‘quick time,’ द्रुतं, ओघः; ‘slow time,’ विल-<BR>म्बितं, विलम्बितवृत्तिः f., तत्त्वं; ‘mean time,’ मध्यं, घनं; ‘out of<BR>time,’ वैतालिकः -की -कं.<BR>— (Measures of time), see under<BR>MEASURE.<BR>— (Time personified) कालः, उच्चदेवता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

time
To TIME, v. a. (Adapt to the time) कालयोग्यं -ग्यां कृ, कालोपयुक्तं<BR>-क्तां कृ, समयोपयुक्तं -क्तां कृ, कालानुरूपं कृ, कालसदृशं -शीं कृ.<BR>—<BR>(Regulate the time) कालं परिकॢप् or निर्णी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

timely
TIMELY, a. कालिकः -की -कं, कालीनः &c. See SEASONABLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

time-piece
TIME-PIECE, s. कालमापनयन्त्रं, कालयन्त्रं. See CLOCK.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

time-server
TIME-SERVER, s. कालानुवर्त्ती m. (न्), कालानुरोधी m., समयानुरोधी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

time-serving
TIME-SERVING, s. कालानुवर्त्तनं, समयानुवर्त्तनं, कालानुरोधः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=804-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

timid
