transpire
To TRANSPIRE, v. n. प्रसिद्धः -द्धा -द्धं भू, प्रसिद्धीभू प्रकाशः -शा -शं भू,<BR>प्रकाशीभू, प्रचलीभू, लोकविदितः -ता -तं भू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transplant
To TRANSPLANT, v. a. स्थानान्तरे रुह् in caus. (रोपयति -यितुं) or<BR>रोपणं कृ, उन्मूल्य स्थानान्तरे रुह् in caus., उन्मूल् (c. 10. -मूल-<BR>यति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transplanted
TRANSPLANTED, p. p. स्थानान्तरे रोपितः -ता -तं, उन्मूलितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transport
To TRANSPORT, v. a. (Convey, carry) तॄ (c. 10. तारयाते -यितुं), सन्तॄ,<BR>वह्, आवह्, संवह्, स्थानान्तरीकृ, आनी, see To CONVEY.<BR>— (As a<BR>criminal) विवस् (c. 10. -वासयति -यितुं), प्रवस्, निर्वस्, प्रव्रज् (c. 10.<BR>-व्राजयति -यितुं), देशान्तरीकृ, सागरपारे दूरीकृ, स्वदेशाद् दूरीकृ.<BR>—<BR>(Ravish), see the word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transport
TRANSPORT, s. (Conveyance) तारणं, सन्तारणं, वाहनं, आनयनं.<BR>—<BR>(Of passion) क्रोधावेशः, कोपावेशः.<BR>— (Rapture), see RAPTURE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transportation
TRANSPORTATION, s. विवासः -सनं, प्रवासः -सनं, निर्वासनं, विवासकरणं,<BR>प्रव्राजनं, सागरपारे दूरीकरणं, सन्तारणं, सन्तारकत्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transported
TRANSPORTED, p. p. (Conveyed) सन्तारितः -ता -तं, तारितः &c., आनीतः<BR>&c.<BR>— (Exiled) विवासितः &c.<BR>— (Enraptured), see the word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transpose
To TRANSPOSE, v. a. स्थानपरिवर्त्तनं कृ, स्थानविनिमयं कृ, स्थानविपर्य्ययं<BR>कृ, स्थानं परिवृत् (c. 10. -वर्त्तयति -यितुं), विपर्यस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transposed
TRANSPOSED, p. p. परिवर्त्तितः -ता -तं, विपर्यस्तः &c., व्यत्यस्तः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transposition
TRANSPOSITION, s. स्थानपरिवर्त्तनं, स्थानविनिमयः, स्थानविपर्य्ययः, व्यत्यासः,<BR>व्यत्ययः, विपर्य्ययः, विपर्य्यासः.<BR>— (In arithmetic) तुल्यशद्धिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transverse
TRANSVERSE, a. तिर्य्यङ् -श्ची -र्य्यक् (ञ्च्), व्यत्यस्तः -स्ता -स्तं, विपरीतः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

transversely
TRANSVERSELY, adv. तिर्य्यक्, व्यत्यस्तं, कोणाकोणि, विपरीतं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trap
TRAP, s. उन्माथः, कूटयन्त्रं, कूटः, पाशः, वागुरा, जालं, पञ्जराखेटः,<BR>नाहः, पातिली. See SNARE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trapezium
TRAPEZIUM, s. विषमचतुरस्रं, विषमचतुर्भुजः, विषमचतुष्कोणः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trappings
TRAPPINGS, s. pl. परिच्छदः, भूषणं, परिकर्म्म n., see FINERY.<BR>— (Of a<BR>horse or elephant) परिस्तोमः, वर्णः, आदानं, आस्तरः -रणं, प्रवे-<BR>णिः -णी f., कुथः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trash
TRASH, s. असारद्रव्यं, तुच्छद्रव्यं, कुत्सितद्रव्यं. See RUBBISH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

travail
TRAVAIL, To TRAVAIL, See under LABOR, To LABOR, v. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

travel
To TRAVEL, v. n. व्रज्, प्रव्रज्, देशभ्रमणं कृ, देशपर्यटनं कृ, देशाटनं कृ,<BR>अध्वना गम्, यात्रां कृ, चर्, विचर्. See To JOURNEY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

travel
TRAVEL, TRAVELING, s. अध्वगमनं, मार्गगमनं, देशभ्रमणं, भ्रमणं, परिभ्रमणं,<BR>पर्यटनं, देशपर्यटनं, अटनं, यात्रा, संयात्रा, व्रज्या, अटाट्या, मार्गक्रमणं,<BR>प्रवासः; ‘to return from travel,’ प्रवासाद् आगम्; ‘traveling-<BR>carriage,’ पारियानिकः; ‘companion,’ सहचरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

traveller
TRAVELLER, s. पथिकः, पान्थः, अध्वगः -गामी m. (न्), अध्वन्यः, अध्व-<BR>नीनः, यात्रिकः, पादविकः, सारणिकः, मार्गस्थः, पथिलः, गन्तुः m.,<BR>गमथः, यायी m. (न्), देशिकः, इत्वरः, प्रोथः, देशिकः, अध्वनि वर्त्त-<BR>मानः, परदेशसेवी m.; ‘a great traveller,’ बहुदेशदर्शी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

traverse
