TRAVERSED, p. p. अतिक्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, तीर्णः &c., पारगतः &c., पारमितः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

travesty
