TRAY, s. पात्रं, भाजनं, शरावः, द्रोणिः -णी f., आधारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

treacherous
TREACHEROUS, a. विश्वासघाती &c., मिथ्याप्रतिज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं, विसंवादी<BR>&c., असत्यसन्धः -न्धा -न्धं, अविश्वास्यः &c., see PERFIDIOUS, FAITHLESS.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=810-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

