treatise
TREATISE, s. निबन्धः, प्रबन्धः, ग्रन्थः, लेखः, शास्त्रं, पुस्तकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

treatment
TREATMENT, s. प्रणयनं, प्रणीतिः f., नयः, आचरणं, प्रयोगः, प्रयुक्तिः f.,<BR>उपायप्रयोगः; ‘of disease,’ उपचारः, चिकित्सा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

