tremble
To TREMBLE, v. n. कम्प् (c. 1. कम्पते -म्पितुं), वेप् (c. 1. वेपते -पितुं),<BR>स्फुर् (c. 6. स्फुरति -रितुं), चपल (nom. चपलायते). See To QUIVER,<BR>SHAKE, v. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trembling
