TREMULOUSNESS, s. लोलता, चञ्चलता, चपलता, सकम्पता -त्वं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

