TRIAD, s. त्रिकं, त्रयं -यी; ‘the Hindū triad,’ त्रिमूर्त्तिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trial
TRIAL, s. (Testing, proving) परीक्षा -क्षणं, अनुभवः, see TEST;<BR>‘under trial,’ अनुभूयमानः -ना -नं; ‘subjected to trial,’ अनुभ-<BR>वारूढः -ढा -ढं.<BR>— (Experience) अनुभवः, अनुभूतिः f., प्रतीतिः f.<BR>—<BR>(Attempt) यत्नः, प्रयत्नः, उद्योगः.<BR>— (Judicial trial) विचारः,<BR>व्यवहारदर्शनं, धर्ग्मविवेचनं; ‘day of trial,’ विचारदिनं, आह्वान-<BR>दर्शनं.<BR>— (Affliction, calamity), see the words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=811-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

