TRIBRACH, s. (Foot of three short syllables) ताण्डवः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=812-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tribulation
TRIBULATION, s. क्लेशः, दुःखं, सङ्कटं. See DISTRESS, TROUBLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=812-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

