truckle
To TRUCKLE, v. n. अत्यनुरोधं कृ, छन्दोनुरोधं कृ, छन्दोनुवृत्तिं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

truculent
TRUCULENT, a. क्रूरः -रा -रं, निष्ठुरः &c. See SAVAGE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trudge
To TRUDGE, v. n. पादाभ्यां व्रज् or चर्, आयासेन व्रज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

true
TRUE, a. (Not false) सत्यः -त्या -त्यं, तथ्यः -थ्या -थ्यं, यथार्थः -र्था -र्थं,<BR>सम्यङ् -मीची -म्यक् (क्), समीचीनः -ना -नं, ऋतः -ता -तं, सत्यवान्<BR>-वती &c., उपपन्नः -न्ना -न्नं, सिद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, see GENUINE, REAL,<BR>EXACT; ‘true and false,’ सदसत्; ‘it is very true,’ युक्तं,<BR>युज्यते, उपपन्नं.<BR>— (True to obligations, keeping faith) सत्य-<BR>प्रतिज्ञः -ज्ञा -ज्ञं, सत्यसन्धः -न्धा -न्धं, सत्यशीलः -ला -लं, सत्यव्रतः -ता<BR>-तं, see HONEST, FAITHFUL.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trueness
TRUENESS, s. सत्यता, तथ्यता, यथार्थता, सम्यक्त्वं. See TRUTH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

truism
