trumpeter
TRUMPETER, s. तूरीवादकः, रणतूरीवादकः, तूरीध्मः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

truncheon
TRUNCHEON, s. गदा, यष्टिः m., दण्डः. See CLUB, CUDGEL.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trundle
To TRUNDLE, v. a. and n. See To ROLL, v. a. and n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trunk
TRUNK, s. (Of a tree) स्कन्धः, प्रकाण्डः -ण्डं, काण्डः -ण्डं, गण्डिः m.;<BR>‘of a lopped tree,’ स्थाणुः m. -णु n., ध्रुवः, शङ्कुः m.<BR>— (Of the<BR>body) शरीरकाण्डः -ण्डं; ‘headless trunk,’ कबन्धः, अपमूर्द्धक-<BR>लेवरं.<BR>— (Main body) मुख्यभागः.<BR>— (Of an elephant) शुण्डा,<BR>शुण्डादण्डः, हस्तः, करः, भुजः.<BR>— (Chest, box) भाण्डं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

truss
TRUSS, s. (Of hay, &c.) तृणकूर्च्चः, तृणभारः, तृणगुच्छः.<BR>— (Bandage)<BR>पट्टः -ट्टकः, कवलिका, आधारः, बन्धनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

truss
To TRUSS, v. a. सम्बन्ध्, कूर्च्चीकृ, कील् (c. 10. कीलयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trust
TRUST, s. (Confidence) विश्वासः, प्रत्ययः, विश्रम्भः, निष्ठा, समाश्वासः,<BR>सम्प्रसादं, see CONFIDENCE, RELIANCE; ‘breach of trust,’<BR>विश्वासभङ्गः, विश्वासघातः, प्रत्ययभङ्गः, प्रणयभङ्गः.<BR>— (Charge) न्यासः,<BR>निक्षेपः.<BR>— (Credit) कालिका, उद्धारः; ‘to buy on trust,’ उद्धारं कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trust
To TRUST, v. a. (Confide in) विश्वस् (c. 2. -श्वसिति -तुं), समाश्वस्,<BR>see To CONFIDE, v. n.<BR>— (Commit in confidence) समृ in caus.,<BR>see To INTRUST.<BR>— (Sell on credit) उद्धारं दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trust
To TRUST, v. n. (Be confident) प्रत्याशां कृ, दृढप्रत्याशां कृ, निश्चयं कृ,<BR>दृढप्रत्ययं कृ, आशां कृ, विश्वासं कृ, निःसन्देहः -हा -हं भू.<BR>— (Rely<BR>on) विश्वस्, see To RELY, CONFIDE, v. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trusted
TRUSTED, p. p. विश्वस्तः -स्ता -स्तं, विश्वसितः &c. See CONFIDED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

trustee
TRUSTEE, s. न्यासधारी m. (न्), निक्षेपधारी m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

