TRUSTING, part. विश्वासी -सिनी &c., विश्वस्तः &c., see CONFIDING;<BR>‘trusting to the strength of one's own arm,’ स्वबाहुबलमा-<BR>श्रितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=813-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

