tuft
TUFT, s. शिखा, शिखरः -रं, चूडा, शेखरः, स्तवकः, पल्लवः, अवतंसः,<BR>see CLUMP, CLUSTER, BUNCH; ‘of mangoes,’ आम्रपल्लवः; ‘of<BR>hair,’ चूडा, केशपिण्डः, लोमपिण्डः, लोमगुच्छकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=814-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

