TUFTED, a. चूडावान् -वती -वत् (त्), चूडालः -ला -लं, शिखी -खिनी<BR>-खि (न्), शिखरी -रिणी &c., शेखरितः -ता -तं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=814-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tug
