tuition
TUITION, s. उपदेशः, शिक्षा, अध्यापनं, शैप्योपाध्यायिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=814-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tumble
