tutelary
TUTELARY, a. रक्षकः -का -कं, पालकः &c., रक्षणकारी -रिणी &c.;<BR>‘a tutelary deity,’ लोकपालः -लकः, इष्टदेवता, अधिदेवता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=815-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tutenag
TUTENAG, s. (Metal) तुत्थं, तुत्थकं, तुत्थाञ्जनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=815-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

