twang
TWANG, s. (Of a bow, &c.) विस्फारः, विष्फारः, स्फारः, ज्याघोषः,<BR>ज्याक्वणितं, टङ्कारः, टः.<BR>— (Sharp sound) झनत्कारः, क्वणितं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=815-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

twang
To TWANG, v. a. क्वण् (c. 10. क्वणयति -यितुं), रण् (c. 10. रणयति -यितुं),<BR>‘he twangs his lute,’ वीणां रणयति; ‘his bow,’ धनुर् विस्फारयति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=815-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

twang
