TWELVE, a. द्वादश m. f. n. pl. (न्), द्वादशकः -का -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=815-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

