UNCULTIVATED, a. अप्रहतः -ता -तं, अकृतः &c., खिलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

