undecaying
UNDECAYING, a. अक्षयः -या -यं, अव्ययः &c., see IMPERISHABLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

