UNDECIDED, a. अनिश्चितः -ता -तं, अनिर्णीतः &c., अकृतनिश्चयः -या -यं,<BR>अकृतसङ्कल्पः &c.<BR>— (Irresolute) सन्दिग्धमानसः &c., see the word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

