UNDER-DONE, a. अपक्वः -क्वा -क्वं, आपक्वः &c., आमः -मा -मं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

undergarment
UNDERGARMENT, s. अधोवसनं, अधोशुंकं, अन्तरीयं, अन्तर्वासस् n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

undergo
