underground
UNDERGROUND, adv. भूम्यधस्, भूम्यधस्तात्, भूतलाधस्तात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

underground
UNDERGROUND, a. अन्तर्भौमः -मी -मं, भूम्यधःस्थः -स्था -स्थं, भूम्यधोगतः<BR>-ता -तं, अन्तर्भूमिस्थः &c. See SUBTERRANEAN.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

