To UNDERTAKE, v. a. व्यवसो (c. 4. -स्यति -सातुं), अध्यवसो, आरभ्<BR>(c. 1. -रभते -रब्धुं), समारभ्, उपक्रम् (c. 1. -क्रमते -मितुं), अनुष्ठा,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=819-a" target="_blank">Page819-a+ 51</a>]<BR>आस्था, स्वीकृ, अङ्गीकृ, कृ, प्रवृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=818-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

