UNUTTERABLE, a. वाग्विभवातिवृत्तः -त्ता -त्तं. See INEXPRESSIBLE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwary
UNWARY, a. अनवधानः -ना -नं, निरपेक्षः -क्षा -क्षं, प्रमादी -दिनी &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwavering
UNWAVERING, a. अविचलः -ला -लं, निश्चलः &c. See FIRM, CONSTANT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwearied
UNWEARIED, a. अश्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, अविषादः &c. See INDEFATIGABLF.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwelcome
UNWELCOME, a. अनिष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं, अप्रियः -या -यं, दुरागतः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwell
UNWELL, a. अस्वस्थः -स्था -स्थं, असुस्थः &c. See under ILL, a.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwholesome
UNWHOLESOME, a. अपथ्यः -थ्या -थ्यं, कुपथ्यः &c., अपथ्यकारकः -का<BR>-कं, असात्म्यः -त्म्या -त्म्यं, रुजाकरः -रा -रं, गरदः -दा -दं, विषमः -मा<BR>-मं, विरुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, see INSALUBRIOUS; ‘food,’ अपथ्यं; ‘eater<BR>of it,’ अपथ्याशी m. (न्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwholesomeness
UNWHOLESOMENESS, s. अपथ्यता, असाम्यं. See INSALUBRITY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwieldy
UNWIELDY, a. स्थूलः -ला -लं, अतिस्थूलः &c., अतिभारी -रिणी &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwilling
UNWILLING, a. अनिच्छुः -च्छुः -च्छु, अनिच्छन् -च्छन्ती -च्छत् (त्), नि-<BR>ष्कामः -मा -मं, विमुखः -खा -खं, पराङ्मुखः &c. See RELUCTANT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

