To UNWIND, v. a. उद्ग्रन्थ्, समुद्ग्रन्थ्. See To UNRAVEL.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unwise
UNWISE, a. निर्बुद्धिः -द्धिः -द्धि, अविद्वान् &c. See FOOLISH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=823-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

