UPHELD, p. p. उत्तम्भितः -ता -तं, आलम्बितः &c., समुद्धतः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uphill
UPHILL, a. उद्गम्यः -म्या -म्यं, उद्गमनीयः &c., आरोहणीयः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uphold
To UPHOLD, v. a. उत्तम्भ्, आलम्ब्, धृ, सन्धृ. See To SUPPORT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upholsterer
UPHOLSTERER, s. गृहसज्जाविक्रेता m. (तृ), गृहोपस्करकर्त्ता m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

