UPLIFTED, a. उद्यतः -ता -तं, उच्छ्रितः &c., अभ्युच्छ्रितः &c., ऊर्द्ध्व or उत्<BR>in comp., see RAISED; ‘with uplifted arm,’ उद्बाहुः -हुः -हु,<BR>ऊर्द्ध्वबाहुः &c.; ‘with uplifted sword,’ उन्नमितखङ्गः, see RAISED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

