UPRAISED, a. उन्नमितः -ता -तं, उन्नतः &c., उद्धृतः &c., उत्क्षिप्तः &c.,<BR>समुद्धूतः &c., see RAISED; ‘as the eyelid,’ उत्पक्ष्मलः -ला -लं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upright
UPRIGHT, a. (Erect) उन्नतः -ता -तं, ऋजुः -जुः -जु, ऋजुकः &c., see<BR>ERECT; ‘standing upright,’ दण्डः, दण्डवत् स्थायी -यिनी &c.,<BR>दण्डायमानः -ना -नं.<BR>— (In character) सरलः -ला -लं, सच्चरितः -ता<BR>-तं, शुद्धमतिः &c., सत्यात्मा &c., see JUST, HONEST.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uprightly
UPRIGHTLY, adv. (Erectly) दण्डवत्, ऋजु, आर्जवेन, see JUSTLY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

