UPRIGHTNESS, s. ऋजुता, आर्जवं, दाक्षिण्यं. See INTEGRITY.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

