uproot
To UPROOT, v. a. उन्मूल्, समुन्मूल्. See To ROOT UP.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upset
To UPSET, v. a. पर्यस्, परावृत्, परिवृत्. See To OVERTURN.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upset
UPSET, s. पर्यासः, परिवर्त्तनं, see OVERTURN; ‘of a boat,’ नौमज्जनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

