UPSIDE-DOWN, a. अधोमुखः -खी -खं, अधरोत्तरः &c., ऊर्द्ध्वाधरः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upstart
UPSTART, s. आगन्तुकः, आगन्तुः m., नवश्रीमान् m. (त्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

upward
UPWARD, UPWARDS, adv. ऊर्द्ध्वं, उच्चैः, उच्चकैः, उपरि, उपर्य्युपरि; ‘with<BR>feet upwards;’ ऊर्द्ध्वपादः -दा -दं.<BR>— (More than) अधिकं, परं;<BR>‘upwards of a thousand,’ परःसहस्रः -स्रा -स्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=824-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

