valorous
VALOROUS, a. विक्रान्तः -न्ता -न्तं, शूरः -रा -रं. See VALIANT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

valuaele
VALUAELE, a. महामूल्यः -ल्या -ल्यं, बहुमूल्यः &c., महार्घः -र्घा -र्घं, अर्घ्यः<BR>-र्घ्या -र्घ्यं, अर्घार्हः -र्हा -र्हं, महार्हः &c., बहुमानयितव्यः -व्या -व्यं, महो-<BR>पकारकः &c., गुणवान् -वती -वत् (त्). See PRECIOUS.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

valuation
VALUATION, s. मूल्यनिरूपणं, मूल्यस्थापनं -ना, अर्घस्थापनं -ना, मूल्यप्रमा-<BR>णस्थापनं, अर्घपरिमाणनिरूपणं, मूल्यनिर्णयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

value
VALUE, s. (Price) मूल्यं, अर्घः, see PRICE.<BR>— (Degree of price)<BR>मूल्यप्रमाणं, अर्घप्रमाणं, मूल्यपरिमाणं, अर्घमितिः f., मितिः f., see RATE.<BR>— (High rate or estimation) महामूल्यं, बहुमूल्यं, महार्घः, बहु-<BR>मानं, बहुमतिः f.<BR>— (Real worth) सारता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

value
To VALUE, v. a. मूल्यं निरूप् or स्था in caus., see To RATE<BR>—<BR>(Esteem) मन् (c. 10. मानयति -यितुं), see To ESTEEM; ‘highly,’<BR>बहु मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

valued
VALUED, p. p. or a. बहुमतः -ता -तं, बहुमानितः &c., सम्मानितः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

valve
VALVE, s. कपाटः, कपाटयुक्तद्वारं, पिधानं, सपिधानद्वारं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

vampire
VAMPIRE, s. राक्षसः, पिशाचः. See DEMON.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

van
VAN, s. (Of an army, &c.) सनामुख, ध्वजिनीमुखं, सेनाग्रं, रणमूर्द्धा m.<BR>(न्), समरमूर्द्धा m., नासीरं, धारः, शिरस् n.; ‘in the van,’ सेना-<BR>मुखे, अग्रतस्, अग्रे, पुरस्तात, पुरतस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

