vanished
VANISHED, p. p. अन्तर्हितः -ता -तं, नष्टः -ष्टा -ष्टं. See DISAPPEARED.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

vanity
VANITY, s. (Emptiness, fruitlessness) शून्यता, रिक्तता, निःसारता<BR>व्यर्थता, निरर्थकता, वैयर्थ्यं, मोघता; ‘music, dancing, and such<BR>like vanity,’ तूर्य्यवादित्रनृत्यादि असत्कार्य्यं.<BR>— (Conceit) अहङ्कारः,<BR>आत्माभिमानं, अभिमानं, अहम्मानं, अहम्मतिः f., मानं, गर्व्वः, see CONCEIT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

vanquish
