variable
VARIABLE, a. अस्थिरः -रा -रं, अनवस्थः -स्था -स्थं, चञ्चलः -ला -लं,<BR>विषमः -मा -मं, अनित्यः &c., अनवस्थानः &c. See INCONSTANT.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

variableness
VARIABLENESS, s. अस्थिरता, वैषम्यं, विषमता, चाञ्चल्यं, वैरूप्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

variance
VARIANCE, s. भेदः, द्वैधं, विरोधः, वैमनस्यं, see DIFFERENCE, s.; ‘at<BR>variance,’ परस्परविरुद्धः -द्धा -द्धं, विप्रतिपन्नः -न्ना -न्नं, विमतः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

variation
VARIATION, s. भेदः, परिवृत्तिः f., विकारः, अन्यथात्वं. See CHANGE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=826-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

variegate
