venus
VENUS, s. (In mythology) रतिः f., see RATI.<BR>— (The planet) शुक्रः,<BR>उशनाः m. (स्), भृगुः m., भार्गवः, कविः m., काव्यः, श्वेतः, श्वेतरथः,<BR>बोडशांशः m., मघाभवः, आस्फुजित् m., दैत्यगुरुः m. Śukra, the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=828-b" target="_blank">Page828-b+ 51</a>]<BR>regent^1 of the planet Venus, is fabled as the son of Bhṛgu,<BR>and preceptor of the Daityas or demons.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=828-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

