VESPERS, s. सायम्पूजा, सायम्भजनं, सन्ध्यापूजा, सन्ध्याभजनं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=829-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

