vestibule
VESTIBULE, s. देहली -लिः f., निष्काशः. See PORCH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=829-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

