VINEGAR, s. अम्लरसः, शुक्तं, शुक्तरसः, शौक्तिकं, चुक्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

