VINOUS, a. द्राक्षामद्यगुणकः -का -कं, सौरिकः -की -कं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

vintage
VINTAGE, s. (Produce of the vine) द्राक्षोत्पन्नफलं, एकसमये द्राक्षो-<BR>त्यादितफलं.<BR>— (Season of gathering it) द्राक्षाफलसंग्रहकालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

vintner
VINTNER, s. मद्यविक्रयजीवी m. (न्), मद्यविक्रेता m. (तृ), द्राक्षारसवि-<BR>क्रेता m., सुराजीवी m., शौण्डिकः, शुण्डारः, ध्वजवान m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

violate
To VIOLATE, v. a. लङ्घ् (c. 10. लङ्घयति -यितुं), अतिक्रम्, अतिचर्, लुप्,<BR>see To TRANSGRESS, INFRINGE.<BR>— (Ravish) धृष् (c. 10. -धर्षयति -यितुं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

violation
VIOLATION, s. लङ्घनं, लोपः -पनं, अतिक्रमः, व्यतिक्रमः; ‘of a vow,’<BR>व्रतलोपनं; ‘of a law,’ see INFRINGEMENT.<BR>— (Rape), see RAPE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=830-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

violator
