WARRANTY, s. निर्दोषपत्रं, निश्छिद्रपत्रं, प्रमाणपत्रं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=835-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

warren
WARREN, s. शशकालयः, शशकस्थानं, शशकाश्रयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=835-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

warrior
WARRIOR, s. (Soldier) योद्धा m. (द्धृ), योधः, युयुधानः, प्रहारी m., see<BR>SOLDIER.<BR>— (Hero) भटः, सुभटः, वीरः, रथी m., स्यन्दनारोहः, रण-<BR>पण्डितः, विक्रान्तः, जाजी m., जजः, see HERO.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=835-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

