wedge
To WEDGE, v. a. संहन्, सम्पीड्, सम्बाध्, बाध्, सम्मृद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=837-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

