weigh
To WEIGH, v. a. (In a balance) तुल् (c. 10. तुलयति -यितुं), तूल्<BR>(c. 10. तूलयति -यितुं), तोलनं कृ, तुलनां कृ.<BR>— (Raise, as an<BR>anchor, &c.) उत्तुल्.<BR>— (Ponder) विगण् (c. 10. -गणयति -यितुं),<BR>मनसा विचर्, see To PONDER; ‘to weigh alternatives,’<BR>विकॢप् (c. 10. -कल्पयति -यितुं). ‘Weighs upon,’ विडम्बयति;<BR>‘weighs down,’ see To OUTWEIGH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

