weight
WEIGHT, s. (Weight or quantity ascertained by balance)<BR>भारः, भारपरिमाणं, उन्मानं, मितिः f., परिमाणं, भारमितिः f., तोलः,<BR>तुला, गुरुत्वं -ता, गौरवं, गरिमा m. (न्), भरः; ‘of deficient<BR>weight,’ न्यूनतोलः -ला -लं.<BR>— (Mass to weigh with) तोलं,<BR>उन्मानं. For the different weights, see under MEASURE;<BR>‘measure by weight,’ तुलामानं.<BR>— (Ponderous load, burden)<BR>भारः, धुरा, धूः f. (धुर्), see BURDEN.<BR>— (Importance, influence)<BR>गौरवं, गुरुत्वं -ता, प्रभावः, भारः, प्रमाणं; ‘of little weight,’<BR>अल्पप्रभावः -वा -वं, अल्पप्रमाणः -णा -णं, लघुप्रभावः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=838-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

