willingness
WILLINGNESS, s. सकामत्वं, इच्छुता, इच्छुकत्वं, सानुरागता, सम्मतिः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=842-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

wily
