win
To WIN, v. a. (Gain by conquest) जि (c. 1. जयति, जेतुं), निर्जि,<BR>प्रतिजि.<BR>— (Gain, obtain) अर्ज्, प्राप्, लभ्, see To OBTAIN.<BR>— (Win<BR>over) आराध् (c. 10. -राधयति -यितुं), अनुरञ्ज्, प्रसाध्, संग्रह्, see<BR>To CONCILIATE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=842-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

wince
