wood-land
WOOD-LAND, s. वृक्षावृतभूमिः f., तरुगुल्मावृतभूमिः f. -भूः f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

woodman
