WOOD-NYMPH, s. वनदेवता, वनदेवी, अरण्यदेवता -देवी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

wood-pecker
WOOD-PECKER, s. दार्वाघाटः, दार्वाघातः, काष्ठकुट्टः, शतपत्रकः, शतच्छदः,<BR>भद्रनामा m. (न्), कुठाकुः m., कुठारुः m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=844-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

