woody
WOODY, a. (Abounding with wood) बहुवृक्षावृतः -ता -तं, वृक्षाकीर्णः<BR>-र्णा -र्णं, प्रचुरवृक्षः -क्षा -क्षं, वार्क्षः -र्क्षी -र्क्षं.<BR>— (Ligneous) काष्ठमयः<BR>-यी -यं.<BR>— (Silvan) आरण्यकः &c., see SILVAN.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

wooer
WOOER, s. विवाहार्थप्रार्थकः, विवाहार्थयाचकः, स्त्र्युपासकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

woof
WOOF, s. (In weaving) वाणिः -णी f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=845-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

