attack
ATTACK, s. अधिक्रमः -मणं; ‘of any disease,’ अवतारः, अवतरणं, आवेशः;<BR>‘of fever,’ आतपलङ्घनं; ‘first attack of disease,’ पूर्व्वावतरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

attempt
