ATTORNEY, s. प्रतिनिधिः m. ATTRACTION, s. अनुकर्षः, आक्षेपः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

attribute
ATTRIBUTE, s. उपाधिः m., धर्म्मः. The eight divine attributes,<BR>or the attributes of Śiva as the deity, are: 1. Minuteness,<BR>अणिमा m.; 2. Greatness, महिमा m.; 3. Heaviness, गरिमा m.;<BR>4. Lightness, लघिमा m.; 5. The power of reaching every<BR>thing, प्राप्तिः f.; 6. Supremacy, ईशिता; 7. Holding in sub-<BR>jection, वशिता; 8. Irresistible will, प्राकाम्यं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=852-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

