barren
BARREN, a. (As a woman) अनपत्या, अनपत्यका, अजातापत्या, अप्र-<BR>जाता. The Hindūs divide barren women into three<BR>classes, viz. 1. ‘She who has no offspring,’ बन्ध्या; 2. ‘She<BR>who bears only one child,’ काकबन्ध्या; 3. ‘She whose off-<BR>spring die,’ मृतबन्ध्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=853-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

