bead
BEAD, s. अक्षः, मणिः -णी m. f.; ‘necklace of beads,’ मणिमाला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=853-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

