fever
FEVER, s. (Arising from vitiation of the humour bile) पित्त-<BR>ज्वरः.<BR>— (Of the humour phlegm) कफज्वरः.<BR>— (Of the humour<BR>wind) अतज्वरः.<BR>— (Of the three humours) त्रिदोषात्मकज्वरः.<BR>—<BR>(Of the bile and wind) पित्तवातज्वरः.<BR>— (Of the bile and<BR>phlegm) पित्तकफज्वरः.<BR>— (With ague) शीतज्वरः; ‘illusions of<BR>f.,’ ज्वरसृष्टिः f.; ‘inflammatory f.,’ दाहज्वरः; ‘slow f.,’ जीर्णज्वरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=857-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

figure
FIGURE, s. (In geometry) क्षेत्रं.<BR>— (In arithmetic) अङ्कः; ‘figures,’<BR>अङ्कविद्या.<BR>— (Emblem) प्रतिरूपं, प्रतिविम्बं.<BR>— (In rhetoric) अल-<BR>ङ्कारः. The following are some of the common figures<BR>in rhetoric: ‘Simile,’ उपमा; ‘Breaking the natural order<BR>of words in a sentence,’ अनन्वयः; ‘Identification of the<BR>objects of a comparison,’ रूपकं; ‘Irony,’ आक्षेपः; ‘Allite-<BR>ration,’ अनुप्रासः; ‘Comparison,’ उत्प्रेक्षा; ‘Hyperbole,’ अति-<BR>शयोक्तिः f.; ‘Explanation of any peculiar condition, by<BR>coupling cause with effect,’ विशेषोक्तिः f.; ‘Dilating upon<BR>an idea, or accumulating expressions to throw light on<BR>an idea.’ दीपकं; ‘Dissimilitude of things compared in<BR>some respect to each other,’ व्यतिरेकः; ‘Describing the<BR>past or future as present,’ भाविकं; ‘Inverse comparison,<BR>or comparing new objects with some known object, as<BR>the moon, &c.,’ प्रतीपं; ‘Identity of objects compared to<BR>one another,’ समं; ‘Connexion of different objects by<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=857-b" target="_blank">Page857-b+ 50</a>]<BR>common properties,’ सामान्यं; ‘Punning on words,’ श्लेषः;<BR>‘Climax,’ सारं; ‘Rhetorical use of the word without,’ वि-<BR>नोक्तिः f.; ‘Rhetorical use of the word with or along with,’<BR>सहोक्तिः f.; ‘Change,’ परिणामः; ‘Recollection,’ स्मृतिः f.;<BR>‘Mistake,’ भ्रान्तिः f.; ‘Doubt,’ सन्देहः; ‘Applying a simile<BR>to other than its obvious application,’ अपह्नुतिः f. And the<BR>following, the meaning of which is doubtful, प्रासः, उल्लेखः,<BR>तुल्ययोगिता, चर्वणा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MWE&page=857-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mwe" target="_blank">Correction</a>

